            "text": "[{\"type\":0,\"content\":\"I have done any% no slot yes\",\"mentions\":[],\"mention_roles\":[],\"attachments\":[],\"embeds\":[],\"timestamp\":\"2024-11-18T03:16:49.921000+00:00\",\"edited_timestamp\":null,\"flags\":0,\"components\":[],\"id\":\"1307907341349294131\",\"channel_id\":\"1288235003901120586\",\"author\":{\"id\":\"309356817169776641\",\"username\":\".rendall\",\"avatar\":\"92721b514158fd7d7a9ea5e1768da748\",\"discriminator\":\"0\",\"public_flags\":512,\"flags\":512,\"banner\":null,\"accent_color\":null,\"global_name\":\"Rendall\",\"avatar_decoration_data\":null,\"collectibles\":null,\"display_name_styles\":null,\"banner_color\":null,\"clan\":null,\"primary_guild\":null},\"pinned\":false,\"mention_everyone\":false,\"tts\":false,\"position\":1366},{\"type\":0,\"content\":\"Have you ran a speedrun of ff7? <@309356817169776641>\",\"mentions\":[{\"id\":\"309356817169776641\",\"username\":\".rendall\",\"avatar\":\"92721b514158fd7d7a9ea5e1768da748\",\"discriminator\":\"0\",\"public_flags\":512,\"flags\":512,\"banner\":null,\"accent_color\":null,\"global_name\":\"Rendall\",\"avatar_decoration_data\":null,\"collectibles\":null,\"display_name_styles\":null,\"banner_color\":null,\"clan\":null,\"primary_guild\":null}],\"mention_roles\":[],\"attachments\":[],\"embeds\":[],\"timestamp\":\"2024-11-18T03:16:25.854000+00:00\",\"edited_timestamp\":null,\"flags\":0,\"components\":[],\"id\":\"1307907240405106738\",\"channel_id\":\"1288235003901120586\",\"author\":{\"id\":\"248225699909861376\",\"username\":\"awesomewaves\",\"avatar\":\"7de794a8a3e242252076a10784af0a9f\",\"discriminator\":\"0\",\"public_flags\":0,\"flags\":0,\"banner\":null,\"accent_color\":null,\"global_name\":\"awesomeWaves\",\"avatar_decoration_data\":null,\"collectibles\":null,\"display_name_styles\":null,\"banner_color\":null,\"clan\":null,\"primary_guild\":null},\"pinned\":false,\"mention_everyone\":false,\"tts\":false,\"position\":1365},{\"type\":19,\"content\":\"yeah figured as much, Still feel like some off it could go ! of course I have a very bad opinion of the recording playback to begin with but understand people need time to review the recording , slow it down and load the cheat sheet and fill it in to have a clue and this CSR is for the purpose of any% no slot% currently. I demand a complete CSR ! you runner chasing rng can just adjust w/o the cut scene and use the stair now !  (joking of course) cheers !\",\"mentions\":[{\"id\":\"385844703091884033\",\"username\":\"phek1200\",\"avatar\":\"defa3ccf4c743532ee4492eeeabde14c\",\"discriminator\":\"0\",\"public_flags\":0,\"flags\":0,\"banner\":null,\"accent_color\":null,\"global_name\":\"phek1200\",\"avatar_decoration_data\":null,\"collectibles\":null,\"display_name_styles\":null,\"banner_color\":null,\"clan\":null,\"primary_guild\":null}],\"mention_roles\":[],\"attachments\":[],\"embeds\":[],\"timestamp\":\"2024-11-18T03:14:06.484000+00:00\",\"edited_timestamp\":null,\"flags\":0,\"components\":[],\"id\":\"1307906655844962416\",\"channel_id\":\"1288235003901120586\",\"author\":{\"id\":\"309356817169776641\",\"username\":\".rendall\",\"avatar\":\"92721b514158fd7d7a9ea5e1768da748\",\"discriminator\":\"0\",\"public_flags\":512,\"flags\":512,\"banner\":null,\"accent_color\":null,\"global_name\":\"Rendall\",\"avatar_decoration_data\":null,\"collectibles\":null,\"display_name_styles\":null,\"banner_color\":null,\"clan\":null,\"primary_guild\":null},\"pinned\":false,\"mention_everyone\":false,\"tts\":false,\"message_reference\":{\"type\":0,\"channel_id\":\"1288235003901120586\",\"message_id\":\"1307899743594348625\",\"guild_id\":\"936291902133796955\"},\"position\":1364,\"referenced_message\":{\"type\":19,\"content\":\"we record the fountain glow during cover and ether pick up all the way to entering Elmyra house. only after entering the house and clear out some of the initial text boxes, there is a ~1min scene of flashback where Elmyra is waiting for the husband at the train station, that is where we will playback the recording at 0.25 speed, write down the pattern and identify the current List value we're on.\\nso to do elevator manip, this part needs to be available as well. if need trimming down, we can always trim down half (the 2nd half of it). the whole cutscene is about 2.5mins, normally we'd be done by the first 1 min, however if i run on PSX disc, due to inconsistencies of ps2 graphics sometimes i struggle to find the fountain glow pattern and need to do it 2-3 times, which will take up the entire cutscene.\\ni think to keep it standardize, we keep it as is\",\"mentions\":[{\"id\":\"309356817169776641\",\"username\":\".rendall\",\"avatar\":\"92721b514158fd7d7a9ea5e1768da748\",\"discriminator\":\"0\",\"public_flags\":512,\"flags\":512,\"banner\":null,\"accent_color\":null,\"global_name\":\"Rendall\",\"avatar_decoration_data\":null,\"collectibles\":null,\"display_name_styles\":null,\"banner_color\":null,\"clan\":null,\"primary_guild\":null}],\"mention_roles\":[],\"attachments\":[],\"embeds\":[],\"timestamp\":\"2024-11-18T02:46:38.475000+00:00\",\"edited_timestamp\":\"2024-11-18T02:57:26.235000+00:00\",\"flags\":0,\"components\":[],\"id\":\"1307899743594348625\",\"channel_id\":\"1288235003901120586\",\"author\":{\"id\":\"385844703091884033\",\"username\":\"phek1200\",\"avatar\":\"defa3ccf4c743532ee4492eeeabde14c\",\"discriminator\":\"0\",\"public_flags\":0,\"flags\":0,\"banner\":null,\"accent_color\":null,\"global_name\":\"phek1200\",\"avatar_decoration_data\":null,\"collectibles\":null,\"display_name_styles\":null,\"banner_color\":null,\"clan\":null,\"primary_guild\":null},\"pinned\":false,\"mention_everyone\":false,\"tts\":false,\"message_reference\":{\"type\":0,\"channel_id\":\"1288235003901120586\",\"message_id\":\"1307831638960373782\",\"guild_id\":\"936291902133796955\"},\"position\":1362}},{\"type\":0,\"content\":\"i finished a run last night (v0.5.3) with a time 4h 20m <:Kappa:1075235124200886273> \\nam writing some of my feedback / comments but i would say generally everything good so far. really great work on this CSR  \\n\\nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=hszz1VB5ELk\",\"mentions\":[],\"mention_roles\":[],\"attachments\":[],\"embeds\":[{\"type\":\"video\",\"url\":\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=hszz1VB5ELk\",\"title\":\"FF7 CSR v0.5.3 - No Slots% Digital - 4h 20m 33s\",\"color\":16711680,\"author\":{\"name\":\"Phekwei1200\",\"url\":\"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCjJO-hh-y2EIo4DANk0z3qw\"},\"provider\":{\"name\":\"YouTube\",\"url\":\"https://www.youtube.com\"},\"thumbnail\":{\"url\":\"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/hszz1VB5ELk/maxresdefault.jpg\",\"proxy_url\":\"https://images-ext-1.discordapp.net/external/TpiLJ3hA5139C6ATOnXo20PmUdHZBBLsaypJtSzSiOM/https/i.ytimg.com/vi/hszz1VB5ELk/maxresdefault.jpg\",\"width\":1280,\"height\":720,\"content_type\":\"image/jpeg\",\"placeholder\":\"SPcFHILQcVZ7eHhWeWYvSvdBSg==\",\"placeholder_version\":1,\"flags\":0},\"video\":{\"url\":\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/hszz1VB5ELk\",\"width\":1280,\"height\":720,\"placeholder\":\"SPcFHILQcVZ7eHhWeWYvSvdBSg==\",\"placeholder_version\":1,\"flags\":0},\"content_scan_version\":4}],\"timestamp\":\"2024-11-18T02:47:25.202000+00:00\",\"edited_timestamp\":null,\"flags\":0,\"components\":[],\"id\":\"1307899939581460542\",\"channel_id\":\"1288235003901120586\",\"author\":{\"id\":\"385844703091884033\",\"username\":\"phek1200\",\"avatar\":\"defa3ccf4c743532ee4492eeeabde14c\",\"discriminator\":\"0\",\"public_flags\":0,\"flags\":0,\"banner\":null,\"accent_color\":null,\"global_name\":\"phek1200\",\"avatar_decoration_data\":null,\"collectibles\":null,\"display_name_styles\":null,\"banner_color\":null,\"clan\":null,\"primary_guild\":null},\"pinned\":false,\"mention_everyone\":false,\"tts\":false,\"position\":1363,\"reactions\":[{\"emoji\":{\"id\":null,\"name\":\"\\u2764\\ufe0f\"},\"count\":1,\"count_details\":{\"burst\":0,\"normal\":1},\"burst_colors\":[],\"me_burst\":false,\"burst_me\":false,\"me\":true,\"burst_count\":0},{\"emoji\":{\"id\":\"1074812009494876272\",\"name\":\"Pog\"},\"count\":1,\"count_details\":{\"burst\":0,\"normal\":1},\"burst_colors\":[],\"me_burst\":false,\"burst_me\":false,\"me\":true,\"burst_count\":0}]},{\"type\":19,\"content\":\"we record the fountain glow during cover and ether pick up all the way to entering Elmyra house. only after entering the house and clear out some of the initial text boxes, there is a ~1min scene of flashback where Elmyra is waiting for the husband at the train station, that is where we will playback the recording at 0.25 speed, write down the pattern and identify the current List value we're on.\\nso to do elevator manip, this part needs to be available as well. if need trimming down, we can always trim down half (the 2nd half of it). the whole cutscene is about 2.5mins, normally we'd be done by the first 1 min, however if i run on PSX disc, due to inconsistencies of ps2 graphics sometimes i struggle to find the fountain glow pattern and need to do it 2-3 times, which will take up the entire cutscene.\\ni think to keep it standardize, we keep it as is\",\"mentions\":[{\"id\":\"309356817169776641\",\"username\":\".rendall\",\"avatar\":\"92721b514158fd7d7a9ea5e1768da748\",\"discriminator\":\"0\",\"public_flags\":512,\"flags\":512,\"banner\":null,\"accent_color\":null,\"global_name\":\"Rendall\",\"avatar_decoration_data\":null,\"collectibles\":null,\"display_name_styles\":null,\"banner_color\":null,\"clan\":null,\"primary_guild\":null}],\"mention_roles\":[],\"attachments\":[],\"embeds\":[],\"timestamp\":\"2024-11-18T02:46:38.475000+00:00\",\"edited_timestamp\":\"2024-11-18T02:57:26.235000+00:00\",\"flags\":0,\"components\":[],\"id\":\"1307899743594348625\",\"channel_id\":\"1288235003901120586\",\"author\":{\"id\":\"385844703091884033\",\"username\":\"phek1200\",\"avatar\":\"defa3ccf4c743532ee4492eeeabde14c\",\"discriminator\":\"0\",\"public_flags\":0,\"flags\":0,\"banner\":null,\"accent_color\":null,\"global_name\":\"phek1200\",\"avatar_decoration_data\":null,\"collectibles\":null,\"display_name_styles\":null,\"banner_color\":null,\"clan\":null,\"primary_guild\":null},\"pinned\":false,\"mention_everyone\":false,\"tts\":false,\"message_reference\":{\"type\":0,\"channel_id\":\"1288235003901120586\",\"message_id\":\"1307831638960373782\",\"guild_id\":\"936291902133796955\"},\"position\":1362,\"referenced_message\":{\"type\":0,\"content\":\"I mean if you checked on with runners etc about this part , I am under the impression alot of this part could go away.\",\"mentions\":[],\"mention_roles\":[],\"attachments\":[],\"embeds\":[],\"timestamp\":\"2024-11-17T22:16:01.065000+00:00\",\"edited_timestamp\":null,\"flags\":0,\"components\":[],\"id\":\"1307831638960373782\",\"channel_id\":\"1288235003901120586\",\"author\":{\"id\":\"309356817169776641\",\"username\":\".rendall\",\"avatar\":\"92721b514158fd7d7a9ea5e1768da748\",\"discriminator\":\"0\",\"public_flags\":512,\"flags\":512,\"banner\":null,\"accent_color\":null,\"global_name\":\"Rendall\",\"avatar_decoration_data\":null,\"collectibles\":null,\"display_name_styles\":null,\"banner_color\":null,\"clan\":null,\"primary_guild\":null},\"pinned\":false,\"mention_everyone\":false,\"tts\":false,\"position\":1356}},{\"type\":19,\"content\":\"if this is referring to the reactor 1 elevator scene where barret shouts \\\"the planet is dying, C!\\\" then yes for non turbo run we need to mash as fast as possible for that 4 text boxes to have fast elevator. you lose 4s if not done correctly. on turbo (duckstation at least) it is free\\ni agree to keep this as is\",\"mentions\":[{\"id\":\"183261151746850816\",\"username\":\"individualcontributor\",\"avatar\":\"b7271f16ff804f9fa069bba774b3d0e7\",\"discriminator\":\"0\",\"public_flags\":0,\"flags\":0,\"banner\":null,\"accent_color\":null,\"global_name\":\"IndividualContributor\",\"avatar_decoration_data\":null,\"collectibles\":null,\"display_name_styles\":null,\"banner_color\":null,\"clan\":null,\"primary_guild\":null}],\"mention_roles\":[],\"attachments\":[],\"embeds\":[],\"timestamp\":\"2024-11-18T02:41:09.339000+00:00\",\"edited_timestamp\":\"2024-11-18T02:41:34.784000+00:00\",\"flags\":0,\"components\":[],\"id\":\"1307898363097780294\",\"channel_id\":\"1288235003901120586\",\"author\":{\"id\":\"385844703091884033\",\"username\":\"phek1200\",\"avatar\":\"defa3ccf4c743532ee4492eeeabde14c\",\"discriminator\":\"0\",\"public_flags\":0,\"flags\":0,\"banner\":null,\"accent_color\":null,\"global_name\":\"phek1200\",\"avatar_decoration_data\":null,\"collectibles\":null,\"display_name_styles\":null,\"banner_color\":null,\"clan\":null,\"primary_guild\":null},\"pinned\":false,\"mention_everyone\":false,\"tts\":false,\"message_reference\":{\"type\":0,\"channel_id\":\"1288235003901120586\",\"message_id\":\"1307775273701474312\",\"guild_id\":\"936291902133796955\"},\"position\":1361,\"referenced_message\":{\"type\":0,\"content\":\"I understand what you mean Rendall but there are a few things I'm leaving in subjectively, they aren't significant but I'd feel weird removing them. That elevator, if it wasn't important, would be important for the \\\"flow\\\" or \\\"feel\\\" of the game which I am also considering.\",\"mentions\":[],\"mention_roles\":[],\"attachments\":[],\"embeds\":[],\"timestamp\":\"2024-11-17T18:32:02.540000+00:00\",\"edited_timestamp\":\"2024-11-17T18:40:22.420000+00:00\",\"flags\":0,\"components\":[],\"id\":\"1307775273701474312\",\"channel_id\":\"1288235003901120586\",\"author\":{\"id\":\"183261151746850816\",\"username\":\"individualcontributor\",\"avatar\":\"b7271f16ff804f9fa069bba774b3d0e7\",\"discriminator\":\"0\",\"public_flags\":0,\"flags\":0,\"banner\":null,\"accent_color\":null,\"global_name\":\"IndividualContributor\",\"avatar_decoration_data\":null,\"collectibles\":null,\"display_name_styles\":null,\"banner_color\":null,\"clan\":null,\"primary_guild\":null},\"pinned\":false,\"mention_everyone\":false,\"tts\":false,\"position\":1342}},{\"type\":19,\"content\":\"I noticed that! Cloud got the phone call and picks up immediately and we're presented with the choice.\\nI think it's fine now and no changes are needed for now\",\"mentions\":[{\"id\":\"183261151746850816\",\"username\":\"individualcontributor\",\"avatar\":\"b7271f16ff804f9fa069bba774b3d0e7\",\"discriminator\":\"0\",\"public_flags\":0,\"flags\":0,\"banner\":null,\"accent_color\":null,\"global_name\":\"IndividualContributor\",\"avatar_decoration_data\":null,\"collectibles\":null,\"display_name_styles\":null,\"banner_color\":null,\"clan\":null,\"primary_guild\":null}],\"mention_roles\":[],\"attachments\":[],\"embeds\":[],\"timestamp\":\"2024-11-18T01:52:50.821000+00:00\",\"edited_timestamp\":null,\"flags\":0,\"components\":[],\"id\":\"1307886205832007701\",\"channel_id\":\"1288235003901120586\",\"author\":{\"id\":\"385844703091884033\",\"username\":\"phek1200\",\"avatar\":\"defa3ccf4c743532ee4492eeeabde14c\",\"discriminator\":\"0\",\"public_flags\":0,\"flags\":0,\"banner\":null,\"accent_color\":null,\"global_name\":\"phek1200\",\"avatar_decoration_data\":null,\"collectibles\":null,\"display_name_styles\":null,\"banner_color\":null,\"clan\":null,\"primary_guild\":null},\"pinned\":false,\"mention_everyone\":false,\"tts\":false,\"message_reference\":{\"type\":0,\"channel_id\":\"1288235003901120586\",\"message_id\":\"1307787847029362698\",\"guild_id\":\"936291902133796955\"},\"position\":1360,\"reactions\":[{\"emoji\":{\"id\":null,\"name\":\"\\ud83d\\udc4d\"},\"count\":1,\"count_details\":{\"burst\":0,\"normal\":1},\"burst_colors\":[],\"me_burst\":false,\"burst_me\":false,\"me\":true,\"burst_count\":0}],\"referenced_message\":{\"type\":19,\"content\":\"I had a look at this and I had trimmed this section previously, it looks fine to me with Cait or Tifa at the moment but we can revisit if someone finds something odd.\",\"mentions\":[{\"id\":\"385844703091884033\",\"username\":\"phek1200\",\"avatar\":\"defa3ccf4c743532ee4492eeeabde14c\",\"discriminator\":\"0\",\"public_flags\":0,\"flags\":0,\"banner\":null,\"accent_color\":null,\"global_name\":\"phek1200\",\"avatar_decoration_data\":null,\"collectibles\":null,\"display_name_styles\":null,\"banner_color\":null,\"clan\":null,\"primary_guild\":null}],\"mention_roles\":[],\"attachments\":[],\"embeds\":[],\"timestamp\":\"2024-11-17T19:22:00.255000+00:00\",\"edited_timestamp\":null,\"flags\":0,\"components\":[],\"id\":\"1307787847029362698\",\"channel_id\":\"1288235003901120586\",\"author\":{\"id\":\"183261151746850816\",\"username\":\"individualcontributor\",\"avatar\":\"b7271f16ff804f9fa069bba774b3d0e7\",\"discriminator\":\"0\",\"public_flags\":0,\"flags\":0,\"banner\":null,\"accent_color\":null,\"global_name\":\"IndividualContributor\",\"avatar_decoration_data\":null,\"collectibles\":null,\"display_name_styles\":null,\"banner_color\":null,\"clan\":null,\"primary_guild\":null},\"pinned\":false,\"mention_everyone\":false,\"tts\":false,\"message_reference\":{\"type\":0,\"channel_id\":\"1288235003901120586\",\"message_id\":\"1307553402418364489\",\"guild_id\":\"936291902133796955\"},\"position\":1350}},{\"type\":0,\"content\":\"whatever I suppose.\",\"mentions\":[],\"mention_roles\":[],\"attachments\":[],\"embeds\":[],\"timestamp\":\"2024-11-17T22:17:30.015000+00:00\",\"edited_timestamp\":null,\"flags\":0,\"components\":[],\"id\":\"1307832012043980880\",\"channel_id\":\"1288235003901120586\",\"author\":{\"id\":\"309356817169776641\",\"username\":\".rendall\",\"avatar\":\"92721b514158fd7d7a9ea5e1768da748\",\"discriminator\":\"0\",\"public_flags\":512,\"flags\":512,\"banner\":null,\"accent_color\":null,\"global_name\":\"Rendall\",\"avatar_decoration_data\":null,\"collectibles\":null,\"display_name_styles\":null,\"banner_color\":null,\"clan\":null,\"primary_guild\":null},\"pinned\":false,\"mention_everyone\":false,\"tts\":false,\"position\":1359},{\"type\":0,\"content\":\"Or they want actual time to load their cheat sheets ?\",\"mentions\":[],\"mention_roles\":[],\"attachments\":[],\"embeds\":[],\"timestamp\":\"2024-11-17T22:16:57.439000+00:00\",\"edited_timestamp\":null,\"flags\":0,\"components\":[],\"id\":\"1307831875410333779\",\"channel_id\":\"1288235003901120586\",\"author\":{\"id\":\"309356817169776641\",\"username\":\".rendall\",\"avatar\":\"92721b514158fd7d7a9ea5e1768da748\",\"discriminator\":\"0\",\"public_flags\":512,\"flags\":512,\"banner\":null,\"accent_color\":null,\"global_name\":\"Rendall\",\"avatar_decoration_data\":null,\"collectibles\":null,\"display_name_styles\":null,\"banner_color\":null,\"clan\":null,\"primary_guild\":null},\"pinned\":false,\"mention_everyone\":false,\"tts\":false,\"position\":1358},{\"type\":0,\"content\":\"Nah it's too subjective, better to just leave it as is\",\"mentions\":[],\"mention_roles\":[],\"attachments\":[],\"embeds\":[],\"timestamp\":\"2024-11-17T22:16:52.813000+00:00\",\"edited_timestamp\":null,\"flags\":0,\"components\":[],\"id\":\"1307831856007483422\",\"channel_id\":\"1288235003901120586\",\"author\":{\"id\":\"183261151746850816\",\"username\":\"individualcontributor\",\"avatar\":\"b7271f16ff804f9fa069bba774b3d0e7\",\"discriminator\":\"0\",\"public_flags\":0,\"flags\":0,\"banner\":null,\"accent_color\":null,\"global_name\":\"IndividualContributor\",\"avatar_decoration_data\":null,\"collectibles\":null,\"display_name_styles\":null,\"banner_color\":null,\"clan\":null,\"primary_guild\":null},\"pinned\":false,\"mention_everyone\":false,\"tts\":false,\"position\":1357},{\"type\":0,\"content\":\"I mean if you checked on with runners etc about this part , I am under the impression alot of this part could go away.\",\"mentions\":[],\"mention_roles\":[],\"attachments\":[],\"embeds\":[],\"timestamp\":\"2024-11-17T22:16:01.065000+00:00\",\"edited_timestamp\":null,\"flags\":0,\"components\":[],\"id\":\"1307831638960373782\",\"channel_id\":\"1288235003901120586\",\"author\":{\"id\":\"309356817169776641\",\"username\":\".rendall\",\"avatar\":\"92721b514158fd7d7a9ea5e1768da748\",\"discriminator\":\"0\",\"public_flags\":512,\"flags\":512,\"banner\":null,\"accent_color\":null,\"global_name\":\"Rendall\",\"avatar_decoration_data\":null,\"collectibles\":null,\"display_name_styles\":null,\"banner_color\":null,\"clan\":null,\"primary_guild\":null},\"pinned\":false,\"mention_everyone\":false,\"tts\":false,\"position\":1356},{\"type\":0,\"content\":\"I guess they have to time it then at the end with the save point , but this is like 5 min of cut scene past with elmyra etc\",\"mentions\":[],\"mention_roles\":[],\"attachments\":[],\"embeds\":[],\"timestamp\":\"2024-11-17T22:13:47.027000+00:00\",\"edited_timestamp\":null,\"flags\":0,\"components\":[],\"id\":\"1307831076764385300\",\"channel_id\":\"1288235003901120586\",\"author\":{\"id\":\"309356817169776641\",\"username\":\".rendall\",\"avatar\":\"92721b514158fd7d7a9ea5e1768da748\",\"discriminator\":\"0\",\"public_flags\":512,\"flags\":512,\"banner\":null,\"accent_color\":null,\"global_name\":\"Rendall\",\"avatar_decoration_data\":null,\"collectibles\":null,\"display_name_styles\":null,\"banner_color\":null,\"clan\":null,\"primary_guild\":null},\"pinned\":false,\"mention_everyone\":false,\"tts\":false,\"position\":1355},{\"type\":0,\"content\":\"Yes, then play it back 25% speed to count the glows afterwards\",\"mentions\":[],\"mention_roles\":[],\"attachments\":[],\"embeds\":[],\"timestamp\":\"2024-11-17T22:13:13.148000+00:00\",\"edited_timestamp\":null,\"flags\":0,\"components\":[],\"id\":\"1307830934665433268\",\"channel_id\":\"1288235003901120586\",\"author\":{\"id\":\"183261151746850816\",\"username\":\"individualcontributor\",\"avatar\":\"b7271f16ff804f9fa069bba774b3d0e7\",\"discriminator\":\"0\",\"public_flags\":0,\"flags\":0,\"banner\":null,\"accent_color\":null,\"global_name\":\"IndividualContributor\",\"avatar_decoration_data\":null,\"collectibles\":null,\"display_name_styles\":null,\"banner_color\":null,\"clan\":null,\"primary_guild\":null},\"pinned\":false,\"mention_everyone\":false,\"tts\":false,\"position\":1354},{\"type\":0,\"content\":\"hrm pretty sure they record that clip while they fetch the materia in the garden.\",\"mentions\":[],\"mention_roles\":[],\"attachments\":[],\"embeds\":[],\"timestamp\":\"2024-11-17T22:12:04.727000+00:00\",\"edited_timestamp\":null,\"flags\":0,\"components\":[],\"id\":\"1307830647686955048\",\"channel_id\":\"1288235003901120586\",\"author\":{\"id\":\"309356817169776641\",\"username\":\".rendall\",\"avatar\":\"92721b514158fd7d7a9ea5e1768da748\",\"discriminator\":\"0\",\"public_flags\":512,\"flags\":512,\"banner\":null,\"accent_color\":null,\"global_name\":\"Rendall\",\"avatar_decoration_data\":null,\"collectibles\":null,\"display_name_styles\":null,\"banner_color\":null,\"clan\":null,\"primary_guild\":null},\"pinned\":false,\"mention_everyone\":false,\"tts\":false,\"position\":1353},{\"type\":0,\"content\":\"Those are used for the elevator manipulation, runners will review the recording of the waterfall glows during that cutscene to determine the RNG used in the elevator.\",\"mentions\":[],\"mention_roles\":[],\"attachments\":[],\"embeds\":[],\"timestamp\":\"2024-11-17T22:09:30.842000+00:00\",\"edited_timestamp\":\"2024-11-17T22:09:51.889000+00:00\",\"flags\":0,\"components\":[],\"id\":\"1307830002246488205\",\"channel_id\":\"1288235003901120586\",\"author\":{\"id\":\"183261151746850816\",\"username\":\"individualcontributor\",\"avatar\":\"b7271f16ff804f9fa069bba774b3d0e7\",\"discriminator\":\"0\",\"public_flags\":0,\"flags\":0,\"banner\":null,\"accent_color\":null,\"global_name\":\"IndividualContributor\",\"avatar_decoration_data\":null,\"collectibles\":null,\"display_name_styles\":null,\"banner_color\":null,\"clan\":null,\"primary_guild\":null},\"pinned\":false,\"mention_everyone\":false,\"tts\":false,\"position\":1352},{\"type\":0,\"content\":\"What is up with the disc 1 Aerith house section ? and the past with Elmira section there was issue removing these ?\",\"mentions\":[],\"mention_roles\":[],\"attachments\":[],\"embeds\":[],\"timestamp\":\"2024-11-17T21:49:03.308000+00:00\",\"edited_timestamp\":null,\"flags\":0,\"components\":[],\"id\":\"1307824853595852851\",\"channel_id\":\"1288235003901120586\",\"author\":{\"id\":\"309356817169776641\",\"username\":\".rendall\",\"avatar\":\"92721b514158fd7d7a9ea5e1768da748\",\"discriminator\":\"0\",\"public_flags\":512,\"flags\":512,\"banner\":null,\"accent_color\":null,\"global_name\":\"Rendall\",\"avatar_decoration_data\":null,\"collectibles\":null,\"display_name_styles\":null,\"banner_color\":null,\"clan\":null,\"primary_guild\":null},\"pinned\":false,\"mention_everyone\":false,\"tts\":false,\"position\":1351},{\"type\":19,\"content\":\"I had a look at this and I had trimmed this section previously, it looks fine to me with Cait or Tifa at the moment but we can revisit if someone finds something odd.\",\"mentions\":[{\"id\":\"385844703091884033\",\"username\":\"phek1200\",\"avatar\":\"defa3ccf4c743532ee4492eeeabde14c\",\"discriminator\":\"0\",\"public_flags\":0,\"flags\":0,\"banner\":null,\"accent_color\":null,\"global_name\":\"phek1200\",\"avatar_decoration_data\":null,\"collectibles\":null,\"display_name_styles\":null,\"banner_color\":null,\"clan\":null,\"primary_guild\":null}],\"mention_roles\":[],\"attachments\":[],\"embeds\":[],\"timestamp\":\"2024-11-17T19:22:00.255000+00:00\",\"edited_timestamp\":null,\"flags\":0,\"components\":[],\"id\":\"1307787847029362698\",\"channel_id\":\"1288235003901120586\",\"author\":{\"id\":\"183261151746850816\",\"username\":\"individualcontributor\",\"avatar\":\"b7271f16ff804f9fa069bba774b3d0e7\",\"discriminator\":\"0\",\"public_flags\":0,\"flags\":0,\"banner\":null,\"accent_color\":null,\"global_name\":\"IndividualContributor\",\"avatar_decoration_data\":null,\"collectibles\":null,\"display_name_styles\":null,\"banner_color\":null,\"clan\":null,\"primary_guild\":null},\"pinned\":false,\"mention_everyone\":false,\"tts\":false,\"message_reference\":{\"type\":0,\"channel_id\":\"1288235003901120586\",\"message_id\":\"1307553402418364489\",\"guild_id\":\"936291902133796955\"},\"position\":1350,\"referenced_message\":{\"type\":0,\"content\":\"NMS uses Tifa in temple, so it's worth looking at her dialogues and cut out some of it (if the current one focuses on cutting out Cait's). This will be applicable to no slots runner using Tifa temple as well, such as myself.\\nEdit: Hundo, All Bosses uses Tifa temple as well so definitely worth doing this\",\"mentions\":[],\"mention_roles\":[],\"attachments\":[],\"embeds\":[],\"timestamp\":\"2024-11-17T03:50:24.304000+00:00\",\"edited_timestamp\":\"2024-11-17T11:21:59.128000+00:00\",\"flags\":0,\"components\":[],\"id\":\"1307553402418364489\",\"channel_id\":\"1288235003901120586\",\"author\":{\"id\":\"385844703091884033\",\"username\":\"phek1200\",\"avatar\":\"defa3ccf4c743532ee4492eeeabde14c\",\"discriminator\":\"0\",\"public_flags\":0,\"flags\":0,\"banner\":null,\"accent_color\":null,\"global_name\":\"phek1200\",\"avatar_decoration_data\":null,\"collectibles\":null,\"display_name_styles\":null,\"banner_color\":null,\"clan\":null,\"primary_guild\":null},\"pinned\":false,\"mention_everyone\":false,\"tts\":false,\"position\":1308}},{\"type\":0,\"content\":\"So is that D1 for any% done? I'll run through it this week again to make sure.\",\"mentions\":[],\"mention_roles\":[],\"attachments\":[],\"embeds\":[],\"timestamp\":\"2024-11-17T19:13:51.902000+00:00\",\"edited_timestamp\":null,\"flags\":0,\"components\":[],\"id\":\"1307785798728548573\",\"channel_id\":\"1288235003901120586\",\"author\":{\"id\":\"183261151746850816\",\"username\":\"individualcontributor\",\"avatar\":\"b7271f16ff804f9fa069bba774b3d0e7\",\"discriminator\":\"0\",\"public_flags\":0,\"flags\":0,\"banner\":null,\"accent_color\":null,\"global_name\":\"IndividualContributor\",\"avatar_decoration_data\":null,\"collectibles\":null,\"display_name_styles\":null,\"banner_color\":null,\"clan\":null,\"primary_guild\":null},\"pinned\":false,\"mention_everyone\":false,\"tts\":false,\"position\":1349},{\"type\":0,\"content\":\"oh yeah it is a selfish thing here really, as in Idc about my own timing, and will not mash 13 x a sec to play a game !\",\"mentions\":[],\"mention_roles\":[],\"attachments\":[],\"embeds\":[],\"timestamp\":\"2024-11-17T18:34:54.697000+00:00\",\"edited_timestamp\":null,\"flags\":0,\"components\":[],\"id\":\"1307775995780272209\",\"channel_id\":\"1288235003901120586\",\"author\":{\"id\":\"309356817169776641\",\"username\":\".rendall\",\"avatar\":\"92721b514158fd7d7a9ea5e1768da748\",\"discriminator\":\"0\",\"public_flags\":512,\"flags\":512,\"banner\":null,\"accent_color\":null,\"global_name\":\"Rendall\",\"avatar_decoration_data\":null,\"collectibles\":null,\"display_name_styles\":null,\"banner_color\":null,\"clan\":null,\"primary_guild\":null},\"pinned\":false,\"mention_everyone\":false,\"tts\":false,\"position\":1348},{\"type\":0,\"content\":\"and personally, I exclusively run with Turbo so it makes absolutely zero difference to me but I do understand why it's left in.\",\"mentions\":[],\"mention_roles\":[],\"attachments\":[],\"embeds\":[],\"timestamp\":\"2024-11-17T18:34:32.726000+00:00\",\"edited_timestamp\":null,\"flags\":0,\"components\":[],\"id\":\"1307775903626952795\",\"channel_id\":\"1288235003901120586\",\"author\":{\"id\":\"248225699909861376\",\"username\":\"awesomewaves\",\"avatar\":\"7de794a8a3e242252076a10784af0a9f\",\"discriminator\":\"0\",\"public_flags\":0,\"flags\":0,\"banner\":null,\"accent_color\":null,\"global_name\":\"awesomeWaves\",\"avatar_decoration_data\":null,\"collectibles\":null,\"display_name_styles\":null,\"banner_color\":null,\"clan\":null,\"primary_guild\":null},\"pinned\":false,\"mention_everyone\":false,\"tts\":false,\"position\":1347}]\n"
