            "text": "[{\"type\":0,\"content\":\"You can't assume everyone is or isn't using turbo either.\",\"mentions\":[],\"mention_roles\":[],\"attachments\":[],\"embeds\":[],\"timestamp\":\"2024-11-17T18:33:52.538000+00:00\",\"edited_timestamp\":null,\"flags\":0,\"components\":[],\"id\":\"1307775735066394669\",\"channel_id\":\"1288235003901120586\",\"author\":{\"id\":\"248225699909861376\",\"username\":\"awesomewaves\",\"avatar\":\"7de794a8a3e242252076a10784af0a9f\",\"discriminator\":\"0\",\"public_flags\":0,\"flags\":0,\"banner\":null,\"accent_color\":null,\"global_name\":\"awesomeWaves\",\"avatar_decoration_data\":null,\"collectibles\":null,\"display_name_styles\":null,\"banner_color\":null,\"clan\":null,\"primary_guild\":null},\"pinned\":false,\"mention_everyone\":false,\"tts\":false,\"position\":1346},{\"type\":0,\"content\":\"I think with the idea that you want it to be true to any% strats, that is something you would want to pay attention to in a full run. So worth leaving it in to be sure.\",\"mentions\":[],\"mention_roles\":[],\"attachments\":[],\"embeds\":[],\"timestamp\":\"2024-11-17T18:33:28.220000+00:00\",\"edited_timestamp\":\"2024-11-17T18:33:31.005000+00:00\",\"flags\":0,\"components\":[],\"id\":\"1307775633069314088\",\"channel_id\":\"1288235003901120586\",\"author\":{\"id\":\"248225699909861376\",\"username\":\"awesomewaves\",\"avatar\":\"7de794a8a3e242252076a10784af0a9f\",\"discriminator\":\"0\",\"public_flags\":0,\"flags\":0,\"banner\":null,\"accent_color\":null,\"global_name\":\"awesomeWaves\",\"avatar_decoration_data\":null,\"collectibles\":null,\"display_name_styles\":null,\"banner_color\":null,\"clan\":null,\"primary_guild\":null},\"pinned\":false,\"mention_everyone\":false,\"tts\":false,\"position\":1345},{\"type\":0,\"content\":\"Oh yeah that is fine, it is what it is if you mash fast enough\",\"mentions\":[],\"mention_roles\":[],\"attachments\":[],\"embeds\":[],\"timestamp\":\"2024-11-17T18:32:35.098000+00:00\",\"edited_timestamp\":null,\"flags\":0,\"components\":[],\"id\":\"1307775410259361922\",\"channel_id\":\"1288235003901120586\",\"author\":{\"id\":\"309356817169776641\",\"username\":\".rendall\",\"avatar\":\"92721b514158fd7d7a9ea5e1768da748\",\"discriminator\":\"0\",\"public_flags\":512,\"flags\":512,\"banner\":null,\"accent_color\":null,\"global_name\":\"Rendall\",\"avatar_decoration_data\":null,\"collectibles\":null,\"display_name_styles\":null,\"banner_color\":null,\"clan\":null,\"primary_guild\":null},\"pinned\":false,\"mention_everyone\":false,\"tts\":false,\"position\":1344},{\"type\":0,\"content\":\"cause then it's not a skill  check then or is it ?\",\"mentions\":[],\"mention_roles\":[],\"attachments\":[],\"embeds\":[],\"timestamp\":\"2024-11-17T18:32:04.825000+00:00\",\"edited_timestamp\":null,\"flags\":0,\"components\":[],\"id\":\"1307775283285332049\",\"channel_id\":\"1288235003901120586\",\"author\":{\"id\":\"309356817169776641\",\"username\":\".rendall\",\"avatar\":\"92721b514158fd7d7a9ea5e1768da748\",\"discriminator\":\"0\",\"public_flags\":512,\"flags\":512,\"banner\":null,\"accent_color\":null,\"global_name\":\"Rendall\",\"avatar_decoration_data\":null,\"collectibles\":null,\"display_name_styles\":null,\"banner_color\":null,\"clan\":null,\"primary_guild\":null},\"pinned\":false,\"mention_everyone\":false,\"tts\":false,\"position\":1343},{\"type\":0,\"content\":\"I understand what you mean Rendall but there are a few things I'm leaving in subjectively, they aren't significant but I'd feel weird removing them. That elevator, if it wasn't important, would be important for the \\\"flow\\\" or \\\"feel\\\" of the game which I am also considering.\",\"mentions\":[],\"mention_roles\":[],\"attachments\":[],\"embeds\":[],\"timestamp\":\"2024-11-17T18:32:02.540000+00:00\",\"edited_timestamp\":\"2024-11-17T18:40:22.420000+00:00\",\"flags\":0,\"components\":[],\"id\":\"1307775273701474312\",\"channel_id\":\"1288235003901120586\",\"author\":{\"id\":\"183261151746850816\",\"username\":\"individualcontributor\",\"avatar\":\"b7271f16ff804f9fa069bba774b3d0e7\",\"discriminator\":\"0\",\"public_flags\":0,\"flags\":0,\"banner\":null,\"accent_color\":null,\"global_name\":\"IndividualContributor\",\"avatar_decoration_data\":null,\"collectibles\":null,\"display_name_styles\":null,\"banner_color\":null,\"clan\":null,\"primary_guild\":null},\"pinned\":false,\"mention_everyone\":false,\"tts\":false,\"position\":1342},{\"type\":0,\"content\":\"peoples are running turbo these days ?\",\"mentions\":[],\"mention_roles\":[],\"attachments\":[],\"embeds\":[],\"timestamp\":\"2024-11-17T18:31:14.976000+00:00\",\"edited_timestamp\":null,\"flags\":0,\"components\":[],\"id\":\"1307775074203603066\",\"channel_id\":\"1288235003901120586\",\"author\":{\"id\":\"309356817169776641\",\"username\":\".rendall\",\"avatar\":\"92721b514158fd7d7a9ea5e1768da748\",\"discriminator\":\"0\",\"public_flags\":512,\"flags\":512,\"banner\":null,\"accent_color\":null,\"global_name\":\"Rendall\",\"avatar_decoration_data\":null,\"collectibles\":null,\"display_name_styles\":null,\"banner_color\":null,\"clan\":null,\"primary_guild\":null},\"pinned\":false,\"mention_everyone\":false,\"tts\":false,\"position\":1341},{\"type\":0,\"content\":\"It's considered a 'skill check', it saves more than a few frames. it's maybe a couple of seconds?\",\"mentions\":[],\"mention_roles\":[],\"attachments\":[],\"embeds\":[],\"timestamp\":\"2024-11-17T18:31:00.779000+00:00\",\"edited_timestamp\":null,\"flags\":0,\"components\":[],\"id\":\"1307775014657065030\",\"channel_id\":\"1288235003901120586\",\"author\":{\"id\":\"248225699909861376\",\"username\":\"awesomewaves\",\"avatar\":\"7de794a8a3e242252076a10784af0a9f\",\"discriminator\":\"0\",\"public_flags\":0,\"flags\":0,\"banner\":null,\"accent_color\":null,\"global_name\":\"awesomeWaves\",\"avatar_decoration_data\":null,\"collectibles\":null,\"display_name_styles\":null,\"banner_color\":null,\"clan\":null,\"primary_guild\":null},\"pinned\":false,\"mention_everyone\":