            "text": "[{\"type\":0,\"content\":\"I tried putting the \\\"1500 gil\\\" text box in before the \\\"sleep music black screen\\\" but kept getting weird issues where the scene would load for a second with all the model stacked on each other in the middle of the room <:KEKW:1074810897308069948>\",\"mentions\":[],\"mention_roles\":[],\"attachments\":[],\"embeds\":[],\"timestamp\":\"2024-11-17T18:18:09.335000+00:00\",\"edited_timestamp\":null,\"flags\":0,\"components\":[],\"id\":\"1307771778986409985\",\"channel_id\":\"1288235003901120586\",\"author\":{\"id\":\"183261151746850816\",\"username\":\"individualcontributor\",\"avatar\":\"b7271f16ff804f9fa069bba774b3d0e7\",\"discriminator\":\"0\",\"public_flags\":0,\"flags\":0,\"banner\":null,\"accent_color\":null,\"global_name\":\"IndividualContributor\",\"avatar_decoration_data\":null,\"collectibles\":null,\"display_name_styles\":null,\"banner_color\":null,\"clan\":null,\"primary_guild\":null},\"pinned\":false,\"mention_everyone\":false,\"tts\":false,\"position\":1326},{\"type\":0,\"content\":\"\",\"mentions\":[],\"mention_roles\":[],\"attachments\":[{\"id\":\"1307771516846604319\",\"filename\":\"2024-11-17_18-16-29.mp4\",\"size\":6108526,\"url\":\"https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/1288235003901120586/1307771516846604319/2024-11-17_18-16-29.mp4?ex=6a6e3822&is=6a6ce6a2&hm=8f9121f09865d90a6eaab86324c2be4ae6f7d85205859a2f705780a559882047&\",\"proxy_url\":\"https://media.discordapp.net/attachments/1288235003901120586/1307771516846604319/2024-11-17_18-16-29.mp4?ex=6a6e3822&is=6a6ce6a2&hm=8f9121f09865d90a6eaab86324c2be4ae6f7d85205859a2f705780a559882047&\",\"width\":1280,\"height\":720,\"content_type\":\"video/mp4\",\"content_scan_version\":2,\"placeholder\":\"CAgGDICgK6ZNuHhFiIpvd/GEFw==\",\"placeholder_version\":1,\"title\":\"2024-11-17 18-16-29\"}],\"embeds\":[],\"timestamp\":\"2024-11-17T18:17:06.987000+00:00\",\"edited_timestamp\":null,\"flags\":0,\"components\":[],\"id\":\"1307771517479813223\",\"channel_id\":\"1288235003901120586\",\"author\":{\"id\":\"183261151746850816\",\"username\":\"individualcontributor\",\"avatar\":\"b7271f16ff804f9fa069bba774b3d0e7\",\"discriminator\":\"0\",\"public_flags\":0,\"flags\":0,\"banner\":null,\"accent_color\":null,\"global_name\":\"IndividualContributor\",\"avatar_decoration_data\":null,\"collectibles\":null,\"display_name_styles\":null,\"banner_color\":null,\"clan\":null,\"primary_guild\":null},\"pinned\":false,\"mention_everyone\":false,\"tts\":false,\"position\":1325},{\"type\":0,\"content\":\"My understanding is, taking Cait here is faster because no phone call, which is still the case I think\",\"mentions\":[],\"mention_roles\":[],\"attachments\":[],\"embeds\":[],\"timestamp\":\"2024-11-17T17:33:58.085000+00:00\",\"edited_timestamp\":\"2024-11-17T18:51:03.732000+00:00\",\"flags\":0,\"components\":[],\"id\":\"1307760658837799055\",\"channel_id\":\"1288235003901120586\",\"author\":{\"id\":\"183261151746850816\",\"username\":\"individualcontributor\",\"avatar\":\"b7271f16ff804f9fa069bba774b3d0e7\",\"discriminator\":\"0\",\"public_flags\":0,\"flags\":0,\"banner\":null,\"accent_color\":null,\"global_name\":\"IndividualContributor\",\"avatar_decoration_data\":null,\"collectibles\":null,\"display_name_styles\":null,\"banner_color\":null,\"clan\":null,\"primary_guild\":null},\"pinned\":false,\"mention_everyone\":false,\"tts\":false,\"position\":1324},{\"type\":0,\"content\":\"I trimmed it previously, but it still is slower here relative to taking Cait, so shouldn't allow for an alternative strat to be introduced right?\",\"mentions\":[],\"mention_roles\":[],\"attachments\":[],\"embeds\":[],\"timestamp\":\"2024-11-17T17:33:41.113000+00:00\",\"edited_timestamp\":\"2024-11-17T18:50:46.845000+00:00\",\"flags\":0,\"components\":[],\"id\":\"1307760587652202557\",\"channel_id\":\"1288235003901120586\",\"author\":{\"id\":\"183261151746850816\",\"username\":\"individualcontributor\",\"avatar\":\"b7271f16ff804f9fa069bba774b3d0e7\",\"discriminator\":\"0\",\"public_flags\":0,\"flags\":0,\"banner\":null,\"accent_color\":null,\"global_name\":\"IndividualContributor\",\"avatar_decoration_data\":null,\"collectibles\":null,\"display_name_styles\":null,\"banner_color\":null,\"clan\":null,\"primary_guild\":null},\"pinned\":false,\"mention_everyone\":false,\"tts\":false,\"position\":1323},{\"type\":0,\"content\":\"Before I do that, this is the Tifa temple scene\",\"mentions\":[],\"mention_roles\":[],\"attachments\":[],\"embeds\":[],\"timestamp\":\"2024-11-17T17:33:10.643000+00:00\",\"edited_timestamp\":null,\"flags\":0,\"components\":[],\"id\":\"1307760459851501581\",\"channel_id\":\"1288235003901120586\",\"author\":{\"id\":\"183261151746850816\",\"username\":\"individualcontributor\",\"avatar\":\"b7271f16ff804f9fa069bba774b3d0e7\",\"discriminator\":\"0\",\"public_flags\":0,\"flags\":0,\"banner\":null,\"accent_color\":null,\"global_name\":\"IndividualContributor\",\"avatar_decoration_data\":null,\"collectibles\":null,\"display_name_styles\":null,\"banner_color\":null,\"clan\":null,\"primary_guild\":null},\"pinned\":false,\"mention_everyone\":false,\"tts\":false,\"position\":1322},{\"type\":0,\"content\":\"\",\"mentions\":[],\"mention_roles\":[],\"attachments\":[{\"id\":\"1307760416327335957\",\"filename\":\"2024-11-17_17-32-20.mp4\",\"size\":8477843,\"url\":\"https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/1288235003901120586/1307760416327335957/2024-11-17_17-32-20.mp4?ex=6a6e2dcc&is=6a6cdc4c&hm=c60a6fbf12babd185166ddd80c89a081b424d5a5205805951b3fb3de74f208af&\",\"proxy_url\":\"https://media.discordapp.net/attachments/1288235003901120586/1307760416327335957/2024-11-17_17-32-20.mp4?ex=6a6e2dcc&is=6a6cdc4c&hm=c60a6fbf12babd185166ddd80c89a081b424d5a5205805951b3fb3de74f208af&\",\"width\":1280,\"height\":720,\"content_type\":\"video/mp4\",\"placeholder\":\"yygGHIZkaZk0mnZTqM9PUvI1JQ==\",\"placeholder_version\":1,\"title\":\"2024-11-17 17-32-20\"}],\"embeds\":[],\"timestamp\":\"2024-11-17T17:33:00.421000+00:00\",\"edited_timestamp\":null,\"flags\":0,\"components\":[],\"id\":\"1307760416977322087\",\"channel_id\":\"1288235003901120586\",\"author\":{\"id\":\"183261151746850816\",\"username\":\"individualcontributor\",\"avatar\":\"b7271f16ff804f9fa069bba774b3d0e7\",\"discriminator\":\"0\",\"public_flags\":0,\"flags\":0,\"banner\":null,\"accent_color\":null,\"global_name\":\"IndividualContributor\",\"avatar_decoration_data\":null,\"collectibles\":null,\"display_name_styles\":null,\"banner_color\":null,\"clan\":null,\"primary_guild\":null},\"pinned\":false,\"mention_everyone\":false,\"tts\":false,\"position\":1321},{\"type\":0,\"content\":\"Ok fair enough it dosen't look too bad there, I'll make the change and share it here for a look, few minutes\",\"mentions\":[],\"mention_roles\":[],\"attachments\":[],\"embeds\":[],\"timestamp\":\"2024-11-17T17:31:24.710000+00:00\",\"edited_timestamp\":\"2024-11-17T17:31:37.728000+00:00\",\"flags\":0,\"components\":[],\"id\":\"1307760015536423015\",\"channel_id\":\"1288235003901120586\",\"author\":{\"id\":\"183261151746850816\",\"username\":\"individualcontributor\",\"avatar\":\"b7271f16ff804f9fa069bba774b3d0e7\",\"discriminator\":\"0\",\"public_flags\":0,\"flags\":0,\"banner\":null,\"accent_color\":null,\"global_name\":\"IndividualContributor\",\"avatar_decoration_data\":null,\"collectibles\":null,\"display_name_styles\":null,\"banner_color\":null,\"clan\":null,\"primary_guild\":null},\"pinned\":false,\"mention_everyone\":false,\"tts\":false,\"position\":1320},{\"type\":0,\"content\":\"You recieve the Aquamarine, which is given to the player during the next 6 minutes of cutscenes which are removed.\",\"mentions\":[],\"mention_roles\":[],\"attachments\":[],\"embeds\":[],\"timestamp\":\"2024-11-17T17:21:42.331000+00:00\",\"edited_timestamp\":\"2024-11-17T17:21:57.936000+00:00\",\"flags\":0,\"components\":[],\"id\":\"1307757572861853757\",\"channel_id\":\"1288235003901120586\",\"author\":{\"id\":\"248225699909861376\",\"username\":\"awesomewaves\",\"avatar\":\"7