            "mimeType": "application/json",
            "text": "[{\"type\":0,\"content\":\"## \\ud83c\\udfae Release v0.5.3 \\nhttps://github.com/individualcontributordev/Final-Fantasy-7-CSR\\n\\n- When first entering rocket town the scrolling to view the rocket was removed\\n- Seeing bronco for the first time is sped up\\n- Getting the Yoshiyuki from old man in rocket town is faster\\n- No scroll in Gongaga fro \\\"a ruined reactor\\\" section\\n- Entering temple for the first time, removed entire scene with Aeris running up and back to Cloud, party splits and joins then play resumes\\n- When entinring Temple where Tseng is, added back in 1 text box where Aeris is crying\\n- Added back in 1 text box entering template on the weird field with steps\\n- Added 1 text box back in for Aeris at the fountain after rolling rocks\\n- In temple, first entering cliff with lots of doors, removed text boxes after Aeris asks you a question and joins party again\\n- At Demon's gate Cloud now just runs back as DG is coming out of the wall\\n- Leaving the hut in Gongaga after Temple, added 1 text box\\n- Reactor 5 train added 1 text box for Jessie in 2nd carridge\\n- Removed R word on stairs\",\"mentions\":[],\"mention_roles\":[],\"attachments\":[],\"embeds\":[{\"type\":\"article\",\"url\":\"https://github.com/individualcontributordev/Final-Fantasy-7-CSR\",\"title\":\"GitHub - individualcontributordev/Final-Fantasy-7-CSR: Final Fantas...\",\"description\":\"Final Fantasy 7 CutScenes Removed. Contribute to individualcontributordev/Final-Fantasy-7-CSR development by creating an account on GitHub.\",\"color\":1975079,\"provider\":{\"name\":\"GitHub\"},\"thumbnail\":{\"url\":\"https://opengraph.githubassets.com/0fee65b1a5bfbec28767a0d4a4ef92fbf3858c7545332b5f2e3e7802d77af8ab/individualcontributordev/Final-Fantasy-7-CSR\",\"proxy_url\":\"https://images-ext-1.discordapp.net/external/xuWdenxRt7h_bZ3hi2xaPIhH36KHn9BfdHx-1VEYXyI/https/opengraph.githubassets.com/0fee65b1a5bfbec28767a0d4a4ef92fbf3858c7545332b5f2e3e7802d77af8ab/individualcontributordev/Final-Fantasy-7-CSR\",\"width\":1200,\"height\":600,\"content_type\":\"image/png\",\"placeholder\":\"/fcFBIBri8WTl2hceV+zHT/L8Q==\",\"placeholder_version\":1,\"flags\":0},\"content_scan_version\":4}],\"timestamp\":\"2024-11-16T22:06:27.028000+00:00\",\"edited_timestamp\":\"2024-11-16T22:06:47.676000+00:00\",\"flags\":0,\"components\":[],\"id\":\"1307466843409223721\",\"channel_id\":\"1288235003901120586\",\"author\":{\"id\":\"183261151746850816\",\"username\":\"individualcontributor\",\"avatar\":\"b7271f16ff804f9fa069bba774b3d0e7\",\"discriminator\":\"0\",\"public_flags\":0,\"flags\":0,\"banner\":null,\"accent_color\":null,\"global_name\":\"IndividualContributor\",\"avatar_decoration_data\":null,\"collectibles\":null,\"display_name_styles\":null,\"banner_color\":null,\"clan\":null,\"primary_guild\":null},\"pinned\":false,\"mention_everyone\":false,\"tts\":false,\"position\":1266},{\"type\":0,\"content\":\"\",\"mentions\":[],\"mention_roles\":[],\"attachments\":[{\"id\":\"1307464782537822360\",\"filename\":\"2024-11-16_21-57-32.mp4\",\"size\":9633188,\"url\":\"https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/1288235003901120586/1307464782537822360/2024-11-16_21-57-32.mp4?ex=6a6e6bf7&is=6a6d1a77&hm=7c698d857e77441dbf70ffe12c11072b585df37d79d24e89486bf05d0ed622d6&\",\"proxy_url\":\"https://media.discordapp.net/attachments/1288235003901120586/1307464782537822360/2024-11-16_21-57-32.mp4?ex=6a6e6bf7&is=6a6d1a77&hm=7c698d857e77441dbf70ffe12c11072b585df37d79d24e89486bf05d0ed622d6&\",\"width\":1280,\"height\":720,\"content_type\":\"video/mp4\",\"placeholder\":\"AggCBIDP0oSbiYmYqt1fVfF4Fg==\",\"placeholder_version\":1,\"title\":\"2024-11-16 21-57-32\"}],\"embeds\":[],\"timestamp\":\"2024-11-16T21:58:15.793000+00:00\",\"edited_timestamp\":null,\"flags\":0,\"components\":[],\"id\":\"1307464783020298330\",\"channel_id\":\"1288235003901120586\",\"author\":{\"id\":\"183261151746850816\",\"username\":\"individualcontributor\",\"avatar\":\"b7271f16ff804f9fa069bba774b3d0e7\",\"discriminator\":\"0\",\"public_flags\":0,\"flags\":0,\"banner\":null,\"accent_color\":null,\"global_name\":\"IndividualContributor\",\"avatar_decoration_data\":null,\"collectibles\":null,\"display_name_styles\":null,\"banner_color\":null,\"clan\":null,\"primary_guild\":null},\"pinned\":false,\"mention_everyone\":false,\"tts\":false,\"position\":1265,\"reactions\":[{\"emoji\":{\"id\":\"890963307937292298\",\"name\":\"KEKW\"},\"count\":1,\"count_details\":{\"burst\":0,\"normal\":1},\"burst_colors\":[],\"me_burst\":false,\"burst_me\":false,\"me\":false,\"burst_count\":0},{\"emoji\":{\"id\":\"935868892511895563\",\"name\":\"POGGIES\"},\"count\":1,\"count_details\":{\"burst\":0,\"normal\":1},\"burst_colors\":[],\"me_burst\":false,\"burst_me\":false,\"me\":false,\"burst_count\":0}]},{\"type\":0,\"content\":\"I have the final list of changes for D1 any% https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/19y6yHtODjS5R-VyvtHUKjAo3FL9Fif56p1REQsUzGWg/edit?usp=sharing \\n\\nI'll be hopefully making these changes tonight then I'll be playing through D2 and D3 using this form to track any new changes https://docs.google.com/forms/d/e/1FAIpQLSfcZVrLn6QF7-WJVihUU1IwoTfz8Q3eBKBbDSBJ5ez1Q8nWBA/viewform. \\n\\nLet me know if there is something missing from the this D1 list in any%. NMS and 100% to be done after any% which will be v1.0.0 of the patch.\\n\\n## In the next version\\n\\n- Enter rocket town scroll speed up\\n- Seeing bronco for the first time, speed it up\\n- Speed up getting yoshiyuki from old man in rocket town\\n- a ruined reactor scroll speed up\\n- entering temple for the first time, remove entire scene with Aeris running up and back to C\\n- add back in a text box after tseng gives you the key to the temple\\n- Add back in text box entering template weird field with steps\\n- add text box back in with Aeris at the fountain after rolling rocks\\n- in temple, first entering cliff with doors, remove text boxes after aeris asks you a question\\n- Demon's gate Cloud can just run back as DG is coming out of the wall\\n- leaving hut in gongaga after template 1 text box\\n- Reactor 5 train add in some text boxes\\n- remove R word on stairs\",\"mentions\":[],\"mention_roles\":[],\"attachments\":[],\"embeds\":[{\"type\":\"link\",\"url\":\"https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/19y6yHtODjS5R-VyvtHUKjAo3FL9Fif56p1REQsUzGWg/edit?usp=sharing\",\"title\":\"FF7 CSR Forms\",\"provider\":{\"name\":\"Google Docs\"},\"thumbnail\":{\"url\":\"https://lh7-us.googleusercontent.com/docs/AHkbwyIR4SZD5N9vDnQkwNNCkV8L3pPqZ1m-phZH0wqoGTAr4ASFdHjxOTaGFdJAEkeV5AiWhADZkXaNTN4OH-Wybo82eKuZ0ZZMdgm36o8l58yLVdtuXRY=w1200-h630-p\",\"proxy_url\":\"https://images-ext-1.discordapp.net/external/GXQSVoIuZVvZtWEM5a2wl8oitxAmUfM5368oWxG-M8A/https/lh7-us.googleusercontent.com/docs/AHkbwyIR4SZD5N9vDnQkwNNCkV8L3pPqZ1m-phZH0wqoGTAr4ASFdHjxOTaGFdJAEkeV5AiWhADZkXaNTN4OH-Wybo82eKuZ0ZZMdgm36o8l58yLVdtuXRY%3Dw1200-h630-p\",\"width\":1200,\"height\":630,\"content_type\":\"image/png\",\"placeholder\":\"/fcBBICQu5qLh3e7SHrAnwv8uQ==\",\"placeholder_version\":1,\"flags\":0},\"content_scan_version\":4}],\"timestamp\":\"2024-11-16T19:17:07.665000+00:00\",\"edited_timestamp\":\"2024-11-16T21:59:26.069000+00:00\",\"flags\":0,\"components\":[],\"id\":\"1307424231952355402\",\"channel_id\":\"1288235003901120586\",\"author\":{\"id\":\"183261151746850816\",\"username\":\"individualcontributor\",\"avatar\":\"b7271f16ff804f9fa069bba774b3d0e7\",\"discriminator\":\"0\",\"public_flags\":0,\"flags\":0,\"banner\":null,\"accent_color\":null,\"global_name\":\"IndividualContributor\",\"avatar_decoration_data\":null,\"collectibles\":null,\"display_name_styles\":null,\"banner_color\":null,\"clan\":null,\"primary_guild\":null},\"pinned\":false,\"mention_everyone\":false,\"tts\":false,\"position\":1263},{\"type\":0,\"content\":\"Nice!\",\"mentions\":[],\"mention_roles\":[],\"attachments\":[],\"embeds\":[],\"timestamp\":\"2024-11-16T15:40:58.572000+00:00\",\"edited_timestamp\":null,\"flags\":0,\"components\":[],\"id\