- Arriving at Costa off the boat, cue for options restored\\n- Barret's house in Corel Prison cues fixed\",\"mentions\":[],\"mention_roles\":[],\"attachments\":[],\"embeds\":[{\"type\":\"article\",\"url\":\"https://github.com/individualcontributordev/Final-Fantasy-7-CSR\",\"title\":\"GitHub - individualcontributordev/Final-Fantasy-7-CSR: Final Fantas...\",\"description\":\"Final Fantasy 7 CutScenes Removed. Contribute to individualcontributordev/Final-Fantasy-7-CSR development by creating an account on GitHub.\",\"color\":1975079,\"provider\":{\"name\":\"GitHub\"},\"thumbnail\":{\"url\":\"https://opengraph.githubassets.com/0fee65b1a5bfbec28767a0d4a4ef92fbf3858c7545332b5f2e3e7802d77af8ab/individualcontributordev/Final-Fantasy-7-CSR\",\"proxy_url\":\"https://images-ext-1.discordapp.net/external/xuWdenxRt7h_bZ3hi2xaPIhH36KHn9BfdHx-1VEYXyI/https/opengraph.githubassets.com/0fee65b1a5bfbec28767a0d4a4ef92fbf3858c7545332b5f2e3e7802d77af8ab/individualcontributordev/Final-Fantasy-7-CSR\",\"width\":1200,\"height\":600,\"content_type\":\"image/png\",\"placeholder\":\"/fcFBIBri8WTl2hceV+zHT/L8Q==\",\"placeholder_version\":1,\"flags\":0},\"content_scan_version\":4}],\"timestamp\":\"2024-11-14T22:43:55.560000+00:00\",\"edited_timestamp\":\"2024-11-16T22:06:56.245000+00:00\",\"flags\":0,\"components\":[],\"id\":\"1306751498704916580\",\"channel_id\":\"1288235003901120586\",\"author\":{\"id\":\"183261151746850816\",\"username\":\"individualcontributor\",\"avatar\":\"b7271f16ff804f9fa069bba774b3d0e7\",\"discriminator\":\"0\",\"public_flags\":0,\"flags\":0,\"banner\":null,\"accent_color\":null,\"global_name\":\"IndividualContributor\",\"avatar_decoration_data\":null,\"collectibles\":null,\"display_name_styles\":null,\"banner_color\":null,\"clan\":null,\"primary_guild\":null},\"pinned\":false,\"mention_everyone\":false,\"tts\":false,\"position\":1260,\"reactions\":[{\"emoji\":{\"id\":\"935868892511895563\",\"name\":\"POGGIES\"},\"count\":2,\"count_details\":{\"burst\":0,\"normal\":2},\