ace. I think sorting the auto-splitter for emu would be enough for now.\",\"mentions\":[],\"mention_roles\":[],\"attachments\":[],\"embeds\":[],\"timestamp\":\"2024-11-12T21:43:27.153000+00:00\",\"edited_timestamp\":null,\"flags\":0,\"components\":[],\"id\":\"1306011504331456613\",\"channel_id\":\"1288235003901120586\",\"author\":{\"id\":\"248225699909861376\",\"username\":\"awesomewaves\",\"avatar\":\"7de794a8a3e242252076a10784af0a9f\",\"discriminator\":\"0\",\"public_flags\":0,\"flags\":0,\"banner\":null,\"accent_color\":null,\"global_name\":\"awesomeWaves\",\"avatar_decoration_data\":null,\"collectibles\":null,\"display_name_styles\":null,\"banner_color\":null,\"clan\":null,\"primary_guild\":null},\"pinned\":false,\"mention_everyone\":false,\"tts\":false,\"position\":1168},{\"type\":0,\"content\":\"Just apply the \\\"Auto-splitter\\\" patch if you want to use it.\",\"mentions\":[],\"mention_roles\":[],\"attachments\":[],\"embeds\":[],\"timestamp\":\"2024-11-12T21:30:11.028000+00:00\",\"edited_timestamp\":\"2024-11-12T21:30:16.450000+00:00\",\"flags\":0,\"components\":[],\"id\":\"1306008165141315585\",\"channel_id\":\"1288235003901120586\",\"author\":{\"id\":\"183261151746850816\",\"username\":\"individualcontributor\",\"avatar\":\"b7271f16ff804f9fa069bba774b3d0e7\",\"discriminator\":\"0\",\"public_flags\":0,\"flags\":0,\"banner\":null,\"accent_color\":null,\"global_name\":\"IndividualContributor\",\"avatar_decoration_data\":null,\"collectibles\":null,\"display_name_styles\":null,\"banner_color\":null,\"clan\":null,\"primary_guild\":null},\"pinned\":false,\"mention_everyone\":false,\"tts\":false,\"position\":1167},{\"type\":0,\"content\":\"Would work on Digital and PSX if it's already capable of both\",\"mentions\":[],\"mention_roles\":[],\"attachments\":[],\"embeds\":[],\"timestamp\":\"2024-11-12T21:29:40.236000+00:00\",\"edited_timestamp\":null,\"flags\":0,\"components\":[],\"id\":\"1306008035990306817\",\"channel_id\":\"1288235003901120586\",\"author\":{\"id\":