            "text": "[{\"type\":0,\"content\":\"I was away all morning but if there's anything you specificially need testing on hardware let me know as I have a few hours now\",\"mentions\":[],\"mention_roles\":[],\"attachments\":[],\"embeds\":[],\"timestamp\":\"2024-11-09T14:25:13.595000+00:00\",\"edited_timestamp\":\"2024-11-09T14:25:17.806000+00:00\",\"flags\":0,\"components\":[],\"id\":\"1304814057559293992\",\"channel_id\":\"1288235003901120586\",\"author\":{\"id\":\"248225699909861376\",\"username\":\"awesomewaves\",\"avatar\":\"7de794a8a3e242252076a10784af0a9f\",\"discriminator\":\"0\",\"public_flags\":0,\"flags\":0,\"banner\":null,\"accent_color\":null,\"global_name\":\"awesomeWaves\",\"avatar_decoration_data\":null,\"collectibles\":null,\"display_name_styles\":null,\"banner_color\":null,\"clan\":null,\"primary_guild\":null},\"pinned\":false,\"mention_everyone\":false,\"tts\":false,\"position\":881},{\"type\":0,\"content\":\"https://tenor.com/view/liam-neeson-i-will-find-you-taken-gif-5593626\",\"mentions\":[],\"mention_roles\":[],\"attachments\":[],\"embeds\":[{\"type\":\"gifv\",\"url\":\"https://tenor.com/view/liam-neeson-i-will-find-you-taken-gif-5593626\",\"provider\":{\"name\":\"Tenor\",\"url\":\"https://tenor.co\"},\"thumbnail\":{\"url\":\"https://media.tenor.com/3l4Ky00EA8IAAAAe/liam-neeson-i-will-find-you.png\",\"proxy_url\":\"https://images-ext-1.discordapp.net/external/s_VAzx0g61b8jzRvqspE3Ff0OUH7WDkHRMWdEb0059Q/https/media.tenor.com/3l4Ky00EA8IAAAAe/liam-neeson-i-will-find-you.png\",\"width\":498,\"height\":344,\"placeholder\":\"ikgGFYQImXtkZ4iie2iWeAlUoFME\",\"placeholder_version\":1,\"flags\":0},\"video\":{\"url\":\"https://media.tenor.com/3l4Ky00EA8IAAAPo/liam-neeson-i-will-find-you.mp4\",\"proxy_url\":\"https://images-ext-1.discordapp.net/external/g_ZzfXW7HMqNa368oPTNX-Xv8TJcCQ9C8SmS7dgwkVI/https/media.tenor.com/3l4Ky00EA8IAAAPo/liam-neeson-i-will-find-you.mp4\",\"width\":560,\"height\":388,\"placeholder\":\"ikgGFYQImXtkZ4iie2iWeAlUoFME\",\"placeholder_version\":1,\"flags\":0},\"content_scan_version\":4}],\"timestamp\":\"2024-11-09T12:35:08.548000+00:00\",\"edited_timestamp\":null,\"flags\":0,\"components\":[],\"id\":\"1304786353984372827\",\"channel_id\":\"1288235003901120586\",\"author\":{\"id\":\"183261151746850816\",\"username\":\"individualcontributor\",\"avatar\":\"b7271f16ff804f9fa069bba774b3d0e7\",\"discriminator\":\"0\",\"public_flags\":0,\"flags\":0,\"banner\":null,\"accent_color\":null,\"global_name\":\"IndividualContributor\",\"avatar_decoration_data\":null,\"collectibles\":null,\"display_name_styles\":null,\"banner_color\":null,\"clan\":null,\"primary_guild\":null},\"pinned\":false,\"mention_everyone\":false,\"tts\":false,\"position\":880},{\"type\":0,\"content\":\"**Testing using non-CSR save at JenovaLife, same save file as previous testing**\\n\\nSave file https://discord.com/channels/936291902133796955/1288235003901120586/1304830909266001920\\n\\nFresh .bin of D1 with changes:\\n- significant changes made to Jenova life section to align with changes in latest v0.4.9: disc swap D1 > D2 works as expected\\n- + skipped intro: disc swap D1 > D2 works as expected (I wanted to see if this was causing the issue, it's not)\\n\\n\\nAdditional tests:\\n- v0.4.9: disc swap D1 > D2 does not work\\n- v0.1.1: disc swap D1 > D2 does not work\\n\\n\\nResults of these tests show that:\\n- making any kind of change to the scripts/code does not break the disc swapping mechanism on PSX, D2 > D3 currently works in v0.4.9 and these tests confirm that D1 > D2 disc swapping works with significant modifications, so something I did specifically is breaking disc swap\\n- changes to the JenovaLife section from v0.1.1. to v0.4.9 are not causing the issue, the issue was introduced prior to v0.1.1, tests showed that making changes similar to those that are present in v0.4.9 in the JenovaLife section allows the disc swapping D1 > D2 to work as expected, and also just testing the v0.1.1 patch breaks the D1 > D2 swapping, not working as expected\\n\\n\\nNext steps, burn a patch prior to v0.1.1 and test the disc swapping. Do a binary search on versions prior to v0.1.1, burn them and test to narrow down where the issue was introduced.\",\"mentions\":[],\"mention_roles\":[],\"attachments\":[],\"embeds\":[],\"timestamp\":\"2024-11-09T11:09:13.556000+00:00\",\"edited_timestamp\":\"2024-11-09T22:47:57.770000+00:00\",\"flags\":0,\"components\":[],\"id\":\"1304764732380680212\",\"channel_id\":\"1288235003901120586\",\"author\":{\"id\":\"183261151746850816\",\"username\":\"individualcontributor\",\"avatar\":\"b7271f16ff804f9fa069bba774b3d0e7\",\"discriminator\":\"0\",\"public_flags\":0,\"flags\":0,\"banner\":null,\"accent_color\":null,\"global_name\":\"IndividualContributor\",\"avatar_decoration_data\":null,\"collectibles\":null,\"display_name_styles\":null,\"banner_color\":null,\"clan\":null,\"primary_guild\":null},\"pinned\":false,\"mention_everyone\":false,\"tts\":false,\"position\":878},{\"type\":0,\"content\":\"CSR workstation lol\",\"mentions\":[],\"mention_roles\":[],\"attachments\":[],\"embeds\":[],\"timestamp\":\"2024-11-09T10:17:33.054000+00:00\",\"edited_timestamp\":null,\"flags\":0,\"components\":[],\"id\":\"1304751727932739616\",\"channel_id\":\"1288235003901120586\",\"author\":{\"id\":\"183261151746850816\",\"username\":\"individualcontributor\",\"avatar\":\"b7271f16ff804f9fa069bba774b3d0e7\",\"discriminator\":\"0\",\"public_flags\":0,\"flags\":0,\"banner\":null,\"accent_color\":null,\"global_name\":\"IndividualContributor\",\"avatar_decoration_data\":null,\"collectibles\":null,\"display_name_styles\":null,\"banner_color\":null,\"clan\":null,\"primary_guild\":null},\"pinned\":false,\"mention_everyone\":false,\"tts\":false,\"position\":877},{\"type\":0,\"content\":\"\",\"mentions\":[],\"mention_roles\":[],\"attachments\":[{\"id\":\"1304751556893343767\",\"filename\":\"IMG20241109101632.jpg\",\"size\":1833453,\"url\":\"https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/1288235003901120586/