            "text": "[{\"type\":0,\"content\":\"I think the confusion might also be that the versions weren't entirely labeled prior to 0.1.1? So maybe that referred to a few versions?\",\"mentions\":[],\"mention_roles\":[],\"attachments\":[],\"embeds\":[],\"timestamp\":\"2024-11-09T01:37:13.669000+00:00\",\"edited_timestamp\":null,\"flags\":0,\"components\":[],\"id\":\"1304620784341352458\",\"channel_id\":\"1288235003901120586\",\"author\":{\"id\":\"248225699909861376\",\"username\":\"awesomewaves\",\"avatar\":\"7de794a8a3e242252076a10784af0a9f\",\"discriminator\":\"0\",\"public_flags\":0,\"flags\":0,\"banner\":null,\"accent_color\":null,\"global_name\":\"awesomeWaves\",\"avatar_decoration_data\":null,\"collectibles\":null,\"display_name_styles\":null,\"banner_color\":null,\"clan\":null,\"primary_guild\":null},\"pinned\":false,\"mention_everyone\":false,\"tts\":false,\"position\":840},{\"type\":0,\"content\":\"on PSX\",\"mentions\":[],\"mention_roles\":[],\"attachments\":[],\"embeds\":[],\"timestamp\":\"2024-11-09T01:34:59.305000+00:00\",\"edited_timestamp\":null,\"flags\":0,\"components\":[],\"id\":\"1304620220777758790\",\"channel_id\":\"1288235003901120586\",\"author\":{\"id\":\"183261151746850816\",\"username\":\"individualcontributor\",\"avatar\":\"b7271f16ff804f9fa069bba774b3d0e7\",\"discriminator\":\"0\",\"public_flags\":0,\"flags\":0,\"banner\":null,\"accent_color\":null,\"global_name\":\"IndividualContributor\",\"avatar_decoration_data\":null,\"collectibles\":null,\"display_name_styles\":null,\"banner_color\":null,\"clan\":null,\"primary_guild\":null},\"pinned\":false,\"mention_everyone\":false,\"tts\":false,\"position\":839},{\"type\":0,\"content\":\"My understanding is that you were able to swap from D1 to D2 on v0.1.1?\",\"mentions\":[],\"mention_roles\":[],\"attachments\":[],\"embeds\":[],\"timestamp\":\"2024-11-09T01:34:53.589000+00:00\",\"edited_timestamp\":null,\"flags\":0,\"components\":[],\"id\":\"1304620196803121183\",\"channel_id\":\"1288235003901120586\",\"author\":{\"id\":\"183261151746850816\",\"username\":\"individualcontributor\",\"avatar\":\"b7271f16ff804f9fa069bba774b3d0e7\",\"discriminator\":\"0\",\"public_flags\":0,\"flags\":0,\"banner\":null,\"accent_color\":null,\"global_name\":\"IndividualContributor\",\"avatar_decoration_data\":null,\"collectibles\":null,\"display_name_styles\":null,\"banner_color\":null,\"clan\":null,\"primary_guild\":null},\"pinned\":false,\"mention_everyone\":false,\"tts\":false,\"position\":838},{\"type\":0,\"content\":\"> the disc swap issue was introduced in v0.1.1\\n<@170713534726930432> I don't think I fully understand the test you did for v0.1.1. How did you go about testing this?\",\"mentions\":[{\"id\":\"170713534726930432\",\"username\":\".okamikaze\",\"avatar\":\"95b696448d658de94544ca767feb61f0\",\"discriminator\":\"0\",\"public_flags\":0,\"flags\":0,\"banner\":null,\"accent_color\":null,\"global_name\":\"Okamikaze\",\"avatar_decoration_data\":null,\"collectibles\":null,\"display_name_styles\":null,\"banner_color\":null,\"clan\":null,\"primary_guild\":null}],\"mention_roles\":[],\"attachments\":[],\"embeds\":[],\"timestamp\":\"2024-11-09T01:34:09.267000+00:00\",\"edited_timestamp\":null,\"flags\":0,\"components\":[],\"id\":\"1304620010903310477\",\"channel_id\":\"1288235003901120586\",\"author\":{\"id\":\"183261151746850816\",\"username\":\"individualcontributor\",\"avatar\":\"b7271f16ff804f9fa069bba774b3d0e7\",\"discriminator\":\"0\",\"public_flags\":0,\"flags\":0,\"banner\":null,\"accent_color\":null,\"global_name\":\"IndividualContributor\",\"avatar_decoration_data\":null,\"collectibles\":null,\"display_name_styles\":null,\"banner_color\":null,\"clan\":null,\"primary_guild\":null},\"pinned\":false,\"mention_everyone\":false,\"tts\":false,\"position\":837},{\"type\":0,\"content\":\"Here's what we know so far:\\n\\n- file sizes for .bin files stays the same after patching\\n- previous CSR save files are not breaking the D1 to D2 swapping on CSR\\n- the disc swap issue was introduced in v0.1.1\\n\\nNext tests:\\n\\n- start from a fresh .bin, make a small change near D1 to D2 disc swap (jenova fight skip), skip from start to jenova, burn to disc, test in ps2 for disc swap issue\\n  - the result of this test will determine if any small change to the .bin breaks the D1 to D2 disc swap loading\\n\\n- if making a small change does not break disc swap loading, then start reverting changes made in v0.1.1 until it works... more detail on this later\",\"mentions\":[],\"mention_roles\":[],\"attachments\":[],\"embeds\":[],\"timestamp\":\"2024-11-09T01:33:10.681000+00:00\",\"edited_timestamp\":null,\"flags\":0,\"components\":[],\"id\":\"1304619765175685121\",\"channel_id\":\"1288235003901120586\",\"author\":{\"id\":\"183261151746850816\",\"username\":\"individualcontributor\",\"avatar\":\"b7271f16ff804f9fa069bba774b3d0e7\",\"discriminator\":\"0\",\"public_flags\":0,\"flags\":0,\"banner\":null,\"accent_color\":null,\"global_name\":\"IndividualContributor\",\"avatar_decoration_data\":null,\"collectibles\":null,\"display_name_styles\":null,\"banner_color\":null,\"clan\":null,\"primary_guild\":null},\"pinned\":false,\"mention_everyone\":false,\"tts\":false,\"position\":836},{\"type\":0,\"content\":\"Yeah sorry, just I recently moved some discs from my binder into a spindle so they were all stacked with no indication as to which was which\",\"mentions\":[],\"mention_roles\":[],\"attachments\":[],\"embeds\":[],\"timestamp\":\"2024-11-09T01:24:18.729000+00:00\",\"edited_timestamp\":null,\"flags\":0,\"components\":[],\"id\":\"1304617534007545947\",\"channel_id\":\"1288235003901120586\",\"author\":{\"id\":\"170713534726930432\",\"username\":\".okamikaze\",\"avatar\":\"95b696448d658de94544ca767feb61f0\",\"discriminator\":\"0\",\"public_flags\":0,\"flags\":0,\"banner\":null,\"accent_color\":null,\"global_name\":\"Okamikaze\",\"avatar_decoration_data\":null,\"collectibles\":null,\"display_name_styles\":null,\"banner_color\":null,\"clan\":null,\"primary_guild\":null},\"pinned\":false,\"mention_everyone\":false,\"tts\":false,\"position\":835},{\"type\":0,\"content\":\"D3 changes will start at whatever verison the latest is at by then\",\"mentions\":[],\"mention_roles\":[],\"attachments\":[],\"embeds\":[],\"timestamp\":\"2024-11-09T01:23:17.949000+00:00\",\"edited_timestamp\":null,\"flags\":0,\"components\":[],\"id\":\"1304617279077748788\",\"channel_id\":\"1288235003901120586\",\"author\":{\"id\":\"183261151746850816\",\"username\":\"individualcontributor\",\"avatar\":\"b7271f16ff804f9fa069bba774b3d0e7\",\"discriminator\":\"0\",\"public_flags\":0,\"flags\":0,\"banner\":null,\"accent_color\":null,\"global_name\":\"IndividualContributor\",\"avatar_decoration_data\":null,\"collectibles\":null,\"display_name_styles\":null,\"banner_color\":null,\"clan\":null,\"primary_guild\":null},\"pinned\":false,\"mention_everyone\":false,\"tts\":false,\"position\":834},{\"type\":0,\"content\":\"yes I'm keeping the versions for each disc the same even if there are no changes\",\"mentions\":[],\"mention_roles\":[],\"attachments\":[],\"embeds\":[],\"timestamp\":\"2024-11-09T01:22:59.738000+00:00\",\"edited_timestamp\":null,\"flags\":0,\"components\":[],\"id\":\"1304617202695143486\",\"channel_id\":\"1288235003901120586\",\"author\":{\"id\":\"183261151746850816\",\"username\":\"individualcontributor\",\"avatar\":\"b7271f16ff804f9fa069bba774b3d0e7\",\"discriminator\":\"0\",\"public_flags\":0,\"flags\":0,\"banner\":null,\"accent_color\":null,\"global_name\":\"IndividualContributor\",\"avatar_decoration_data\":null,\"collectibles\":null,\"display_name_styles\":null,\"banner_color\":null,\"clan\":null,\"primary_guild\":null},\"pinned\":false,\"mention_everyone\":false,\"tts\":false,\"position\":833},{\"type\":0,\"content\":\"Ah gotcha. I was able to discern the disc 1 I tried just now was that version by checking for the Don Corneo basement softlock. Not sure about for disc 2, but the fact it was right next to the disc 1 probably means this disc 2 is also 0.1.1\",\"mentions\":[],\"mention_roles\":[],\"attachments\":[],\"embeds\":[],\"timestamp\":\"2024-11-09T01:22:26.991000+00:00\",\"edited_timestamp\":\"2024-11-09T01:22:47.320000+00:00\",\"flags\":0,\"components\":[],\"id\":\"1304617065344405564\",\"channel_id\":\"1288235003901120586\",\"author\":{\"id\":\"170713534726930432\",\"username\":\".okamikaze\",\"avatar\":\"95b696448d658de94544ca767feb61f0\",\"discriminator\":\"0\",\"public_flags\":0,\"flags\":0,\"banner\":null,\"accent_color\":null,\"global_name\":\"Okamikaze\",\"avatar_decoration_data\":null,\"collectibles\":null,\"display_name_styles\":null,\"banner_color\":null,\"clan\":null,\"primary_guild\":null},\"pinned\":false,\"mention_everyone\":false,\"tts\":false,\"position\":832},{\"type\":0,\"content\":\"it's essentially locked in forever now\",\"mentions\":[],\"mention_roles\":[],\"attachments\":[],\"embeds\":[],\"timestamp\":\"2024-11-09T01:21:38.497000+00:00\",\"edited_timestamp\":null,\"flags\":0,\"components\":[],\"id\":\"1304616861945823342\",\"channel_id\":\"1288235003901120586\",\"author\":{\"id\":\"183261151746850816\",\"username\":\"individualcontributor\",\"avatar\":\"b7271f16ff804f9fa069bba774b3d0e7\",\"discriminator\":\"0\",\"public_flags\":0,\"flags\":0,\"banner\":null,\"accent_color\":null,\"global_name\":\"IndividualContributor\",\"avatar_decoration_data\":null,\"collectibles\":null,\"display_name_styles\":null,\"banner_color\":null,\"clan\":null,\"primary_guild\":null},\"pinned\":false,\"mention_everyone\":false,\"tts\":false,\"position\":831},{\"type\":0,\"content\":\"so v0.1.1 hasn't been updated since v0.2.0 came out\",\"mentions\":[],\"mention_roles\":[],\"attachments\":[],\"embeds\":[],\"timestamp\":\"2024-11-09T01:21:28.364000+00:00\",\"edited_timestamp\":null,\"flags\":0,\"components\":[],\"id\":\"1304616819444678697\",\"channel_id\":\"1288235003901120586\",\"author\":{\"id\":\"183261151746850816\",\"username\":\"individualcontributor\",\"avatar\":\"b7271f16ff804f9fa069bba774b3d0e7\",\"discriminator\":\"0\",\"public_flags\":0,\"flags\":0,\"banner\":null,\"accent_color\":null,\"global_name\":\"IndividualContributor\",\"avatar_decoration_data\":null,\"collectibles\":null,\"display_name_styles\":null,\"banner_color\":null,\"clan\":null,\"primary_guild\":null},\"pinned\":false,\"mention_everyone\":false,\"tts\":false,\"position\":830},{\"type\":0,\"content\":\"I only ever make changes to the most recent version\",\"mentions\":[],\"mention_roles\":[],\"attachments\":[],\"embeds\":[],\"timestamp\":\"2024-11-09T01:21:04.927000+00:00\",\"edited_timestamp\":null,\"flags\":0,\"components\":[],\"id\":\"1304616721143042071\",\"channel_id\":\"1288235003901120586\",\"author\":{\"id\":\"183261151746850816\",\"username\":\"individualcontributor\",\"avatar\":\"b7271f16ff804f9fa069bba774b3d0e7\",\"discriminator\":\"0\",\"public_flags\":0,\"flags\":0,\"banner\":null,\"accent_color\":null,\"global_name\":\"IndividualContributor\",\"avatar_decoration_data\":null,\"collectibles\":null,\"display_name_styles\":null,\"banner_color\":null,\"clan\":null,\"primary_guild\":null},\"pinned\":false,\"mention_everyone\":false,\"tts\":false,\"position\":829},{\"type\":0,\"content\":\"yes it was likely because i put them into folders for versioning\",\"mentions\":[],\"mention_roles\":[],\"attachments\":[],\"embeds\":[],\"timestamp\":\"2024-11-09T01:20:52.661000+00:00\",\"edited_timestamp\":\"2024-11-09T01:22:01.513000+00:00\",\"flags\":0,\"components\":[],\"id\":\"1304616669695578153\",\"channel_id\":\"1288235003901120586\",\"author\":{\"id\":\"183261151746850816\",\"username\":\"individualcontributor\",\"avatar\":\"b7271f16ff804f9fa069bba774b3d0e7\",\"discriminator\":\"0\",\"public_flags\":0,\"flags\":0,\"banner\":null,\"accent_color\":null,\"global_name\":\"IndividualContributor\",\"avatar_decoration_data\":null,\"collectibles\":null,\"display_name_styles\":null,\"banner_color\":null,\"clan\":null,\"primary_guild\":null},\"pinned\":false,\"mention_everyone\":false,\"tts\":false,\"position\":828},{\"type\":0,\"content\":\"On GitHub it says 0.1.1 was updated 2 weeks ago. Is that still the same version as your very first CSR for 7?\",\"mentions\":[],\"mention_roles\":[],\"attachments\":[],\"embeds\":[],\"timestamp\":\"2024-11-09T01:20:07.106000+00:00\",\"edited_timestamp\":null,\"flags\":0,\"components\":[],\"id\":\"1304616478624190525\",\"channel_id\":\"1288235003901120586\",\"author\":{\"id\":\"170713534726930432\",\"username\":\".okamikaze\",\"avatar\":\"95b696448d658de94544ca767feb61f0\",\"discriminator\":\"0\",\"public_flags\":0,\"flags\":0,\"banner\":null,\"accent_color\":null,\"global_name\":\"Okamikaze\",\"avatar_decoration_data\":null,\"collectibles\":null,\"display_name_styles\":null,\"banner_color\":null,\"clan\":null,\"primary_guild\":null},\"pinned\":false,\"mention_everyone\":false,\"tts\":false,\"position\":827},{\"type\":0,\"content\":\"Here are my test results from today:\\n\\nTested on PS2 Slim MechaPwn'd NTSC/U using physical discs and physical memory card with save files\\n\\n\\nD1 -> Disc 1\\nD2 -> Disc 2\\nregular -> not burned discs\\nburned -> burned discs with no modifications\\nCSR -> burned discs with modifications\\n\\n\\n**awesomeWaves CSR PS1 memcard file converted to .mcd then converted back to PS1 memcard file, before Jenova**\\n\\nD1 regular > load save > fight jenova > D2 regular > works fine\\nD1 regular > load save > fight jenova > D2 burned > works fine\\n\\nD1 burned > load save > fight jenova > D2 regular > works fine\\nD1 burned > load save > fight jenova > D2 burned > works fine\\n\\nD1 CSR > load save > skipped jenova > D2 regular > not working (no error noise)\\nD1 CSR > load save > skipped jenova > D2 burned > not working (no error noise)\\n\\n\\n \\n**IC non-CSR savestate file converted to PS1 memcard file, before Jenova**\\n\\nD1 regular > load save > fight jenova > D2 regular > works fine\\nD1 regular > load save > fight jenova > D2 burned > works fine\\n\\nD1 burned > load save > fight jenova > D2 regular > works fine\\nD1 burned > load save > fight jenova > D2 burned > works fine\\n\\nD1 CSR > load save > skipped jenova > D2 regular > not working (no error noise)\\nD1 CSR > load save > skipped jenova > D2 burned > not working (no error noise)\\n\\nThere are no differences between the results sets for 1) CSR save file and 2) non-CSR save file\",\"mentions\":[],\"mention_roles\":[],\"attachments\":[],\"embeds\":[],\"timestamp\":\"2024-11-09T01:18:37.640000+00:00\",\"edited_timestamp\":\"2024-11-09T01:20:24.014000+00:00\",\"flags\":0,\"components\":[],\"id\":\"1304616103376588830\",\"channel_id\":\"1288235003901120586\",\"author\":{\"id\":\"183261151746850816\",\"username\":\"individualcontributor\",\"avatar\":\"b7271f16ff804f9fa069bba774b3d0e7\",\"discriminator\":\"0\",\"public_flags\":0,\"flags\":0,\"banner\":null,\"accent_color\":null,\"global_name\":\"IndividualContributor\",\"avatar_decoration_data\":null,\"collectibles\":null,\"display_name_styles\":null,\"banner_color\":null,\"clan\":null,\"primary_guild\":null},\"pinned\":false,\"mention_everyone\":false,\"tts\":false,\"position\":826},{\"type\":0,\"content\":\"If we can get a full run of v0.1.1 CSR all the way to disc swap on PSX into a regular burned D2 and continue that would eliminate v0.1.1 being the problem.\",\"mentions\":[],\"mention_roles\":[],\"attachments\":[],\"embeds\":[],\"timestamp\":\"2024-11-09T01:18:09.479000+00:00\",\"edited_timestamp\":null,\"flags\":0,\"components\":[],\"id\":\"1304615985260527626\",\"channel_id\":\"1288235003901120586\",\"author\":{\"id\":\"183261151746850816\",\"username\":\"individualcontributor\",\"avatar\":\"b7271f16ff804f9fa069bba774b3d0e7\",\"discriminator\":\"0\",\"public_flags\":0,\"flags\":0,\"banner\":null,\"accent_color\":null,\"global_name\":\"IndividualContributor\",\"avatar_decoration_data\":null,\"collectibles\":null,\"display_name_styles\":null,\"banner_color\":null,\"clan\":null,\"primary_guild\":null},\"pinned\":false,\"mention_everyone\":false,\"tts\":false,\"position\":825},{\"type\":0,\"content\":\"Not sure which iteration this disc 2 is though, can you remember where the first place you trimmed disc 2 on the first csr version was?\",\"mentions\":[],\"mention_roles\":[],\"attachments\":[],\"embeds\":[],\"timestamp\":\"2024-11-09T01:16:28.252000+00:00\",\"edited_timestamp\":null,\"flags\":0,\"components\":[],\"id\":\"1304615560683716678\",\"channel_id\":\"1288235003901120586\",\"author\":{\"id\":\"170713534726930432\",\"username\":\".okamikaze\",\"avatar\":\"95b696448d658de94544ca767feb61f0\",\"discriminator\":\"0\",\"public_flags\":0,\"flags\":0,\"banner\":null,\"accent_color\":null,\"global_name\":\"Okamikaze\",\"avatar_decoration_data\":null,\"collectibles\":null,\"display_name_styles\":null,\"banner_color\":null,\"clan\":null,\"primary_guild\":null},\"pinned\":false,\"mention_everyone\":false,\"tts\":false,\"position\":824},{\"type\":0,\"content\":\"So I managed to swap to burned disc 2 from the original CSR disc 1 (with the Don Corneo basement softlock) just fine\",\"mentions\":[],\"mention_roles\":[],\"attachments\":[],\"embeds\":[],\"timestamp\":\"2024-11-09T01:15:46.970000+00:00\",\"edited_timestamp\":null,\"flags\":0,\"components\":[],\"id\":\"1304615387534721025\",\"channel_id\":\"1288235003901120586\",\"author\":{\"id\":\"170713534726930432\",\"username\":\".okamikaze\",\"avatar\":\"95b696448d658de94544ca767feb61f0\",\"discriminator\":\"0\",\"public_flags\":0,\"flags\":0,\"banner\":null,\"accent_color\":null,\"global_name\":\"Okamikaze\",\"avatar_decoration_data\":null,\"collectibles\":null,\"display_name_styles\":null,\"banner_color\":null,\"clan\":null,\"primary_guild\":null},\"pinned\":false,\"mention_everyone\":false,\"tts\":false,\"position\":823},{\"type\":0,\"content\":\"imagine it was because I removed the intro...\",\"mentions\":[],\"mention_roles\":[],\"attachments\":[],\"embeds\":[],\"timestamp\":\"2024-11-09T01:10:35.292000+00:00\",\"edited_timestamp\":null,\"flags\":0,\"components\":[],\"id\":\"1304614080262307912\",\"channel_id\":\"1288235003901120586\",\"author\":{\"id\":\"183261151746850816\",\"username\":\"individualcontributor\",\"avatar\":\"b7271f16ff804f9fa069bba774b3d0e7\",\"discriminator\":\"0\",\"public_flags\":0,\"flags\":0,\"banner\":null,\"accent_color\":null,\"global_name\":\"IndividualContributor\",\"avatar_decoration_data\":null,\"collectibles\":null,\"display_name_styles\":null,\"banner_color\":null,\"clan\":null,\"primary_guild\":null},\"pinned\":false,\"mention_everyone\":false,\"tts\":false,\"position\":822},{\"type\":0,\"content\":\"Also, the file sizes of the .bin files for D1 and D2 are the same for both regular and CSR so data being shited due to scripts being removed/moved/added etc. is not the issue\",\"mentions\":[],\"mention_roles\":[],\"attachments\":[],\"embeds\":[],\"timestamp\":\"2024-11-09T01:05:46.433000+00:00\",\"edited_timestamp\":\"2024-11-09T01:06:26.573000+00:00\",\"flags\":0,\"components\":[],\"id\":\"1304612868699717696\",\"channel_id\":\"1288235003901120586\",\"author\":{\"id\":\"183261151746850816\",\"username\":\"individualcontributor\",\"avatar\":\"b7271f16ff804f9fa069bba774b3d0e7\",\"discriminator\":\"0\",\"public_flags\":0,\"flags\":0,\"banner\":null,\"accent_color\":null,\"global_name\":\"IndividualContributor\",\"avatar_decoration_data\":null,\"collectibles\":null,\"display_name_styles\":null,\"banner_color\":null,\"clan\":null,\"primary_guild\":null},\"pinned\":false,\"mention_everyone\":false,\"tts\":false,\"position\":821}]\n"
