            "text": "[{\"type\":0,\"content\":\"ok nvm, it wasn't working on version 0.1.1 \\ud83d\\ude05\",\"mentions\":[],\"mention_roles\":[],\"attachments\":[],\"embeds\":[],\"timestamp\":\"2024-11-09T00:19:54.221000+00:00\",\"edited_timestamp\":null,\"flags\":0,\"components\":[],\"id\":\"1304601325086183455\",\"channel_id\":\"1288235003901120586\",\"author\":{\"id\":\"248225699909861376\",\"username\":\"awesomewaves\",\"avatar\":\"7de794a8a3e242252076a10784af0a9f\",\"discriminator\":\"0\",\"public_flags\":0,\"flags\":0,\"banner\":null,\"accent_color\":null,\"global_name\":\"awesomeWaves\",\"avatar_decoration_data\":null,\"collectibles\":null,\"display_name_styles\":null,\"banner_color\":null,\"clan\":null,\"primary_guild\":null},\"pinned\":false,\"mention_everyone\":false,\"tts\":false,\"position\":740},{\"type\":0,\"content\":\"Ok thank F my newly burned D2 works, phew\",\"mentions\":[],\"mention_roles\":[],\"attachments\":[],\"embeds\":[],\"timestamp\":\"2024-11-09T00:18:34.568000+00:00\",\"edited_timestamp\":null,\"flags\":0,\"components\":[],\"id\":\"1304600990997151814\",\"channel_id\":\"1288235003901120586\",\"author\":{\"id\":\"183261151746850816\",\"username\":\"individualcontributor\",\"avatar\":\"b7271f16ff804f9fa069bba774b3d0e7\",\"discriminator\":\"0\",\"public_flags\":0,\"flags\":0,\"banner\":null,\"accent_color\":null,\"global_name\":\"IndividualContributor\",\"avatar_decoration_data\":null,\"collectibles\":null,\"display_name_styles\":null,\"banner_color\":null,\"clan\":null,\"primary_guild\":null},\"pinned\":false,\"mention_everyone\":false,\"tts\":false,\"position\":739},{\"type\":0,\"content\":\"if it was let me know what version of the CSR it was\",\"mentions\":[],\"mention_roles\":[],\"attachments\":[],\"embeds\":[],\"timestamp\":\"2024-11-09T00:17:22.277000+00:00\",\"edited_timestamp\":null,\"flags\":0,\"components\":[],\"id\":\"1304600687786594385\",\"channel_id\":\"1288235003901120586\",\"author\":{\"id\":\"183261151746850816\",\"username\":\"individualcontributor\",\"avatar\":\"b7271f16ff804f9fa069bba774b3d0e7\",\"discriminator\":\"0\",\"public_flags\":0,\"flags\":0,\"banner\":null,\"accent_color\":null,\"global_name\":\"IndividualContributor\",\"avatar_decoration_data\":null,\"collectibles\":null,\"display_name_styles\":null,\"banner_color\":null,\"clan\":null,\"primary_guild\":null},\"pinned\":false,\"mention_everyone\":false,\"tts\":false,\"position\":738},{\"type\":0,\"content\":\"let me check my VODs\",\"mentions\":[],\"mention_roles\":[],\"attachments\":[],\"embeds\":[],\"timestamp\":\"2024-11-09T00:17:02.167000+00:00\",\"edited_timestamp\":null,\"flags\":0,\"components\":[],\"id\":\"1304600603439398933\",\"channel_id\":\"1288235003901120586\",\"author\":{\"id\":\"248225699909861376\",\"username\":\"awesomewaves\",\"avatar\":\"7de794a8a3e242252076a10784af0a9f\",\"discriminator\":\"0\",\"public_flags\":0,\"flags\":0,\"banner\":null,\"accent_color\":null,\"global_name\":\"awesomeWaves\",\"avatar_decoration_data\":null,\"collectibles\":null,\"display_name_styles\":null,\"banner_color\":null,\"clan\":null,\"primary_guild\":null},\"pinned\":false,\"mention_everyone\":false,\"tts\":false,\"position\":737},{\"type\":0,\"content\":\"I'm sure it was working in a previous version?\",\"mentions\":[],\"mention_roles\":[],\"attachments\":[],\"embeds\":[],\"timestamp\":\"2024-11-09T00:16:57.629000+00:00\",\"edited_timestamp\":null,\"flags\":0,\"components\":[],\"id\":\"1304600584405389426\",\"channel_id\":\"1288235003901120586\",\"author\":{\"id\":\"248225699909861376\",\"username\":\"awesomewaves\",\"avatar\":\"7de794a8a3e242252076a10784af0a9f\",\"discriminator\":\"0\",\"public_flags\":0,\"flags\":0,\"banner\":null,\"accent_color\":null,\"global_name\":\"awesomeWaves\",\"avatar_decoration_data\":null,\"collectibles\":null,\"display_name_styles\":null,\"banner_color\":null,\"clan\":null,\"primary_guild\":null},\"pinned\":false,\"mention_everyone\":false,\"tts\":false,\"position\":736},{\"type\":0,\"content\":\"https://tenor.com/view/spider-man3-toby-maguire-peter-parker-crying-sad-gif-3434577\",\"mentions\":[],\"mention_roles\":[],\"attachments\":[],\"embeds\":[{\"type\":\"gifv\",\"url\":\"https://tenor.com/view/spider-man3-toby-maguire-peter-parker-crying-sad-gif-3434577\",\"title\":\"oh why\",\"provider\":{\"name\":\"Tenor\",\"url\":\"https://tenor.co\"},\"thumbnail\":{\"url\":\"https://media.tenor.com/jsg_LTPgPxgAAAAe/spider-man3-toby-maguire.png\",\"proxy_url\":\"https://images-ext-1.discordapp.net/external/WQ7SwkZVGkExRJn1AJilYrjnXoHHgM_GU_aUQEW7UFM/https/media.tenor.com/jsg_LTPgPxgAAAAe/spider-man3-toby-maguire.png\",\"width\":252,\"height\":200,\"placeholder\":\"1TgOLoqCn5Zbl5d3d3ppmYaYBnh3gGc=\",\"placeholder_version\":1,\"flags\":0},\"video\":{\"url\":\"https://media.tenor.com/jsg_LTPgPxgAAAPo/spider-man3-toby-maguire.mp4\",\"proxy_url\":\"https://images-ext-1.discordapp.net/external/Kf2CAObZc0uNZDyD_tnnzfgR4_ULLPnedq2co0nbQXA/https/media.tenor.com/jsg_LTPgPxgAAAPo/spider-man3-toby-maguire.mp4\",\"width\":244,\"height\":194,\"placeholder\":\"1TgOLoqCn5Zbl5d3d3ppmYaYBnh3gGc=\",\"placeholder_version\":1,\"flags\":0},\"content_scan_version\":2}],\"timestamp\":\"2024-11-09T00:16:27.727000+00:00\",\"edited_timestamp\":null,\"flags\":0,\"components\":[],\"id\":\"1304600458987573400\",\"channel_id\":\"1288235003901120586\",\"author\":{\"id\":\"183261151746850816\",\"username\":\"individualcontributor\",\"avatar\":\"b7271f16ff804f9fa069bba774b3d0e7\",\"discriminator\":\"0\",\"public_flags\":0,\"flags\":0,\"banner\":null,\"accent_color\":null,\"global_name\":\"IndividualContributor\",\"avatar_decoration_data\":null,\"collectibles\":null,\"display_name_styles\":null,\"banner_color\":null,\"clan\":null,\"primary_guild\":null},\"pinned\":false,\"mention_everyone\":false,\"tts\":false,\"position\":735},{\"type\":0,\"content\":\"Ah fair enough it's fine I've burned a second D2 regular to test this. I've been working under the assumption that my PS2 and backups have been working as expected, swaps and all. But I can't seem to get backups to swap from D1 to D2 at the moment, which makes it difficult to determine if it is the CSR or just the fact it's a burned disc\",\"mentions\":[],\"mention_roles\":[],\"attachments\":[],\"embeds\":[],\"timestamp\":\"2024-11-09T00:16:03.653000+00:00\",\"edited_timestamp\":null,\"flags\":0,\"components\":[],\"id\":\"1304600358013763634\",\"channel_id\":\"1288235003901120586\",\"author\":{\"id\":\"183261151746850816\",\"username\":\"individualcontributor\",\"avatar\":\"b7271f16ff804f9fa069bba774b3d0e7\",\"discriminator\":\"0\",\"public_flags\":0,\"flags\":0,\"banner\":null,\"accent_color\":null,\"global_name\":\"IndividualContributor\",\"avatar_decoration_data\":null,\"collectibles\":null,\"display_name_styles\":null,\"banner_color\":null,\"clan\":null,\"primary_guild\":null},\"pinned\":false,\"mention_everyone\":false,\"tts\":false,\"position\":734},{\"type\":0,\"content\":\"Sorry i actually meant to read back over all the stuff from earlier, I spotted it while i was streaming but didn't read it properly.\",\"mentions\":[],\"mention_roles\":[],\"attachments\":[],\"embeds\":[],\"timestamp\":\"2024-11-09T00:08:19.347000+00:00\",\"edited_timestamp\":null,\"flags\":0,\"components\":[],\"id\":\"1304598410573254748\",\"channel_id\":\"1288235003901120586\",\"author\":{\"id\":\"248225699909861376\",\"username\":\"awesomewaves\",\"avatar\":\"7de794a8a3e242252076a10784af0a9f\",\"discriminator\":\"0\",\"public_flags\":0,\"flags\":0,\"banner\":null,\"accent_color\":null,\"global_name\":\"awesomeWaves\",\"avatar_decoration_data\":null,\"collectibles\":null,\"display_name_styles\":null,\"banner_color\":null,\"clan\":null,\"primary_guild\":null},\"pinned\":false,\"mention_everyone\":false,\"tts\":false,\"position\":733},{\"type\":0,\"content\":\"if they would be okay? Else I'd have to burn a set\",\"mentions\":[],\"mention_roles\":[],\"attachments\":[],\"embeds\":[],\"timestamp\":\"2024-11-09T00:07:27.861000+00:00\",\"edited_timestamp\":null,\"flags\":0,\"components\":[],\"id\":\"1304598194625319073\",\"channel_id\":\"1288235003901120586\",\"author\":{\"id\":\"248225699909861376\",\"username\":\"awesomewaves\",\"avatar\":\"7de794a8a3e242252076a10784af0a9f\",\"discriminator\":\"0\",\"public_flags\":0,\"flags\":0,\"banner\":null,\"accent_color\":null,\"global_name\":\"awesomeWaves\",\"avatar_decoration_data\":null,\"collectibles\":null,\"display_name_styles\":null,\"banner_color\":null,\"clan\":null,\"primary_guild\":null},\"pinned\":false,\"mention_everyone\":false,\"tts\":false,\"position\":732},{\"type\":0,\"content\":\"I've only actual NTSC discs\",\"mentions\":[],\"mention_roles\":[],\"attachments\":[],\"embeds\":[],\"timestamp\":\"2024-11-09T00:06:48.616000+00:00\",\"edited_timestamp\":null,\"flags\":0,\"components\":[],\"id\":\"1304598030019723314\",\"channel_id\":\"1288235003901120586\",\"author\":{\"id\":\"248225699909861376\",\"username\":\"awesomewaves\",\"avatar\":\"7de794a8a3e242252076a10784af0a9f\",\"discriminator\":\"0\",\"public_flags\":0,\"flags\":0,\"banner\":null,\"accent_color\":null,\"global_name\":\"awesomeWaves\",\"avatar_decoration_data\":null,\"collectibles\":null,\"display_name_styles\":null,\"banner_color\":null,\"clan\":null,\"primary_guild\":null},\"pinned\":false,\"mention_everyone\":false,\"tts\":false,\"position\":731},{\"type\":0,\"content\":\"I don't have normal backups\",\"mentions\":[],\"mention_roles\":[],\"attachments\":[],\"embeds\":[],\"timestamp\":\"2024-11-09T00:06:39.719000+00:00\",\"edited_timestamp\":null,\"flags\":0,\"components\":[],\"id\":\"1304597992703131768\",\"channel_id\":\"1288235003901120586\",\"author\":{\"id\":\"248225699909861376\",\"username\":\"awesomewaves\",\"avatar\":\"7de794a8a3e242252076a10784af0a9f\",\"discriminator\":\"0\",\"public_flags\":0,\"flags\":0,\"banner\":null,\"accent_color\":null,\"global_name\":\"awesomeWaves\",\"avatar_decoration_data\":null,\"collectibles\":null,\"display_name_styles\":null,\"banner_color\":null,\"clan\":null,\"primary_guild\":null},\"pinned\":false,\"mention_everyone\":false,\"tts\":false,\"position\":730},{\"type\":0,\"content\":\"<@248225699909861376> could you test something for me when you get a chance?\\n\\nPut this save file on your PS1 mem card and start with D1 burned (not CSR), load the save, kill Jenova, don't save, swap to D2 burned (not CSR), let me know if your normal burned discs work with that save? The save is a regular disc save I pulled from Duck station, not a CSR save so should not be borked\",\"mentions\":[{\"id\":\"248225699909861376\",\"username\":\"awesomewaves\",\"avatar\":\"7de794a8a3e242252076a10784af0a9f\",\"discriminator\":\"0\",\"public_flags\":0,\"flags\":0,\"banner\":null,\"accent_color\":null,\"global_name\":\"awesomeWaves\",\"avatar_decoration_data\":null,\"collectibles\":null,\"display_name_styles\":null,\"banner_color\":null,\"clan\":null,\"primary_guild\":null}],\"mention_roles\":[],\"attachments\":[{\"id\":\"1304596615616528424\",\"filename\":\"BASCUS-94163FF7-S02\",\"size\":8192,\"url\":\"https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/1288235003901120586/1304596615616528424/BASCUS-94163FF7-S02?ex=6a6e88c7&is=6a6d3747&hm=6ccea23aa7b11803a22abda0f160df7e44fe75d95b5a0312da537abdfe608c47&\",\"proxy_url\":\"https://media.discordapp.net/attachments/1288235003901120586/1304596615616528424/BASCUS-94163FF7-S02?ex=6a6e88c7&is=6a6d3747&hm=6ccea23aa7b11803a22abda0f160df7e44fe75d95b5a0312da537abdfe608c47&\",\"content_scan_version\":2}],\"embeds\":[],\"timestamp\":\"2024-11-09T00:01:11.527000+00:00\",\"edited_timestamp\":null,\"flags\":0,\"components\":[],\"id\":\"1304596616166113361\",\"channel_id\":\"1288235003901120586\",\"author\":{\"id\":\"183261151746850816\",\"username\":\"individualcontributor\",\"avatar\":\"b7271f16ff804f9fa069bba774b3d0e7\",\"discriminator\":\"0\",\"public_flags\":0,\"flags\":0,\"banner\":null,\"accent_color\":null,\"global_name\":\"IndividualContributor\",\"avatar_decoration_data\":null,\"collectibles\":null,\"display_name_styles\":null,\"banner_color\":null,\"clan\":null,\"primary_guild\":null},\"pinned\":false,\"mention_everyone\":false,\"tts\":false,\"position\":729},{\"type\":0,\"content\":\"And if you get an error noise during a disc swap that's a good thing, just means you need to put in a regular D2 for it to load, as opposed to no error noise during the disc swap which means it's borked and you have to reset and reload the save\",\"mentions\":[],\"mention_roles\":[],\"attachments\":[],\"embeds\":[],\"timestamp\":\"2024-11-08T23:09:15.629000+00:00\",\"edited_timestamp\":null,\"flags\":0,\"components\":[],\"id\":\"1304583547142537217\",\"channel_id\":\"1288235003901120586\",\"author\":{\"id\":\"183261151746850816\",\"username\":\"individualcontributor\",\"avatar\":\"b7271f16ff804f9fa069bba774b3d0e7\",\"discriminator\":\"0\",\"public_flags\":0,\"flags\":0,\"banner\":null,\"accent_color\":null,\"global_name\":\"IndividualContributor\",\"avatar_decoration_data\":null,\"collectibles\":null,\"display_name_styles\":null,\"banner_color\":null,\"clan\":null,\"primary_guild\":null},\"pinned\":false,\"mention_everyone\":false,\"tts\":false,\"position\":728},{\"type\":19,\"content\":\"Just tested this and it looks like you can't start with a regular D1 then swap into a burned D2, you get error noise and it won't load.\",\"mentions\":[],\"mention_roles\":[],\"attachments\":[],\"embeds\":[],\"timestamp\":\"2024-11-08T23:07:32.489000+00:00\",\"edited_timestamp\":null,\"flags\":0,\"components\":[],\"id\":\"1304583114542284841\",\"channel_id\":\"1288235003901120586\",\"author\":{\"id\":\"183261151746850816\",\"username\":\"individualcontributor\",\"avatar\":\"b7271f16ff804f9fa069bba774b3d0e7\",\"discriminator\":\"0\",\"public_flags\":0,\"flags\":0,\"banner\":null,\"accent_color\":null,\"global_name\":\"IndividualContributor\",\"avatar_decoration_data\":null,\"collectibles\":null,\"display_name_styles\":null,\"banner_color\":null,\"clan\":null,\"primary_guild\":null},\"pinned\":false,\"mention_everyone\":false,\"tts\":false,\"message_reference\":{\"type\":0,\"channel_id\":\"1288235003901120586\",\"message_id\":\"1304527671975350343\",\"guild_id\":\"936291902133796955\"},\"position\":727,\"referenced_message\":{\"type\":0,\"content\":\"Is it normal for D1 regular swapping to D2 burned to not work? Regardless of CSRs or save files.\\n\\nOr can we mix and match regular and burned discs?\",\"mentions\":[],\"mention_roles\":[],\"attachments\":[],\"embeds\":[],\"timestamp\":\"2024-11-08T19:27:13.951000+00:00\",\"edited_timestamp\":\"2024-11-08T19:27:51.955000+00:00\",\"flags\":0,\"components\":[],\"id\":\"1304527671975350343\",\"channel_id\":\"1288235003901120586\",\"author\":{\"id\":\"183261151746850816\",\"username\":\"individualcontributor\",\"avatar\":\"b7271f16ff804f9fa069bba774b3d0e7\",\"discriminator\":\"0\",\"public_flags\":0,\"flags\":0,\"banner\":null,\"accent_color\":null,\"global_name\":\"IndividualContributor\",\"avatar_decoration_data\":null,\"collectibles\":null,\"display_name_styles\":null,\"banner_color\":null,\"clan\":null,\"primary_guild\":null},\"pinned\":false,\"mention_everyone\":false,\"tts\":false,\"position\":724}},{\"type\":0,\"content\":\"Regular Disc 1 at Gongaga before Temple PS1 save file + level 99 Cloud, Tifa, and some of the others, for anyone interested. You'll need to copy this onto a PS1 memory card to use it with discs.\\n\\nIt also has awesomeWaves CSR Disc 1 at Jenova life save in slot 1 which was used in the test scenarios above.\",\"mentions\":[],\"mention_roles\":[],\"attachments\":[{\"id\":\"1304560715180540006\",\"filename\":\"BASCUS-94163FF7-S03\",\"size\":8192,\"url\":\"https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/1288235003901120586/1304560715180540006/BASCUS-94163FF7-S03?ex=6a6e6758&is=6a6d15d8&hm=a9cb494028901c6d13f4e2f7331c75abb63b86149c6e50e38cb490f637e3f612&\",\"proxy_url\":\"https://media.discordapp.net/attachments/1288235003901120586/1304560715180540006/BASCUS-94163FF7-S03?ex=6a6e6758&is=6a6d15d8&hm=a9cb494028901c6d13f4e2f7331c75abb63b86149c6e50e38cb490f637e3f612&\",\"content_scan_version\":4}],\"embeds\":[],\"timestamp\":\"2024-11-08T21:38:32.093000+00:00\",\"edited_timestamp\":\"2024-11-08T21:42:22.707000+00:00\",\"flags\":0,\"components\":[],\"id\":\"1304560715297718365\",\"channel_id\":\"1288235003901120586\",\"author\":{\"id\":\"183261151746850816\",\"username\":\"individualcontributor\",\"avatar\":\"b7271f16ff804f9fa069bba774b3d0e7\",\"discriminator\":\"0\",\"public_flags\":0,\"flags\":0,\"banner\":null,\"accent_color\":null,\"global_name\":\"IndividualContributor\",\"avatar_decoration_data\":null,\"collectibles\":null,\"display_name_styles\":null,\"banner_color\":null,\"clan\":null,\"primary_guild\":null},\"pinned\":false,\"mention_everyone\":false,\"tts\":false,\"position\":726},{\"type\":0,\"content\":\"My assumption for remaining tests is that using a non CSR save state converted to PS1 memory card file and running through the above scenarios will show different results. Comparing the results of both save files will show that awesomeWaves save file was borked by D1 CSR. If this is true I'll need to compare the common RAM variables in both saves to determine the differences and hopefully find the issue. It's very likely going to be that a variable was not set correctly, let's see.\",\"mentions\":[],\"mention_roles\":[],\"attachments\":[],\"embeds\":[],\"timestamp\":\"2024-11-08T19:44:23.564000+00:00\",\"edited_timestamp\":null,\"flags\":0,\"components\":[],\"id\":\"1304531990485139489\",\"channel_id\":\"1288235003901120586\",\"author\":{\"id\":\"183261151746850816\",\"username\":\"individualcontributor\",\"avatar\":\"b7271f16ff804f9fa069bba774b3d0e7\",\"discriminator\":\"0\",\"public_flags\":0,\"flags\":0,\"banner\":null,\"accent_color\":null,\"global_name\":\"IndividualContributor\",\"avatar_decoration_data\":null,\"collectibles\":null,\"display_name_styles\":null,\"banner_color\":null,\"clan\":null,\"primary_guild\":null},\"pinned\":false,\"mention_everyone\":false,\"tts\":false,\"position\":725},{\"type\":0,\"content\":\"Is it normal for D1 regular swapping to D2 burned to not work? Regardless of CSRs or save files.\\n\\nOr can we mix and match regular and burned discs?\",\"mentions\":[],\"mention_roles\":[],\"attachments\":[],\"embeds\":[],\"timestamp\":\"2024-11-08T19:27:13.951000+00:00\",\"edited_timestamp\":\"2024-11-08T19:27:51.955000+00:00\",\"flags\":0,\"components\":[],\"id\":\"1304527671975350343\",\"channel_id\":\"1288235003901120586\",\"author\":{\"id\":\"183261151746850816\",\"username\":\"individualcontributor\",\"avatar\":\"b7271f16ff804f9fa069bba774b3d0e7\",\"discriminator\":\"0\",\"public_flags\":0,\"flags\":0,\"banner\":null,\"accent_color\":null,\"global_name\":\"IndividualContributor\",\"avatar_decoration_data\":null,\"collectibles\":null,\"display_name_styles\":null,\"banner_color\":null,\"clan\":null,\"primary_guild\":null},\"pinned\":false,\"mention_everyone\":false,\"tts\":false,\"position\":724},{\"type\":0,\"content\":\"I'm going to test if deleting a script from the game decreases the file size too, my assumption here is that deleting a bunch of scripts as opposed to just moving them so they don't get executed is shifting where game data would normally live on the disc, and so when disc swap occurs the PS2 can't read the correct data because it's no longer in the right place on the disc. OR adding new scripts is shifting data.\\n\\n> D1 CSR > load save > skipped jenova > D2 regular > not working (no error noise)\\n\\nThis is why I'm thinking that, CSR moves data around and the PS2 is confused, so then tries to load a regular disc but has the wrong pointers to data because of the CSR. Other scenarios that use regular D2 during the swap seem to work fine. It's only when the CSR D1 is used does it break in this scenario.\",\"mentions\":[],\"mention_roles\":[],\"attachments\":[],\"embeds\":[],\"timestamp\":\"2024-11-08T18:59:52.520000+00:00\",\"edited_timestamp\":\"2024-11-08T19:05:30.771000+00:00\",\"flags\":0,\"components\":[],\"id\":\"1304520787314606124\",\"channel_id\":\"1288235003901120586\",\"author\":{\"id\":\"183261151746850816\",\"username\":\"individualcontributor\",\"avatar\":\"b7271f16ff804f9fa069bba774b3d0e7\",\"discriminator\":\"0\",\"public_flags\":0,\"flags\":0,\"banner\":null,\"accent_color\":null,\"global_name\":\"IndividualContributor\",\"avatar_decoration_data\":null,\"collectibles\":null,\"display_name_styles\":null,\"banner_color\":null,\"clan\":null,\"primary_guild\":null},\"pinned\":false,\"mention_everyone\":false,\"tts\":false,\"position\":723},{\"type\":0,\"content\":\"> D1 burned > load save > fight jenova > D2 burned > not working (error noise)\\n\\nThis one is weird, this tells me there is something wrong with the save that is preventing burned D2 from loading, not related to CSR (other than the save being made on a D1 CSR run). So likely the CSR broke the save which is then preventing burned discs from loading.\",\"mentions\":[],\"mention_roles\":[],\"attachments\":[],\"embeds\":[],\"timestamp\":\"2024-11-08T18:54:19.821000+00:00\",\"edited_timestamp\":\"2024-11-08T18:57:36.703000+00:00\",\"flags\":0,\"components\":[],\"id\":\"1304519391873863691\",\"channel_id\":\"1288235003901120586\",\"author\":{\"id\":\"183261151746850816\",\"username\":\"individualcontributor\",\"avatar\":\"b7271f16ff804f9fa069bba774b3d0e7\",\"discriminator\":\"0\",\"public_flags\":0,\"flags\":0,\"banner\":null,\"accent_color\":null,\"global_name\":\"IndividualContributor\",\"avatar_decoration_data\":null,\"collectibles\":null,\"display_name_styles\":null,\"banner_color\":null,\"clan\":null,\"primary_guild\":null},\"pinned\":false,\"mention_everyone\":false,\"tts\":false,\"position\":722},{\"type\":0,\"content\":\"Ok I've just tested this:\\n\\n- put in latest CSR D1\\n- mash through to D2 swap\\n- put in non-CSR burned D2\\n- error noise won't load\\n- put back in CSR D1\\n- it loads fine\\n\\n\\n... wtf\",\"mentions\":[],\"mention_roles\":[],\"attachments\":[],\"embeds\":[],\"timestamp\":\"2024-11-08T18:13:41.855000+00:00\",\"edited_timestamp\":\"2024-11-08T18:14:03.354000+00:00\",\"flags\":0,\"components\":[],\"id\":\"1304509166303314000\",\"channel_id\":\"1288235003901120586\",\"author\":{\"id\":\"183261151746850816\",\"username\":\"individualcontributor\",\"avatar\":\"b7271f16ff804f9fa069bba774b3d0e7\",\"discriminator\":\"0\",\"public_flags\":0,\"flags\":0,\"banner\":null,\"accent_color\":null,\"global_name\":\"IndividualContributor\",\"avatar_decoration_data\":null,\"collectibles\":null,\"display_name_styles\":null,\"banner_color\":null,\"clan\":null,\"primary_guild\":null},\"pinned\":false,\"mention_everyone\":false,\"tts\":false,\"position\":720}]\n"
