            "mimeType": "application/json",
            "text": "[{\"type\":0,\"content\":\"Maybe with DKWDRV USB emulation FF7 is perfect though\",\"mentions\":[],\"mention_roles\":[],\"attachments\":[],\"embeds\":[],\"timestamp\":\"2024-11-07T21:31:13.377000+00:00\",\"edited_timestamp\":null,\"flags\":0,\"components\":[],\"id\":\"1304196487323844762\",\"channel_id\":\"1288235003901120586\",\"author\":{\"id\":\"170713534726930432\",\"username\":\".okamikaze\",\"avatar\":\"95b696448d658de94544ca767feb61f0\",\"discriminator\":\"0\",\"public_flags\":0,\"flags\":0,\"banner\":null,\"accent_color\":null,\"global_name\":\"Okamikaze\",\"avatar_decoration_data\":null,\"collectibles\":null,\"display_name_styles\":null,\"banner_color\":null,\"clan\":null,\"primary_guild\":null},\"pinned\":false,\"mention_everyone\":false,\"tts\":false,\"position\":597},{\"type\":0,\"content\":\"OPL Pop is actually what I use currently when I'm dabbling with FF9 CSR, don't wanna wear my laser out just to enable me to play a game badly\",\"mentions\":[],\"mention_roles\":[],\"attachments\":[],\"embeds\":[],\"timestamp\":\"2024-11-07T21:30:44.478000+00:00\",\"edited_timestamp\":null,\"flags\":0,\"components\":[],\"id\":\"1304196366112657470\",\"channel_id\":\"1288235003901120586\",\"author\":{\"id\":\"170713534726930432\",\"username\":\".okamikaze\",\"avatar\":\"95b696448d658de94544ca767feb61f0\",\"discriminator\":\"0\",\"public_flags\":0,\"flags\":0,\"banner\":null,\"accent_color\":null,\"global_name\":\"Okamikaze\",\"avatar_decoration_data\":null,\"collectibles\":null,\"display_name_styles\":null,\"banner_color\":null,\"clan\":null,\"primary_guild\":null},\"pinned\":false,\"mention_everyone\":false,\"tts\":false,\"position\":596},{\"type\":0,\"content\":\"On USB I had no such luck with FF7 in the past, though I've heard there's a patch now for it on POPStarter\",\"mentions\":[],\"mention_roles\":[],\"attachments\":[],\"embeds\":[],\"timestamp\":\"2024-11-07T21:29:50.230000+00:00\",\"edited_timestamp\":null,\"flags\":0,\"components\":[],\"id\":\"1304196138580049991\",\"channel_id\":\"1288235003901120586\",\"author\":{\"id\":\"170713534726930432\",\"username\":\".okamikaze\",\"avatar\":\"95b696448d658de94544ca767feb61f0\",\"discriminator\":\"0\",\"public_flags\":0,\"flags\":0,\"banner\":null,\"accent_color\":null,\"global_name\":\"Okamikaze\",\"avatar_decoration_data\":null,\"collectibles\":null,\"display_name_styles\":null,\"banner_color\":null,\"clan\":null,\"primary_guild\":null},\"pinned\":false,\"mention_everyone\":false,\"tts\":false,\"position\":595},{\"type\":0,\"content\":\"Apparantly you don't need the POPStarter emulator if they are on a USB drive, so ima try that\",\"mentions\":[],\"mention_roles\":[],\"attachments\":[],\"embeds\":[],\"timestamp\":\"2024-11-07T21:27:57.241000+00:00\",\"edited_timestamp\":\"2024-11-07T21:28:07.008000+00:00\",\"flags\":0,\"components\":[],\"id\":\"1304195664670101616\",\"channel_id\":\"1288235003901120586\",\"author\":{\"id\":\"183261151746850816\",\"username\":\"individualcontributor\",\"avatar\":\"b7271f16ff804f9fa069bba774b3d0e7\",\"discriminator\":\"0\",\"public_flags\":0,\"flags\":0,\"banner\":null,\"accent_color\":null,\"global_name\":\"IndividualContributor\",\"avatar_decoration_data\":null,\"collectibles\":null,\"display_name_styles\":null,\"banner_color\":null,\"clan\":null,\"primary_guild\":null},\"pinned\":false,\"mention_everyone\":false,\"tts\":false,\"position\":594},{\"type\":0,\"content\":\"F, it looks like to play PS1 games over the network you need OPL + POPStarter, OPL is the network loader and POPStarter is a Sony Emulator. So even if I could get this working FF7 would run in an emulator on the PS2 hardware, as opposed to the game being loaded into memory as if from a disc. <:Sadge:1074826312767778950>\",\"mentions\":[],\"mention_roles\":[],\"attachments\":[],\"embeds\":[],\"timestamp\":\"2024-11-07T21:23:46.612000+00:00\",\"edited_timestamp\":\"2024-11-07T21:24:09.681000+00:00\",\"flags\":0,\"components\":[],\"id\":\"1304194613455880204\",\"channel_id\":\"1288235003901120586\",\"author\":{\"id\":\"183261151746850816\",\"username\":\"individualcontributor\",\"avatar\":\"b7271f16ff804f9fa069bba774b3d0e7\",\"discriminator\":\"0\",\"public_flags\":0,\"flags\":0,\"banner\":null,\"accent_color\":null,\"global_name\":\"IndividualContributor\",\"avatar_decoration_data\":null,\"collectibles\":null,\"display_name_styles\":null,\"banner_color\":null,\"clan\":null,\"primary_guild\":null},\"pinned\":false,\"mention_everyone\":false,\"tts\":false,\"position\":593},{\"type\":0,\"content\":\"Will do I'm just setting up my network stuff now\",\"mentions\":[],\"mention_roles\":[],\"attachments\":[],\"embeds\":[],\"timestamp\":\"2024-11-07T21:04:14.070000+00:00\",\"edited_timestamp\":null,\"flags\":0,\"components\":[],\"id\":\"1304189695458017344\",\"channel_id\":\"1288235003901120586\",\"author\":{\"id\":\"183261151746850816\",\"username\":\"individualcontributor\",\"avatar\":\"b7271f16ff804f9fa069bba774b3d0e7\",\"discriminator\":\"0\",\"public_flags\":0,\"flags\":0,\"banner\":null,\"accent_color\":null,\"global_name\":\"IndividualContributor\",\"avatar_decoration_data\":null,\"collectibles\":null,\"display_name_styles\":null,\"banner_color\":null,\"clan\":null,\"primary_guild\":null},\"pinned\":false,\"mention_everyone\":false,\"tts\":false,\"position\":592},{\"type\":19,\"content\":\"Please help me set it up if you figure out how to patch FF7 to work on OPL. Or if you're using DKWDRV let me know if it's good and worth using \\ud83d\\udc4d\",\"mentions\":[],\"mention_roles\":[],\"attachments\":[],\"embeds\":[],\"timestamp\":\"2024-11-07T20:50:31.345000+00:00\",\"edited_timestamp\":null,\"flags\":0,\"components\":[],\"id\":\"1304186244699521174\",\"channel_id\":\"1288235003901120586\",\"author\":{\"id\":\"170713534726930432\",\"username\":\".okamikaze\",\"avatar\":\"95b696448d658de94544ca767feb61f0\",\"discriminator\":\"0\",\"public_flags\":0,\"flags\":0,\"banner\":null,\"accent_color\":null,\"global_name\":\"Okamikaze\",\"avatar_decoration_data\":null,\"collectibles\":null,\"display_name_styles\":null,\"banner_color\":null,\"clan\":null,\"primary_guild\":null},\"pinned\":false,\"mention_everyone\":false,\"tts\":false,\"message_reference\":{\"type\":0,\"channel_id\":\"1288235003901120586\",\"message_id\":\"1304174317235474433\",\"guild_id\":\"936291902133796955\"},\"position\":591,\"referenced_message\":{\"type\":0,\"content\":\"I need to reproduce the Disc 2 not loading bug so I'm going to try loading the patched Disc 1 from a USB on the PS2 using FreeMcBoot stuff, then see if I can get to Disc 2 swap and beyond. Hopefully loading from USB is equivalent to Disc and it borks\",\"mentions\":[],\"mention_roles\":[],\"attachments\":[],\"embeds\":[],\"timestamp\":\"2024-11-07T20:03:07.616000+00:00\",\"edited_timestamp\":null,\"flags\":0,\"components\":[],\"id\":\"1304174317235474433\",\"channel_id\":\"1288235003901120586\",\"author\":{\"id\":\"183261151746850816\",\"username\":\"individualcontributor\",\"avatar\":\"b7271f16ff804f9fa069bba774b3d0e7\",\"discriminator\":\"0\",\"public_flags\":0,\"flags\":0,\"banner\":null,\"accent_color\":null,\"global_name\":\"IndividualContributor\",\"avatar_decoration_data\":null,\"collectibles\":null,\"display_name_styles\":null,\"banner_color\":null,\"clan\":null,\"primary_guild\":null},\"pinned\":false,\"mention_everyone\":false,\"tts\":false,\"position\":581}},{\"type\":0,\"content\":\"https://tenor.com/view/yeah-gif-21319775\",\"mentions\":[],\"mention_roles\":[],\"attachments\":[],\"embeds\":[{\"type\":\"gifv\",\"url\":\"https://tenor.com/view/yeah-gif-21319775\",\"provider\":{\"name\":\"Tenor\",\"url\":\"https://tenor.co\"},\"thumbnail\":{\"url\":\"https://media.tenor.com/tAlzzyRAhHEAAAAe/yeah.png\",\"proxy_url\":\"https://images-ext-1.discordapp.net/external/NNXsgaMkSwvh74LZvden2w9RVeNM0J4BO570MrR7vqQ/https/media.tenor.com/tAlzzyRAhHEAAAAe/yeah.png\",\"width\":640,\"height\":346,\"placeholder\":\"GAgODIIGaXqke1l3d3oHWHdwZQ==\",\"placehol