Hope\",\"avatar_decoration_data\":null,\"collectibles\":null,\"display_name_styles\":null,\"banner_color\":null,\"clan\":null,\"primary_guild\":null},\"pinned\":false,\"mention_everyone\":false,\"tts\":false,\"position\":506}},{\"type\":0,\"content\":\"I also had experiments for start/end but I couldn't find anything satisfying so those are manual.\",\"mentions\":[],\"mention_roles\":[],\"attachments\":[],\"embeds\":[],\"timestamp\":\"2024-11-07T00:46:14.508000+00:00\",\"edited_timestamp\":null,\"flags\":0,\"components\":[],\"id\":\"1303883177559068744\",\"channel_id\":\"1288235003901120586\",\"author\":{\"id\":\"191046608064872449\",\"username\":\"hopeproductions\",\"avatar\":\"ea6a8fcda648eb65fdae9becbd0c4fe4\",\"discriminator\":\"0\",\"public_flags\":512,\"flags\":512,\"banner\":null,\"accent_color\":null,\"global_name\":\"Hope\",\"avatar_decoration_data\":null,\"collectibles\":null,\"display_name_styles\":null,\"banner_color\":null,\"clan\":null,\"primary_guild\":null},\"pinned\":false,\"mention_everyone\":false,\"tts\":false,\"position\":507},{\"type\":0,\"content\":\"<@183261151746850816> does your game moment get set back at the same time effectively if you let the timer run out vs if you hit \\\"continue\\\" or w/e\",\"mentions\":[{\"id\":\"183261151746850816\",\"username\":\"individualcontributor\",\"avatar\":\"b7271f16ff804f9fa069bba774b3d0e7\",\"discriminator\":\"0\",\"public_flags\":0,\"flags\":0,\"banner\":null,\"accent_color\":null,\"global_name\":\"IndividualContributor\",\"avatar_decoration_data\":null,\"collectibles\":null,\"display_name_styles\":null,\"banner_color\":null,\"clan\":null,\"primary_guild\":null}],\"mention_roles\":[],\"attachments\":[],\"embeds\":[],\"timestamp\":\"2024-11-07T00:45:12.717000+00:00\",\"edited_timestamp\":null,\"flags\":0,\"components\":[],\"id\":\"1303882918388695060\",\"channel_id\":\"1288235003901120586\",\"author\":{\"id\":\"191046608064872449\",\"username\":\"hopeproductions\",\"avatar\":\"ea6a8fcda648eb65fdae9becbd0c4fe4\",\"discriminator\":\"0\",\"public_flags\":512,\"flags\":512,\"banner\":null,\"accent_color\":null,\"global_name\":\"Hope\",\"avatar_decoration_data\":null,\"collectibles\":null,\"display_name_styles\":null,\"banner_color\":null,\"clan\":null,\"primary_guild\":null},\"pinned\":false,\"mention_everyone\":false,\"tts\":false,\"position\":506},{\"type\":0,\"content\":\"I didn't add anything to subtract time for the break that IC made, I'd have to look into how to do that but I doubt its too hard to add.\",\"mentions\":[],\"mention_roles\":[],\"attachments\":[],\"embeds\":[],\"timestamp\":\"2024-11-07T00:44:29.120000+00:00\",\"edited_timestamp\":null,\"flags\":0,\"components\":[],\"id\":\"1303882735529627669\",\"channel_id\":\"1288235003901120586\",\"author\":{\"id\":\"191046608064872449\",\"username\":\"hopeproductions\",\"avatar\":\"ea6a8fcda648eb65fdae9becbd0c4fe4\",\"discriminator\":\"0\",\"public_flags\":512,\"flags\":512,\"banner\":null,\"accent_color\":null,\"global_name\":\"Hope\",\"avatar_decoration_data\":null,\"collectibles\":null,\"display_name_styles\":null,\"banner_color\":null,\"clan\":null,\"primary_guild\":null},\"pinned\":false,\"mention_everyone\":false,\"tts\":false,\"position\":505},{\"type\":0,\"content\":\"Just uses game moment, field ID, formation ID, and gil to decide when to split\",\"mentions\":[],\"mention_roles\":[],\"attachments\":[],\"embeds\":[],\"timestamp\":\"2024-11-07T00:44:00.269000+00:00\",\"edited_timestamp\":null,\"flags\":0,\"components\":[],\"id\":\"1303882614519758880\",\"channel_id\":\"1288235003901120586\",\"author\":{\"id\":\"191046608064872449\",\"username\":\"hopeproductions\",\"avatar\":\"ea6a8fcda648eb65fdae9becbd0c4fe4\",\"discriminator\":\"0\",\"public_flags\":512,\"flags\":512,\"banner\":null,\"accent_color\":null,\"global_name\":\"Hope\",\"avatar_decoration_data\":null,\"collectibles\":null,\"display_name_styles\":null,\"banner_color\":null,\"clan\":null,\"primary_guild\":null},\"pinned\":false,\"mention_everyone\":false,\"tts\":false,\"position\":504},{\"type\":0,\"content\":\"So speaking to earlier I made an autosplitter a while back for Emu. I think it should work but my last test I didnt finish if someone is running soon and wants to give it go. https://pastebin.com/Lyu5p2rz\\n\\nYou do need to adjust this one repeated bit at the top for whatever your offset is in your emulator I think for the pointers to pick up the correct things. Otherwise I can probably test this weekend but thought I'd give what I had for people.\",\"mentions\":[],\"mention_roles\":[],\"attachments\":[{\"id\":\"1303882405303816212\",\"filename\":\"image.png\",\"size\":43204,\"url\":\"https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/1288235003901120586/1303882405303816212/image.png?ex=6a6e929e&is=6a6d411e&hm=2586eeef8e09250aed73ef565f55a6a5c6e88de5f9fd0beaed521078474af553&\",\"proxy_url\":\"https://media.discordapp.net/attachments/1288235003901120586/1303882405303816212/image.png?ex=6a6e929e&is=6a6d411e&hm=2586eeef8e09250aed73ef565f55a6a5c6e88de5f9fd0beaed521078474af553&\",\"width\":626,\"height\":417,\"content_type\":\"image/png\",\"content_scan_version\":4,\"placeholder\":\"0fcNBYDAZnnEhXiHd4iWh68+9qmF\",\"placeholder_version\":1}],\"embeds\":[{\"type\":\"link\",\"url\":\"https://pastebin.com/Lyu5p2rz\",\"title\":\"FF VII Emu Autosplitter - Pastebin.com\",\"description\":\"Pastebin.com is the number one paste tool since 2002. Pastebin is a website where you can store text online for a set period of time.\",\"provider\":{\"name\":\"Pastebin\"},\"content_scan_version\":4}],\"timestamp\":\"2024-11-07T00:43:10.343000+00:00\",\"edited_timestamp\":null,\"flags\":0,\"components\":[],\"id\":\"1303882405114941520\",\"channel_id\":\"1288235003901120586\",\"author\":{\"id\":\"191046608064872449\",\"username\":\"hopeproductions\",\"avatar\":\"ea6a8fcda648eb65fdae9becbd0c4fe4\",\"discriminator\":\"0\",\"public_flags\":512,\"flags\":512,\"banner\":null,\"accent_color\":null,\"global_name\":\"Hope\",\"avatar_decoratio