00:00\",\"edited_timestamp\":null,\"flags\":0,\"components\":[],\"id\":\"1303848112481239092\",\"channel_id\":\"1288235003901120586\",\"author\":{\"id\":\"248225699909861376\",\"username\":\"awesomewaves\",\"avatar\":\"7de794a8a3e242252076a10784af0a9f\",\"discriminator\":\"0\",\"public_flags\":0,\"flags\":0,\"banner\":null,\"accent_color\":null,\"global_name\":\"awesomeWaves\",\"avatar_decoration_data\":null,\"collectibles\":null,\"display_name_styles\":null,\"banner_color\":null,\"clan\":null,\"primary_guild\":null},\"pinned\":false,\"mention_everyone\":false,\"tts\":false,\"position\":495},{\"type\":0,\"content\":\"https://tenor.com/view/dopamine-rickjames-rick-james-hell-gif-25037710\",\"mentions\":[],\"mention_roles\":[],\"attachments\":[],\"embeds\":[{\"type\":\"gifv\",\"url\":\"https://tenor.com/view/dopamine-rickjames-rick-james-hell-gif-25037710\",\"provider\":{\"name\":\"Tenor\",\"url\":\"https://tenor.co\"},\"thumbnail\":{\"url\":\"https://media.tenor.com/dmBuFvzzQVwAAAAe/dopamine-rickjames.png\",\"proxy_url\":\"https://images-ext-1.discordapp.net/external/b8XZ709CXnPsY6BICMaNRB5JJjBklkutwO1R92rdMM8/https/media.tenor.com/dmBuFvzzQVwAAAAe/dopamine-rickjames.png\",\"width\":640,\"height\":480,\"placeholder\":\"SwgGDYZdpnSAaYlpeaaYcW+sNEB3\",\"placeholder_version\":1,\"flags\":0},\"video\":{\"url\":\"https://media.tenor.com/dmBuFvzzQVwAAAPo/dopamine-rickjames.mp4\",\"proxy_url\":\"https://images-ext-1.discordapp.net/external/8rDtpdoOZO8sjTPkh8O8IWKr4z80-0ahr_vROxfZTHo/https/media.tenor.com/dmBuFvzzQVwAAAPo/dopamine-rickjames.mp4\",\"width\":640,\"height\":480,\"placeholder\":\"SwgGDYZdpnSAaYlpeaaYcW+sNEB3\",\"placeholder_version\":1,\"flags\":0},\"content_scan_version\":3}],\"timestamp\":\"2024-11-06T22:03:06.783000+00:00\",\"edited_timestamp\":null,\"flags\":0,\"components\":[],\"id\":\"1303842124864819260\",\"channel_id\":\"1288235003901120586\",\"author\":{\"id\":\"183261151746850816\",\"username\":\"individualcontributor\",\"avatar\":\"b7271f16ff804f9fa069bba774b3d0e7\",\"discriminator\":\"0\",\"public_flags\":0,\"flags\":0,\"banner\":null,\"accent_color\":null,\"global_name\":\"IndividualContributor\",\"avatar_decoration_data\":null,\"collectibles\":null,\"display_name_styles\":null,\"banner_color\":null,\"clan\":null,\"primary_guild\":null},\"pinned\":false,\"mention_everyone\":false,\"tts\":false,\"position\":494},{\"type\":0,\"content\":\"Meh I don't know, I'm going to go fix Junon for a dopamine hit\",\"mentions\":[],\"mention_roles\":[],\"attachments\":[],\"embeds\":[],\"timestamp\":\"2024-11-06T22:02:57.871000+00:00\",\"edited_timestamp\":null,\"flags\":0,\"components\":[],\"id\":\"1303842087485177896\",\"channel_id\":\"1288235003901120586\",\"author\":{\"id\":\"183261151746850816\",\"username\":\"individualcontributor\",\"avatar\":\"b7271f16ff804f9fa069bba774b3d0e7\",\"discriminator\":\"0\",\"public_flags\":0,\"flags\":0,\"banner\":null,\"accent_color\":null,\"global_name\":\"IndividualContributor\",\"avatar_decoration_data\":null,\"collectibles\":null,\"display_name_styles\":null,\"banner_color\":null,\"clan\":null,\"primary_guild\":null},\"pinned\":false,\"mention_everyone\":false,\"tts\":false,\"position\":493},{\"type\":0,\"content\":\"Now that I think about this, if the bit was on going into this scene initially and the first \\\"if\\\" statement is being called which is causing an error, the \\\"Disc 2 image\\\" should show up and you should not be getting asked to save your game, but you do...\",\"mentions\":[],\"mention_roles\":[],\"attachments\":[],\"embeds\":[],\"timestamp\":\"2024-11-06T22:01:30.933000+00:00\",\"edited_timestamp\":null,\"flags\":0,\"components\":[],\"id\":\"1303841722840780972\",\"channel_id\":\"1288235003901120586\",\"author\":{\"id\":\"183261151746850816\",\"username\":\"individualcontributor\",\"avatar\":\"b7271f16ff804f9fa069bba774b3d0e7\",\"discriminator\":\"0\",\"public_flags\":0,\"flags\":0,\"banner\":null,\"accent_color\":null,\"global_name\":\"IndividualContributor\",\"avatar_decoration_data\":null,\"collectibles\":null,\"display_name_styles\":null,\"banner_color\":null,\"clan\":null,\"primary_guild\":null},\"pinned\":false,\"mention_everyone\":false,\"tts\":false,\"position\":492},{\"type\":0,\"content\":\"So I think the logic here is, it should be off initially so the second \\\"if\\\" statement should load, then if you save the game and this scene is re-loaded the bit is now on and the first \\\"if\\\" statement is run which skips the \\\"Save game\\\" question.\",\"mentions\":[],\"mention_roles\":[],\"attachments\":[],\"embeds\":[],\"timestamp\":\"2024-11-06T22:00:07.530000+00:00\",\"edited_timestamp\":null,\"flags\":0,\"components\":[],\"id\":\"1303841373023375360\",\"channel_id\":\"1288235003901120586\",\"author\":{\"id\":\"183261151746850816\",\"username\":\"individualcontributor\",\"avatar\":\"b7271f16ff804f9fa069bba774b3d0e7\",\"discriminator\":\"0\",\"public_flags\":0,\"flags\":0,\"banner\":null,\"accent_color\":null,\"global_name\":\"IndividualContributor\",\"avatar_decoration_data\":null,\"collectibles\":null,\"display_name_styles\":null,\"banner_color\":null,\"clan\":null,\"primary_guild\":null},\"pinned\":false,\"mention_everyone\":false,\"tts\":false,\"position\":491},{\"type\":0,\"content\":\"Quick search and it looks like that bit 2 in Var[3][134] is being turned on in the second \\\"if\\\" statement I mentioned above...\",\"mentions\":[],\"mention_roles\":[],\"attachments\":[],\"embeds\":[],\"timestamp\":\"2024-11-06T21:58:46.351000+00:00\",\"edited_timestamp\":null,\"flags\":0,\"components\":[],\"id\":\"1303841032533835799\",\"channel_id\":\"1288235003901120586\",\"author\":{\"id\":\"183261151746850816\",\"username\":\"individualcontributor\",\"avatar\":\"b7271f16ff804f9fa069bba774b3d0e7\",\"discriminator\":\"0\",\"public_flags\":0,\"flags\":0,\"banner\":null,\"accent_color\":null,\"global_name\":\"IndividualContributor\",\"avatar_decoration_data\":null,\"collectibles\":null,\"display_name_styles\":null,\"banner_color\":null,\"clan\":null,\"primary_guild\":null},\"pinned\":false,\"mention_everyone\":false,\"tts\":false,\"position\":490},{\"type\":0,\"content\":\"\",\"mentions\":[],\"mention_roles\":[],\"attachments\":[{\"id\":\"1303840074848276510\",\"filename\":\"image.png\",\"size\":146502,\"url\":\"https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/1288235003901120586/1303840074848276510/image.png?ex=6a6e6b32&is=6a6d19b2&hm=e5bb87ae4cee50c8ce940b5b6ffd3ffa31449424bfb7fc4c608267b9ea011374&\",\"proxy_url\":\"https://media.discordapp.net/attachments/1288235003901120586/1303840074848276510/image.png?ex=6a6e6b32&is=6a6d19b2&hm=e5bb87ae4cee50c8ce940b5b6ffd3ffa31449424bfb7fc4c608267b9ea011374&\",\"width\":1756,\"height\":1206,\"content_type\":\"image/png\",\"content_scan_version\":3,\"placeholder\":\"0AcKBYB4iHePh3d6eLd4eVBZLPfj\",\"placeholder_version\":1}],\"embeds\":[],\"timestamp\":\"2024-11-06T21:54:58.089000+00:00\",\"edited_timestamp\":null,\"flags\":0,\"components\":[],\"id\":\"1303840075133751317\",\"channel_id\":\"1288235003901120586\",\"author\":{\"id\":\"183261151746850816\",\"username\":\"individualcontributor\",\"avatar\":\"b7271f16ff804f9fa069bba774b3d0e7\",\"discriminator\":\"0\",\"public_flags\":0,\"flags\":0,\"banner\":null,\"accent_color\":null,\"global_name\":\"IndividualContributor\",\"avatar_decoration_data\":null,\"collectibles\":null,\"display_name_styles\":null,\"banner_color\":null,\"clan\":null,\"primary_guild\":null},\"pinned\":false,\"mention_everyone\":false,\"tts\":false,\"position\":489},{\"type\":0,\"content\":\"It does. Gonna find where that normally gets turned on when I get home\",\"mentions\":[],\"mention_roles\":[],\"attachments\":[],\"embeds\":[],\"timestamp\":\"2024-11-06T21:53:48.657000+00:00\",\"edited_timestamp\":null,\"flags\":0,\"components\":[],\"id\":\"1303839783914569799\",\"channel_id\":\"1288235003901120586\",\"author\":{\"id\":\"191046608064872449\",\"username\":\"hopeproductions\",\"avatar\":\"ea6a8fcda648eb65fdae9becbd0c4fe4\",\"discriminator\":\"0\",\"public_flags\":512,\"flags\":512,\"banner\":null,\"accent_color\":null,\"global_name\":\"Hope\",\"avatar_decoration_data\":null,\"collectibles\":null,\"display_name_styles\":null,\"banner_color\":null,\"clan\":null,\"primary_guild\":null},\"pinned\":false,\"mention_everyone\":false,\"tts\":false,\"position\":487},{\"type\":0,\"content\":\"hope that makes sense <:baHmm:1074812804747497503>\",\"mentions\":[],\"mention_roles\":[],\"attachments\":[],\"embeds\":[],\"timestamp\":\"2024-11-06T21:52:15.069000+00:00\",\"edited_timestamp\":null,\"flags\":0,\"components\":[],\"id\":\"1303839391378047117\",\"channel_id\":\"1288235003901120586\",\"author\":{\"id\":\"183261151746850816\",\"username\":\"individualcontributor\",\"avatar\":\"b7271f16ff804f9fa069bba774b3d0e7\",\"discriminator\":\"0\",\"public_flags\":0,\"flags\":0,\"banner\":null,\"accent_color\":null,\"global_name\":\"IndividualContributor\",\"avatar_decoration_data\":null,\"collectibles\":null,\"display_name_styles\":null,\"banner_color\":null,\"clan\":null,\"primary_guild\":null},\"pinned\":false,\"mention_everyone\":false,\"tts\":false,\"position\":486},{\"type\":0,\"content\":\"In losin2 632 > 9 cloud > Script 3, at the end blackbgb (103) is loaded which has a bunch of \\\"if\\\" statements. There are two \\\"if\\\" statements for Disc 2 swap. \\n\\nThe first \\\"if\\\" checks: \\n\\n```\\nif Var[3][134] bitON 2 (else ....)\\n  ... do some stuff\\n  Ask for disc 2\\n  ... do some stuff\\n```\\n\\nThe second \\\"if\\\" statement checks:\\n\\n```\\nif Var[3][136] bitON 4 (else ....)\\n  ... do some stuff\\n  Ask for disc 2\\n  ... do some stuff\\n```\\n\\nThe first \\\"if\\\" was running and causing an error in the console, the second \\\"if\\\" statement is the correct one, does not cause an error in the console.\\n\\nSo I must have skipped doing this somewhere\\n\\n```\\nBit 2 OFF in Var[3][134]\\n```\\nwhich caused the first \\\"if\\\" statement to run. I just manually turn off bit 2 in var[3][13