            "mimeType": "application/json",
            "text": "[{\"type\":0,\"content\":\"I'll fix this but might be tomorrow night if i run out of time tonight \\ud83d\\ude43\",\"mentions\":[],\"mention_roles\":[],\"attachments\":[],\"embeds\":[],\"timestamp\":\"2024-11-06T21:18:06.563000+00:00\",\"edited_timestamp\":null,\"flags\":0,\"components\":[],\"id\":\"1303830799321399348\",\"channel_id\":\"1288235003901120586\",\"author\":{\"id\":\"183261151746850816\",\"username\":\"individualcontributor\",\"avatar\":\"b7271f16ff804f9fa069bba774b3d0e7\",\"discriminator\":\"0\",\"public_flags\":0,\"flags\":0,\"banner\":null,\"accent_color\":null,\"global_name\":\"IndividualContributor\",\"avatar_decoration_data\":null,\"collectibles\":null,\"display_name_styles\":null,\"banner_color\":null,\"clan\":null,\"primary_guild\":null},\"pinned\":false,\"mention_everyone\":false,\"tts\":false,\"position\":476},{\"type\":0,\"content\":\"I've double checked the actual disc swap scripts and they are untouched for this section. I'm wondering now if it's something to do with music or text boxes, if I didn't reset a text box properly, or skipped some music initialization stuff at some point near the end of D1 it might be being reset of checked by scenes up to this point, so left borked from ages ago\",\"mentions\":[],\"mention_roles\":[],\"attachments\":[],\"embeds\":[],\"timestamp\":\"2024-11-06T21:16:56.657000+00:00\",\"edited_timestamp\":\"2024-11-06T21:17:03.408000+00:00\",\"flags\":0,\"components\":[],\"id\":\"1303830506114257026\",\"channel_id\":\"1288235003901120586\",\"author\":{\"id\":\"183261151746850816\",\"username\":\"individualcontributor\",\"avatar\":\"b7271f16ff804f9fa069bba774b3d0e7\",\"discriminator\":\"0\",\"public_flags\":0,\"flags\":0,\"banner\":null,\"accent_color\":null,\"global_name\":\"IndividualContributor\",\"avatar_decoration_data\":null,\"collectibles\":null,\"display_name_styles\":null,\"banner_color\":null,\"clan\":null,\"primary_guild\":null},\"pinned\":false,\"mention_everyone\":false,\"tts\":false,\"position\":475},{\"type\":0,\"content\":\"So this is telling me there is something really F'd on D1 that is not being \\\"set\\\" during the CoTA scenes. And if it's not being borked by changes in CoTA it must be borked somewhere on D1 and only showing up then during disc swap.\",\"mentions\":[],\"mention_roles\":[],\"attachments\":[],\"embeds\":[],\"timestamp\":\"2024-11-06T21:14:34.978000+00:00\",\"edited_timestamp\":null,\"flags\":0,\"components\":[],\"id\":\"1303829911869325332\",\"channel_id\":\"1288235003901120586\",\"author\":{\"id\":\"183261151746850816\",\"username\":\"individualcontributor\",\"avatar\":\"b7271f16ff804f9fa069bba774b3d0e7\",\"discriminator\":\"0\",\"public_flags\":0,\"flags\":0,\"banner\":null,\"accent_color\":null,\"global_name\":\"IndividualContributor\",\"avatar_decoration_data\":null,\"collectibles\":null,\"display_name_styles\":null,\"banner_color\":null,\"clan\":null,\"primary_guild\":null},\"pinned\":false,\"mention_everyone\":false,\"tts\":false,\"position\":474},{\"type\":0,\"content\":\"ok I think this is worse than I thought <:KEKW:1074810897308069948> so if I played on fresh D1 with break scene implemented all the way through from Bone Village to D2 everything is fine. BUT if I swap to D1 patched at the spiral shell scene just before \\\"Save game\\\" scene then continue through to D2 the error shows up.\",\"mentions\":[],\"mention_roles\":[],\"attachments\":[],\"embeds\":[],\"timestamp\":\"2024-11-06T21:13:27.019000+00:00\",\"edited_timestamp\":null,\"flags\":0,\"components\":[],\"id\":\"1303829626828619879\",\"channel_id\":\"1288235003901120586\",\"author\":{\"id\":\"183261151746850816\",\"username\":\"individualcontributor\",\"avatar\":\"b7271f16ff804f9fa069bba774b3d0e7\",\"discriminator\":\"0\",\"public_flags\":0,\"flags\":0,\"banner\":null,\"accent_color\":null,\"global_name\":\"IndividualContributor\",\"avatar_decoration_data\":null,\"collectibles\":null,\"display_name_styles\":null,\"banner_color\":null,\"clan\":null,\"primary_guild\":null},\"pinned\":false,\"mention_everyone\":false,\"tts\":false,\"position\":473},{\"type\":0,\"content\":\"https://tenor.com/view/charlie-day-gif-18564553\",\"mentions\":[],\"mention_roles\":[],\"attachments\":[],\"embeds\":[{\"type\":\"gifv\",\"url\":\"https://tenor.com/view/charlie-day-gif-18564553\",\"provider\":{\"name\":\"Tenor\",\"url\":\"https://tenor.co\"},\"thumbnail\":{\"url\":\"https://media.tenor.com/4LvAD8hD5tcAAAAe/charlie-day.png\",\"proxy_url\":\"https://images-ext-1.discordapp.net/external/Ts0JN5seWNJSGQlT4qAv_3Ck5bjJfZLPwN078gR5dcM/https/media.tenor.com/4LvAD8hD5tcAAAAe/charlie-day.png\",\"width\":640,\"height\":406,\"placeholder\":\"5gcGBIJkDDfPp3aDp30jALbyRQ==\",\"placeholder_version\":1,\"flags\":0},\"video\":{\"url\":\"https://media.tenor.com/4LvAD8hD5tcAAAPo/charlie-day.mp4\",\"proxy_url\":\"https://images-ext-1.discordapp.net/external/rHh70y_trqAaCT3AQn-XyU2GUDLBzYngcqgZUBOkbWo/https/media.tenor.com/4LvAD8hD5tcAAAPo/charlie-day.mp4\",\"width\":640,\"height\":406,\"placeholder\":\"5gcGBIJkDDfPp3aDp30jALbyRQ==\",\"placeholder_version\":1,\"flags\":0},\"content_scan_version\":3}],\"timestamp\":\"2024-11-06T21:07:27.701000+00:00\",\"edited_timestamp\":null,\"flags\":0,\"components\":[],\"id\":\"1303828119739961375\",\"channel_id\":\"1288235003901120586\",\"author\":{\"id\":\"183261151746850816\",\"username\":\"individualcontributor\",\"avatar\":\"b7271f16ff804f9fa069bba774b3d0e7\",\"discriminator\":\"0\",\"public_flags\":0,\"flags\":0,\"banner\":null,\"accent_color\":null,\"global_name\":\"IndividualContributor\",\"avatar_decoration_data\":null,\"collectibles\":null,\"display_name_styles\":null,\"banner_color\":null,\"clan\":null,\"primary_guild\":null},\"pinned\":false,\"mention_everyone\":false,\"tts\":false,\"position\":472},{\"type\":0,\"content\":\"that I can see at least, given it's working with no errors in fresh D1\",\"mentions\":[],\"mention_roles\":[],\"attachments\":[],\"embeds\":[],\"timestamp\":\"2024-11-06T21:07:19.557000+00:00\",\"edited_timestamp\":null,\"flags\":0,\"components\":[],\"id\":\"1303828085581287536\",\"channel_id\":\"1288235003901120586\",\"author\":{\"id\":\"183261151746850816\",\"username\":\"individualcontributor\",\"avatar\":\"b7271f16ff804f9fa069bba774b3d0e7\",\"discriminator\":\"0\",\"public_flags\":0,\"flags\":0,\"banner\":null,\"accent_color\":null,\"global_name\":\"IndividualContributor\",\"avatar_decoration_data\":null,\"collectibles\":null,\"display_name_styles\":null,\"banner_color\":null,\"clan\":null,\"primary_guild\":null},\"pinned\":false,\"mention_everyone\":false,\"tts\":false,\"position\":471},{\"type\":0,\"content\":\"yeah I was thinking the same about the game moment earlier, it being so high 42069 might be overwriting some other variables in RAM but it dosen't seem to be it\",\"mentions\":[],\"mention_roles\":[],\"attachments\":[],\"embeds\":[],\"timestamp\":\"2024-11-06T21:07:00.445000+00:00\",\"edited_timestamp\":null,\"flags\":0,\"components\":[],\"id\":\"1303828005419880519\",\"channel_id\":\"1288235003901120586\",\"author\":{\"id\":\"183261151746850816\",\"username\":\"individualcontributor\",\"avatar\":\"b7271f16ff804f9fa069bba774b3d0e7\",\"discriminator\":\"0\",\"public_flags\":0,\"flags\":0,\"banner\":null,\"accent_color\":null,\"global_name\":\"IndividualContributor\",\"avatar_decoration_data\":null,\"collectibles\":null,\"display_name_styles\":null,\"banner_color\":null,\"clan\":null,\"primary_guild\":null},\"pinned\":false,\"mention_everyone\":false,\"tts\":false,\"position\":470},{\"type\":0,\"content\":\"Ah okay, it was just an idea\",\"mentions\":[],\"mention_roles\":[],\"attachments\":[],\"embeds\":[],\"timestamp\":\"2024-11-06T21:05:24.502000+00:00\",\"edited_timestamp\":null,\"flags\":0,\"components\":[],\"id\":\"1303827603005771918\",\"channel_id\":\"1288235003901120586\",\"author\":{\"id\":\"248225699909861376\",\"username\":\"awesomewaves\",\"avatar\":\"7de794a8a3e242252076a10784af0a9f\",\"discriminator\":\"0\",\"public_flags\":0,\"flags\":0,\"banner\":null,\"accent_color\":null,\"global_name\":\"awesomeWaves\",\"avatar_decoration_data\":null,\"collectibles\":null,\"display_name_styles\":null,\"banner_color\":null,\"clan\":null,\"primary_guild\":null},\"pinned\":false,\"mention_everyone\":false,\"tts\":false,\"position\":469},{\"type\":0,\"content\":\"so I'm positive it's not the break scene at this point\",\"mentions\":[],\"mention_roles\":[],\"attachments\":[],\"embeds\":[],\"timestamp\":\"2024-11-06T21:05:18.198000+00:00\",\"edited_timestamp\":null,\"flags\":0,\"components\":[],\"id\":\"1303827576564875325\",\"channel_id\":\"1288235003901120586\",\"author\":{\"id\":\"183261151746850816\",\"username\":\"individualcontributor\",\"avatar\":\"b7271f16ff804f9fa069bba774b3d0e7\",\"discriminator\":\"0\",\"public_flags\":0,\"flags\":0,\"banner\":null,\"accent_color\":null,\"global_name\":\"IndividualContributor\",\"avatar_decoration_data\":null,\"collectibles\":null,\"display_name_styles\":null,\"banner_color\":null,\"clan\":null,\"primary_guild\":null},\"pinned\":false,\"mention_everyone\":false,\"tts\":false,\"position\":468},{\"type\":0,\"content\":\"no I've re-implemented the break scene on a fresh D1 and everything is working fine, no error\",\"mentions\":[],\"mention_roles\":[],\"attachments\":[],\"embeds\":[],\"timestamp\":\"2024-11-06T21:05:09.559000+00:00\",\"edited_timestamp\":null,\"flags\":0,\"components\":[],\"id\":\"1303827540330156053\",\"channel_id\":\"1288235003901120586\",\"author\":{\"id\":\"183261151746850816\",\"username\":\"individualcontributor\",\"avatar\":\"b7271f16ff804f9fa069bba774b3d0e7\",\"discriminator\":\"0\",\"public_flags\":0,\"flags\":0,\"banner\":null,\"accent_color\":null,\"global_name\":\"IndividualContributor\",\"avatar_decoration_data\":null,\"collectibles\":null,\"display_name_styles\":null,\"banner_color\":null,\"clan\":null,\"primary_guild\":null},\"pinned\":false,\"mention_everyone\":false,\"tts\":false,\"position\":467},{\"type\":0,\"content\":\"and confusing the memory\",\"mentions\":[],\"mention_roles\":[],\"attachments\":[],\"embeds\":[],\"timestamp\":\"2024-11-06T21:04:49.679000+00:00\",\"edited_timestamp\":null,\"flags\":0,\"components\":[],\"id\":\"1303827456947523614\",\"channel_id\":\"1288235003901120586\",\"author\":{\"id\":\"248225699909861376\",\"username\":\"awesomewaves\",\"avatar\":\"7de794a8a3e242252076a10784af0a9f\",\"discriminator\":\"0\",\"public_flags\":0,\"flags\":0,\"banner\":null,\"accent_color\":null,\"global_name\":\"awesomeWaves\",\"avatar_decoration_data\":null,\"collectibles\":null,\"display_name_styles\":null,\"banner_color\":null,\"clan\":null,\"primary_guild\":null},\"pinned\":false,\"mention_everyone\":false,\"tts\":false,\"position\":466},{\"type\":0,\"content\":\"it's surely nothing something simple like the game moment being way too high?\",\"mentions\":[],\"mention_roles\":[],\"attachments\":[],\"embeds\":[],\"timestamp\":\"2024-11-06T21:04:42.521000+00:00\",\"edited_timestamp\":null,\"flags\":0,\"components\":[],\"id\":\"1303827426924691476\",\"channel_id\":\"1288235003901120586\",\"author\":{\"id\":\"248225699909861376\",\"username\":\"awesomewaves\",\"avatar\":\"7de794a8a3e242252076a10784af0a9f\",\"discriminator\":\"0\",\"public_flags\":0,\"flags\":0,\"banner\":null,\"accent_color\":null,\"global_name\":\"awesomeWaves\",\"avatar_decoration_data\":null,\"collectibles\":null,\"display_name_styles\":null,\"banner_color\":null,\"clan\":null,\"primary_guild\":null},\"pinned\":false,\"mention_everyone\":false,\"tts\":false,\"position\":465},{\"type\":0,\"content\":\"nvm the error is back lol\",\"mentions\":[],\"mention_roles\":[],\"attachments\":[],\"embeds\":[],\"timestamp\":\"2024-11-06T21:02:57.200000+00:00\",\"edited_timestamp\":\"2024-11-06T21:03:02.450000+00:00\",\"flags\":0,\"components\":[],\"id\":\"1303826985176272946\",\"channel_id\":\"1288235003901120586\",\"author\":{\"id\":\"183261151746850816\",\"username\":\"individualcontributor\",\"avatar\":\"b7271f16ff8