 can more accurately test\",\"mentions\":[],\"mention_roles\":[],\"attachments\":[],\"embeds\":[],\"timestamp\":\"2024-11-06T16:08:49.442000+00:00\",\"edited_timestamp\":null,\"flags\":0,\"components\":[],\"id\":\"1303752965114560595\",\"channel_id\":\"1288235003901120586\",\"author\":{\"id\":\"248225699909861376\",\"username\":\"awesomewaves\",\"avatar\":\"7de794a8a3e242252076a10784af0a9f\",\"discriminator\":\"0\",\"public_flags\":0,\"flags\":0,\"banner\":null,\"accent_color\":null,\"global_name\":\"awesomeWaves\",\"avatar_decoration_data\":null,\"collectibles\":null,\"display_name_styles\":null,\"banner_color\":null,\"clan\":null,\"primary_guild\":null},\"pinned\":false,\"mention_everyone\":false,\"tts\":false,\"position\":411},{\"type\":0,\"content\":\"I can skip Jeno\",\"mentions\":[],\"mention_roles\":[],\"attachments\":[],\"embeds\":[],\"timestamp\":\"2024-11-06T16:08:43.384000+00:00\",\"edited_timestamp\":null,\"flags\":0,\"components\":[],\"id\":\"1303752939705466950\",\"channel_id\":\"1288235003901120586\",\"author\":{\"id\":\"183261151746850816\",\"username\":\"individualcontributor\",\"avatar\":\"b7271f16ff804f9fa069bba774b3d0e7\",\"discriminator\":\"0\",\"public_flags\":0,\"flags\":0,\"banner\":null,\"accent_color\":null,\"global_name\":\"IndividualContributor\",\"avatar_decoration_data\":null,\"collectibles\":null,\"display_name_styles\":null,\"banner_color\":null,\"clan\":null,\"primary_guild\":null},\"pinned\":false,\"mention_everyone\":false,\"tts\":false,\"position\":410},{\"type\":0,\"content\":\"or just edit her hp to 1 or something\",\"mentions\":[],\"mention_roles\":[],\"attachments\":[],\"embeds\":[],\"timestamp\":\"2024-11-06T16:08:34.462000+00:00\",\"edited_timestamp\":null,\"flags\":0,\"components\":[],\"id\":\"1303752902283886593\",\"channel_id\":\"1288235003901120586\",\"author\":{\"id\":\"248225699909861376\",\"username\":\"awesomewaves\",\"avatar\":\"7de794a8a3e242252076a10784af0a9f\",\"discriminator\":\"0\",\"public_flags\":0,\"flags\":0,\"banner\":null,\"accent_color\":null,\"global_name\":\"awesomeWaves\",\"avatar_decoration_data\":null,\"collectibles\":null,\"display_name_styles\":null,\"banner_color\":null,\"clan\":null,\"primary_guild\":null},\"pinned\":false,\"mention_everyone\":false,\"tts\":false,\"position\":409},{\"type\":0,\"content\":\"I have a PS2 mem card due in the post in the next few days to allow me to copy saves from PC to PS2 so can test this stuff more thoroughly then\",\"mentions\":[],\"mention_roles\":[],\"attachments\":[],\"embeds\":[],\"timestamp\":\"2024-11-06T16:08:33.403000+00:00\",\"edited_timestamp\":null,\"flags\":0,\"components\":[],\"id\":\"1303752897841856583\",\"channel_id\":\"1288235003901120586\",\"author\":{\"id\":\"183261151746850816\",\"username\":\"individualcontributor\",\"avatar\":\"b7271f16ff804f9fa069bba774b3d0e7\",\"discriminator\":\"0\",\"public_flags\":0,\"flags\":0,\"banner\":null,\"accent_color\":null,\"global_name\":\"IndividualContributor\",\"avatar_decoration_data\":null,\"collectibles\":null,\"display_name_styles\":null,\"banner_color\":null,\"clan\":null,\"primary_guild\":null},\"pinned\":false,\"mention_everyone\":false,\"tts\":false,\"position\":408},{\"type\":0,\"content\":\"if you could push a patch where you can skip JLife I'll be happy to test\",\"mentions\":[],\"mention_roles\":[],\"attachments\":[],\"embeds\":[],\"timestamp\":\"2024-11-06T16:08:26.776000+00:00\",\"edited_timestamp\":null,\"flags\":0,\"components\":[],\"id\":\"1303752870046204026\",\"channel_id\":\"1288235003901120586\",\"author\":{\"id\":\"248225699909861376\",\"username\":\"awesomewaves\",\"avatar\":\"7de794a8a3e242252076a10784af0a9f\",\"discriminator\":\"0\",\"public_flags\":0,\"flags\":0,\"banner\":null,\"accent_color\":null,\"global_name\":\"awesomeWaves\",\"avatar_decoration_data\":null,\"collectibles\":null,\"display_name_styles\":null,\"banner_color\":null,\"clan\":null,\"primary_guild\":null},\"pinned\":false,\"mention_everyone\":false,\"tts\":false,\"position\":407},{\"type\":0,\"content\":\"Anyone have a save file they could use to test removing the break scene just to see if it is actually the break scene? I can remove it and push a temp patch now. The problem could also be something with music or RAM I just want to narrow it down\",\"mentions\":[],\"mention_roles\":[],\"attachments\":[],\"embeds\":[],\"timestamp\":\"2024-11-06T16:07:57.504000+00:00\",\"edited_timestamp\":null,\"flags\":0,\"components\":[],\"id\":\"1303752747270803477\",\"channel_id\":\"1288235003901120586\",\"author\":{\"id\":\"183261151746850816\",\"username\":\"individualcontributor\",\"avatar\":\"b7271f16ff804f9fa069bba774b3d0e7\",\"discriminator\":\"0\",\"public_flags\":0,\"flags\":0,\"banner\":null,\"accent_color\":null,\"global_name\":\"IndividualContributor\",\"avatar_decoration_data\":null,\"collectibles\":null,\"display_name_styles\":null,\"banner_color\":null,\"clan\":null,\"primary_guild\":null},\"pinned\":false,\"mention_everyone\":false,\"tts\":false,\"position\":406},{\"type\":0,\"content\":\"I think after J-Birth there should be atleast one text box while Cloud is putting his head down or before, does feel weird to me\",\"mentions\":[],\"mention_roles\":[],\"attachments\":[],\"embeds\":[],\"timestamp\":\"2024-11-06T16:06:26.823000+00:00\",\"edited_timestamp\":null,\"flags\":0,\"components\":[],\"id\":\"1303752366926987335\",\"channel_id\":\"1288235003901120586\",\"author\":{\"id\":\"170713534726930432\",\"username\":\".okamikaze\",\"avatar\":\"95b696448d658de94544ca767feb61f0\",\"discriminator\":\"0\",\"public_flags\":0,\"flags\":0,\"banner\":null,\"accent_color\":null,\"global_name\":\"Okamikaze\",\"avatar_decoration_data\":null,\"collectibles\":null,\"display_name_styles\":null,\"banner_color\":null,\"clan\":null,\"primary_guild\":null},\"pinned\":false,\"mention_everyone\":false,\"tts\":false,\"position\":405},{\"type\":0,\"content\":\"so it is still possible. It was moved so that it would be included in any potential Disc 1 skip routes also\",\"mentions\":[],\"mention_roles\":[],\"attachments\":[],\"embeds\":[],\"timestamp\":\"2024-11-06T16:04:44.502000+00:00\",\"edited_timestamp\":null,\"flags\":0,\"components\":[],\"id\":\"1303751937761738833\",\"channel_id\":\"1288235003901120586\",\"author\":{\"id\":\"248225699909861376\",\"username\":\"awesomewaves\",\"avatar\":\"7de794a8a3e242252076a10784af0a9f\",\"discriminator\":\"0\",\"public_flags\":0,\"flags\":0,\"banner\":null,\"accent_color\":null,\"global_name\":\"awesomeWaves\",\"avatar_decoration_data\":null,\"collectibles\":null,\"display_name_styles\":null,\"banner_color\":null,\"clan\":null,\"primary_guild\":null},\"pinned\":false,\"mention_everyone\":false,\"tts\":false,\"position\":404},{\"type\":0,\"content\":\"Am I right in remembering that the break worked when it was after Demon's Gate?\",\"mentions\":[],\"mention_roles\":[],\"attachments\":[],\"embeds\":[],\"timestamp\":\"2024-11-06T16:04:20.736000+00:00\",\"edited_timestamp\":null,\"flags\":0,\"components\":[],\"id\":\"1303751838079778887\",\"channel_id\":\"1288235003901120586\",\"author\":{\"id\":\"248225699909861376\",\"username\":\"awesomewaves\",\"avatar\":\"7de794a8a3e242252076a10784af0a9f\",\"discriminator\":\"0\",\"public_flags\":0,\"flags\":0,\"banner\":null,\"accent_color\":null,\"global_name\":\"awesomeWaves\",\"avatar_decoration_data\":null,\"collectibles\":null,\"display_name_styles\":null,\"banner_color\":null,\"clan\":null,\"primary_guild\":null},\"pinned\":false,\"mention_everyone\":false,\"tts\":false,\"position\":403},{\"type\":0,\"content\":\"We can force a break much less gran if we have to. Like you could just make it wait a set time as a single script I think\",\"mentions\":[],\"mention_roles\":[],\"attachments\":[],\"embeds\":[],\"timestamp\":\"2024-11-06T16:00:55.956000+00:00\",\"edited_timestamp\":null,\"flags\":0,\"components\":[],\"id\":\"1303750979170336830\",\"channel_id\":\"1288235003901120586\",\"author\":{\"id\":\"191046608064872449\",\"username\":\"hopeproductions\",\"avatar\":\"ea6a8fcda648eb65fdae9becbd0c4fe4\",\"discriminator\":\"0\",\"public_flags\":512,\"flags\":512,\"banner\":null,\"accent_color\":null,\"global_name\":\"Hope\",\"avatar_decoration_data\":null,\"collectibles\":null,\"display_name_styles\":null,\"banner_color\":null,\"clan\":null,\"primary_guild\":null},\"pinned\":false,\"mention_everyone\":false,\"tts\":false,\"position\":402},{\"type\":0,\"content\":\"I'll be sad if we cant have break because it breaks the game\",\"mentions\":[],\"mention_roles\":[],\"attachments\":[],\"embeds\":[],\"timestamp\":\"2024-11-06T15:45:34.911000+00:00\",\"edited_timestamp\":null,\"flags\":0,\"components\":[],\"id\":\"1303747116027613304\",\"channel_id\":\"1288235003901120586\",\"author\":{\"id\":\"289891674660929538\",\"username\":\"teeejj0102\",\"avatar\":\"aabd4c1026f28787683c2de660f2aa57\",\"discriminator\":\"0\",\"public_flags\":0,\"flags\":0,\"banner\":null,\"accent_color\":null,\"global_name\":\"Teeejj\",\"avatar_decoration_data\":null,\"collectibles\":null,\"display_name_styles\":{\"font_id\":8,\"effect_id\":1,\"colors\":[]},\"banner_color\":null,\"clan\":null,\"primary_guild\":null},\"pinned\":false,\"mention_everyone\":false,\"tts\":false,\"position\":401},{\"type\":0,\"content\":\"I'm going to try removing the break scene completely to see if that makes a difference.\",\"mentions\":[],\"mention_roles\":[],\"attachments\":[],\"embeds\":[],\"timestamp\":\"2024-11-06T15:08:33.229000+00:00\",\"edited_timestamp\":null,\"flags\":0,\"components\":[],\"id\":\"1303737797617782856\",\"channel_id\":\"1288235003901120586\",\"author\":{\"id\":\"183261151746850816\",\"username\":\"individualcontributor\",\"avatar\":\"b7271f16ff804f9fa069bba774b3d0e7\",\"discriminator\":\"0\",\"public_flags\":0,\"flags\":0,\"banner\":null,\"accent_color\":null,\"global_name\":\"IndividualContributor\",\"avatar_decoration_data\":null,\"collectibles\":null,\"display_name_styles\":null,\"banner_color\":null,\"clan\":null,\"primary_guild\":null},\"pinned\":false,\"mention_everyone\":false,\"tts\":false,\"position\":400},{\"type\":0,\"content\":\"Word of caution, disc 2 still not loading correctly in latest version 0.4.7, I'm going to look at it later tonight.\",\"mentions\":[],\"mention_roles\":[],\"attachments\":[],\"embeds\":[],\"timestamp\":\"2024-11-06T15:00:24.753000+00:00\",\"edited_timestamp\":null,\"flags\":0,\"components\":[],\"id\":\"1303735748800811089\",\"channel_id\":\"1288235003901120586\",\"author\":{\"id\":\"183261151746850816\",\"username\":\"individualcontributor\",\"avatar\":\"b7271f16ff804f9fa069bba774b3d0e7\",\"discriminator\":\"0\",\"public_flags\":0,\"flags\":0,\"banner\":null,\"accent_color\":null,\"global_name\":\"IndividualContributor\",\"avatar_decoration_data\":null,\"collectibles\":null,\"display_name_styles\":null,\"banner_color\":null,\"clan\":null,\"primary_guild\":null},\"pinned\":false,\"mention_everyone\":false,\"tts\":false,\"position\":399},{\"type\":0,\"content\":\"Release v0.4.7 https://github.com/individualcontributordev/Final-Fantasy-7-CSR/tree/main/v0.4.7\\n\\n- Moved the break scene to before the spiral hut scene to test a bug fix on PSX where Disc 2 wouldn't load correctly after putting it into the console. Suspected issue with the music still playing from the break scene when disc is being changed. Not an issue on Emulator. \\n- Trimmed Reno text box\\n- Trimmed Slap skip (2 frame time save if you're lucky)\\n- Updates to Jessie skip\\n- Reverted Honey Bee Inn fat guy text boxes because they felt weird\\n\\nIMPORTANT: there may still be a bug on PSX only, at the end of disc 1, maybe related to the break scene, where disc 2 won't load when you insert it. I've moved the break scene further back away from the \\\"Save game\\\" scene before disc swap but haven't tested it on PSX yet. Emulator does not have the same issue.\",\"mentions\":[],\"mention_roles\":[],\"attachments\":[],\"embeds\":[{\"type\":\"article\",\"url\":\"https://github.com/individualcontributordev/Final-Fantasy-7-CSR/tree/main/v0.4.7\",\"title\":\"Final-Fantasy-7-CSR/v0.4.7 at main \\u00b7 individualcontributordev/Final...\",\"description\":\"Final Fantasy 7 CutScenes Removed. Contribute to individualcontributordev/Final-Fantasy-7-CSR development by creating an account on GitHub.\",\"color\":1975079,\"provider\":{\"name\":\"GitHub\"},\"content_scan_version\":4}],\"timestamp\":\"2024-11-06T01:10:05.301000+00:00\",\"edited_timestamp\":\"2024-11-06T09:51:01.209000+00:00\",\"flags\":0,\"components\":[],\"id\":\"1303526790874005525\",\"channel_id\":\"1288235003901120586\",\"author\":{\"id\":\"183261151746850816\",\"username\":\"individualcontributor\",\"avatar\":\"b7271f16ff804f9fa069bba774b3d0e7\",\"discriminator\":\"0\",\"public_flags\":0,\"flags\":0,\"banner\":null,\"accent_color\":null,\"global_name\":\"IndividualContributor\",\"avatar_decoration_data\":null,\"collectibles\":null,\"display_name_styles\":null,\"banner_color\":null,\"clan\":null,\"primary_guild\":null},\"pinned\":false,\"mention_everyone\":false,\"tts\":false,\"position\":398},{\"type\":0,\"content\":\"Reno also has two I think, I can remove the first\",\"mentions\":[],\"mention_roles\":[],\"attachments\":[],\"embeds\":[],\"timestamp\":\"2024-11-05T23:43:39.393000+00:00\",\"edited_timestamp\":null,\"flags\":0,\"components\":[],\"id\":\"1303505039599472651\",\"channel_id\":\"1288235003901120586\",\"author\":{\"id\":\"183261151746850816\",\"username\":\"individualcontributor\",\"avatar\":\"b7271f16ff804f9fa069bba774b3d0e7\",\"discriminator\":\"0\",\"public_flags\":0,\"flags\":0,\"banner\":null,\"accent_color\":null,\"global_name\":\"IndividualContributor\",\"avatar_decoration_data\":null,\"collectibles\":null,\"display_name_styles\":null,\"banner_color\":null,\"clan\":null,\"primary_guild\":null},\"pinned\":false,\"mention_everyone\":false,\"tts\":false,\"position\":397}]\n"
