            "text": "[{\"type\":0,\"content\":\"hey it's all good <:doumeiLUL:1025884511046750378>\",\"mentions\":[],\"mention_roles\":[],\"attachments\":[],\"embeds\":[],\"timestamp\":\"2024-10-31T17:01:51.811000+00:00\",\"edited_timestamp\":null,\"flags\":0,\"components\":[],\"id\":\"1301591985743855666\",\"channel_id\":\"1288235003901120586\",\"author\":{\"id\":\"246736771067543552\",\"username\":\"doumeis\",\"avatar\":\"5570be7814759b69ac5a440e5cd0831e\",\"discriminator\":\"0\",\"public_flags\":0,\"flags\":0,\"banner\":null,\"accent_color\":null,\"global_name\":\"Doumeis\",\"avatar_decoration_data\":null,\"collectibles\":null,\"display_name_styles\":null,\"banner_color\":null,\"clan\":null,\"primary_guild\":null},\"pinned\":false,\"mention_everyone\":false,\"tts\":false,\"position\":274},{\"type\":0,\"content\":\"And there is soooo many text boxes for NMS right now \\ud83d\\ude2c sorry Doumeis\",\"mentions\":[],\"mention_roles\":[],\"attachments\":[],\"embeds\":[],\"timestamp\":\"2024-10-31T13:16:43.610000+00:00\",\"edited_timestamp\":null,\"flags\":0,\"components\":[],\"id\":\"1301535328242241537\",\"channel_id\":\"1288235003901120586\",\"author\":{\"id\":\"183261151746850816\",\"username\":\"individualcontributor\",\"avatar\":\"b7271f16ff804f9fa069bba774b3d0e7\",\"discriminator\":\"0\",\"public_flags\":0,\"flags\":0,\"banner\":null,\"accent_color\":null,\"global_name\":\"IndividualContributor\",\"avatar_decoration_data\":null,\"collectibles\":null,\"display_name_styles\":null,\"banner_color\":null,\"clan\":null,\"primary_guild\":null},\"pinned\":false,\"mention_everyone\":false,\"tts\":false,\"position\":273},{\"type\":0,\"content\":\"Yeah true, weird though as I didn't touch any elevator stuff, literally just the start naming part and the planting the bomb part\",\"mentions\":[],\"mention_roles\":[],\"attachments\":[],\"embeds\":[],\"timestamp\":\"2024-10-31T13:15:44.988000+00:00\",\"edited_timestamp\":null,\"flags\":0,\"components\":[],\"id\":\"1301535082363883643\",\"channel_id\":\"1288235003901120586\",\"author\":{\"id\":\"183261151746850816\",\"username\":\"individualcontributor\",\"avatar\":\"b7271f16ff804f9fa069bba774b3d0e7\",\"discriminator\":\"0\",\"public_flags\":0,\"flags\":0,\"banner\":null,\"accent_color\":null,\"global_name\":\"IndividualContributor\",\"avatar_decoration_data\":null,\"collectibles\":null,\"display_name_styles\":null,\"banner_color\":null,\"clan\":null,\"primary_guild\":null},\"pinned\":false,\"mention_everyone\":false,\"tts\":false,\"position\":272},{\"type\":0,\"content\":\"You should be able to just check what the elevator field is checking for when you talk to the button?\",\"mentions\":[],\"mention_roles\":[],\"attachments\":[],\"embeds\":[],\"timestamp\":\"2024-10-31T12:48:13.046000+00:00\",\"edited_timestamp\":null,\"flags\":0,\"components\":[],\"id\":\"1301528153617072200\",\"channel_id\":\"1288235003901120586\",\"author\":{\"id\":\"191046608064872449\",\"username\":\"hopeproductions\",\"avatar\":\"ea6a8fcda648eb65fdae9becbd0c4fe4\",\"discriminator\":\"0\",\"public_flags\":512,\"flags\":512,\"banner\":null,\"accent_color\":null,\"global_name\":\"Hope\",\"avatar_decoration_data\":null,\"collectibles\":null,\"display_name_styles\":null,\"banner_color\":null,\"clan\":null,\"primary_guild\":null},\"pinned\":false,\"mention_everyone\":false,\"tts\":false,\"position\":271},{\"type\":0,\"content\":\"they must use the same variable or something and I've skipped it in reactor 1\",\"mentions\":[],\"mention_roles\":[],\"attachments\":[],\"embeds\":[],\"timestamp\":\"2024-10-31T12:28:17.634000+00:00\",\"edited_timestamp\":null,\"flags\":0,\"components\":[],\"id\":\"1301523139695480903\",\"channel_id\":\"1288235003901120586\",\"author\":{\"id\":\"183261151746850816\",\"username\":\"individualcontributor\",\"avatar\":\"b7271f16ff804f9fa069bba774b3d0e7\",\"discriminator\":\"0\",\"public_flags\":0,\"flags\":0,\"banner\":null,\"accent_color\":null,\"global_name\":\"IndividualContributor\",\"avatar_de