            "text": "[{\"type\":0,\"content\":\"Ok so I have the main cast in now https://youtu.be/jkaLAeB2JZU\",\"mentions\":[],\"mention_roles\":[],\"attachments\":[],\"embeds\":[{\"type\":\"video\",\"url\":\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=jkaLAeB2JZU\",\"title\":\"CSR break timer 2\",\"color\":16711680,\"author\":{\"name\":\"IndividualContributor\",\"url\":\"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCLFC4xnoFlNv4OAuUYfnF6g\"},\"provider\":{\"name\":\"YouTube\",\"url\":\"https://www.youtube.com\"},\"thumbnail\":{\"url\":\"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/jkaLAeB2JZU/maxresdefault.jpg\",\"proxy_url\":\"https://images-ext-1.discordapp.net/external/ujy2jO1xcn1vL562ByfVo-RrPNBpFe96kmn5gpnE7QI/https/i.ytimg.com/vi/jkaLAeB2JZU/maxresdefault.jpg\",\"width\":1280,\"height\":720,\"content_type\":\"image/jpeg\",\"placeholder\":\"CggGFIKsCpaKh5iyWIdwaQOlRw==\",\"placeholder_version\":1,\"flags\":0},\"video\":{\"url\":\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/jkaLAeB2JZU\",\"width\":1280,\"height\":720,\"placeholder\":\"CggGFIKsCpaKh5iyWIdwaQOlRw==\",\"placeholder_version\":1,\"flags\":0}}],\"timestamp\":\"2024-10-29T22:43:03.764000+00:00\",\"edited_timestamp\":null,\"flags\":0,\"components\":[],\"id\":\"1300953075607015456\",\"channel_id\":\"1288235003901120586\",\"author\":{\"id\":\"183261151746850816\",\"username\":\"individualcontributor\",\"avatar\":\"b7271f16ff804f9fa069bba774b3d0e7\",\"discriminator\":\"0\",\"public_flags\":0,\"flags\":0,\"banner\":null,\"accent_color\":null,\"global_name\":\"IndividualContributor\",\"avatar_decoration_data\":null,\"collectibles\":null,\"display_name_styles\":null,\"banner_color\":null,\"clan\":null,\"primary_guild\":null},\"pinned\":false,\"mention_everyone\":false,\"tts\":false,\"position\":194},{\"type\":0,\"content\":\"Cool I'll likely have it pushed tomorrow night, or maybe before if I can find a few hours.\",\"mentions\":[],\"mention_roles\":[],\"attachments\":[],\"embeds\":[],\"timestamp\":\"2024-10-29T21:55:05.057000+00:00\",\"edited_timestamp\":null,\"flags\":0,\"components\":[],\"id\":\"1300941001434726480\",\"channel_id\":\"1288235003901120586\",\"author\":{\"id\":\"183261151746850816\",\"username\":\"individualcontributor\",\"avatar\":\"b7271f16ff804f9fa069bba774b3d0e7\",\"discriminator\":\"0\",\"public_flags\":0,\"flags\":0,\"banner\":null,\"accent_color\":null,\"global_name\":\"IndividualContributor\",\"avatar_decoration_data\":null,\"collectibles\":null,\"display_name_styles\":null,\"banner_color\":null,\"clan\":null,\"primary_guild\":null},\"pinned\":false,\"mention_everyone\":false,\"tts\":false,\"position\":193},{\"type\":0,\"content\":\"Thanks for all the work again\",\"mentions\":[],\"mention_roles\":[],\"attachments\":[],\"embeds\":[],\"timestamp\":\"2024-10-29T21:53:11.505000+00:00\",\"edited_timestamp\":null,\"flags\":0,\"components\":[],\"id\":\"1300940525163249727\",\"channel_id\":\"1288235003901120586\",\"author\":{\"id\":\"248225699909861376\",\"username\":\"awesomewaves\",\"avatar\":\"7de794a8a3e242252076a10784af0a9f\",\"discriminator\":\"0\",\"public_flags\":0,\"flags\":0,\"banner\":null,\"accent_color\":null,\"global_name\":\"awesomeWaves\",\"avatar_decoration_data\":null,\"collectibles\":null,\"display_name_styles\":null,\"banner_color\":null,\"clan\":null,\"primary_guild\":null},\"pinned\":false,\"mention_everyone\":false,\"tts\":false,\"position\":192,\"reactions\":[{\"emoji\":{\"id\":null,\"name\":\"\\u2764\\ufe0f\"},\"count\":1,\"count_details\":{\"burst\":0,\"normal\":1},\"burst_colors\":[],\"me_burst\":false,\"burst_me\":false,\"me\":true,\"burst_count\":0}]},{\"type\":0,\"content\":\"Ah ok cool. I'll hold off on burning a new CD1 until the version with the break is done then as that will effect my current splits and I'll continue testing from there.\",\"mentions\":[],\"mention_roles\":[],\"attachments\":[],\"embeds\":[],\"timestamp\":\"2024-10-29T21:53:05.527000+00:00\",\"edited_timestamp\":null,\"flags\":0,\"components\":[],\"id\":\"1300940500089438270\",\"channel_id\":\"1288235003901120586\",\"author\":{\"id\":\"248225699909861376\",\"username\":\"awesomewaves\",\"avatar\":\"7de794a8a3e242252076a10784af0a9f\",\"discriminator\":\"0\",\"public_flags\":0,\"flags\":0,\"banner\":null,\"accent_color\":null,\"global_name\":\"awesomeWaves\",\"avatar_decoration_data\":null,\"collectibles\":null,\"display_name_styles\":null,\"banner_color\":null,\"clan\":null,\"primary_guild\":null},\"pinned\":false,\"mention_everyone\":false,\"tts\":false,\"position\":191},{\"type\":0,\"content\":\"I've taken a few notes myself for things in D1 but will do on the final trim because they're minor. And when I say \\\"final\\\" I mean almost final because once trimming is done I want to review it for muscle memory or expected number of text boxes before choices, etc. And maybe wait frames to allow for IGTs to be read.\",\"mentions\":[],\"mention_roles\":[],\"attachments\":[],\"embeds\":[],\"timestamp\":\"2024-10-29T21:49:17.073000+00:00\",\"edited_timestamp\":null,\"flags\":0,\"components\":[],\"id\":\"1300939541883912202\",\"channel_id\":\"1288235003901120586\",\"author\":{\"id\":\"183261151746850816\",\"username\":\"individualcontributor\",\"avatar\":\"b7271f16ff804f9fa069bba774b3d0e7\",\"discriminator\":\"0\",\"public_flags\":0,\"flags\":0,\"banner\":null,\"accent_color\":null,\"global_name\":\"IndividualContributor\",\"avatar_decoration_data\":null,\"collectibles\":null,\"display_name_styles\":null,\"banner_color\":null,\"clan\":null,\"primary_guild\":null},\"pinned\":false,\"mention_everyone\":false,\"tts\":false,\"position\":190},{\"type\":0,\"content\":\"Okami and I have verified v0.3.2 is stable from start to finish so I'm going to finish this break timer and then move onto trimming down big chucks of D2 based on feedback. Then we'll review the whole thing again for a final trim so I think when I'm done with D2 having you all test that would be great to give further feedback for the final trim.\",\"mentions\":[],\"mention_roles\":[],\"attachments\":[],\"embeds\":[],\"timestamp\":\"2024-10-29T21:47:21.806000+00:00\",\"edited_timestamp\":\"2024-10-29T21:47:38.722000+00:00\",\"flags\":0,\"components\":[],\"id\":\"1300939058419339414\",\"channel_id\":\"1288235003901120586\",\"author\":{\"id\":\"183261151746850816\",\"username\":\"individualcontributor\",\"avatar\":\"b7271f16ff804f9fa069bba774b3d0e7\",\"discriminator\":\"0\",\"public_flags\":0,\"flags\":0,\"banner\":null,\"accent_color\":null,\"global_name\":\"IndividualContributor\",\"avatar_decoration_data\":null,\"collectibles\":null,\"display_name_styles\":null,\"banner_color\":null,\"clan\":null,\"primary_guild\":null},\"pinned\":false,\"mention_everyone\":false,\"tts\":false,\"position\":189},{\"type\":0,\"content\":\"I have mentioned I've less time for testing this week but if there are some further updates to disc 1 or disc 2 I'll try check them out\",\"mentions\":[],\"mention_roles\":[],\"attachments\":[],\"embeds\":[],\"timestamp\":\"2024-10-29T21:45:38.136000+00:00\",\"edited_timestamp\":\"2024-10-29T21:45:43.986000+00:00\",\"flags\":0,\"components\":[],\"id\":\"1300938623595708568\",\"channel_id\":\"1288235003901120586\",\"author\":{\"id\":\"248225699909861376\",\"username\":\"awesomewaves\",\"avatar\":\"7de794a8a3e242252076a10784af0a9f\",\"discriminator\":\"0\",\"public_flags\":0,\"flags\":0,\"banner\":null,\"accent_color\":null,\"global_name\":\"awesomeWaves\",\"avatar_decoration_data\":null,\"collectibles\":null,\"display_name_styles\":null,\"banner_color\":null,\"clan\":null,\"primary_guild\":null},\"pinned\":false,\"mention_everyone\":false,\"tts\":false,\"position\":188},{\"type\":0,\"content\":\"awesome\",\"mentions\":[],\"mention_roles\":[],\"attachments\":[],\"embeds\":[],\"timestamp\":\"2024-10-29T21:44:49.386000+00:00\",\"edited_timestamp\":null,\"flags\":0,\"components\":[],\"id\":\"1300938419123257469\",\"channel_id\":\"1288235003901120586\",\"author\":{\"id\":\"248225699909861376\",\"username\":\"awesomewaves\",\"avatar\":\"7de794a8a3e242252076a10784af0a9f