            "text": "[{\"type\":0,\"content\":\"Ok so actually the dialogue boxes before the FMV load 1 list value before at 71 instead of 120. Comparing to Dash's tutorial after 3 text boxes the list is different.\\n\\nIs this normal?\",\"mentions\":[],\"mention_roles\":[],\"attachments\":[{\"id\":\"1300560498881859735\",\"filename\":\"image.png\",\"size\":5395715,\"url\":\"https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/1288235003901120586/1300560498881859735/image.png?ex=6a6e5a5a&is=6a6d08da&hm=c8f1939962bdcf83966627b5428cd5d84ebf2306a8e6b7d7344a86c53cf7ea57&\",\"proxy_url\":\"https://media.discordapp.net/attachments/1288235003901120586/1300560498881859735/image.png?ex=6a6e5a5a&is=6a6d08da&hm=c8f1939962bdcf83966627b5428cd5d84ebf2306a8e6b7d7344a86c53cf7ea57&\",\"width\":3765,\"height\":1872,\"content_type\":\"image/png\",\"placeholder\":\"zvcFA4BeqUmvdVh595Kkb2g=\",\"placeholder_version\":1}],\"embeds\":[],\"timestamp\":\"2024-10-28T20:43:06.312000+00:00\",\"edited_timestamp\":null,\"flags\":0,\"components\":[],\"id\":\"1300560499439571007\",\"channel_id\":\"1288235003901120586\",\"author\":{\"id\":\"183261151746850816\",\"username\":\"individualcontributor\",\"avatar\":\"b7271f16ff804f9fa069bba774b3d0e7\",\"discriminator\":\"0\",\"public_flags\":0,\"flags\":0,\"banner\":null,\"accent_color\":null,\"global_name\":\"IndividualContributor\",\"avatar_decoration_data\":null,\"collectibles\":null,\"display_name_styles\":null,\"banner_color\":null,\"clan\":null,\"primary_guild\":null},\"pinned\":false,\"mention_everyone\":false,\"tts\":false,\"position\":154},{\"type\":0,\"content\":\"As if the FMV is playing faster or something\",\"mentions\":[],\"mention_roles\":[],\"attachments\":[],\"embeds\":[],\"timestamp\":\"2024-10-28T20:37:43.564000+00:00\",\"edited_timestamp\":null,\"flags\":0,\"components\":[],\"id\":\"1300559145736474674\",\"channel_id\":\"1288235003901120586\",\"author\":{\"id\":\"183261151746850816\",\"username\":\"individualcontributor\",\"avatar\":\"b7271f16ff804f9fa069bba774b3d0e7\",\"discriminator\":\"0\",\"public_flags\":0,\"flags\":0,\"banner\":null,\"accent_color\":null,\"global_name\":\"IndividualContributor\",\"avatar_decoration_data\":null,\"collectibles\":null,\"display_name_styles\":null,\"banner_color\":null,\"clan\":null,\"primary_guild\":null},\"pinned\":false,\"mention_everyone\":false,\"tts\":false,\"position\":153},{\"type\":0,\"content\":\"So it should be list 141 when Scarlet says \\\"Sister Rays!\\\" but in Duckstation its two values behind at 43.\",\"mentions\":[],\"mention_roles\":[],\"attachments\":[],\"embeds\":[],\"timestamp\":\"2024-10-28T20:37:28.198000+00:00\",\"edited_timestamp\":\"2024-10-28T20:46:42.441000+00:00\",\"flags\":0,\"components\":[],\"id\":\"1300559081286795284\",\"channel_id\":\"1288235003901120586\",\"author\":{\"id\":\"183261151746850816\",\"username\":\"individualcontributor\",\"avatar\":\"b7271f16ff804f9fa069bba774b3d0e7\",\"discriminator\":\"0\",\"public_flags\":0,\"flags\":0,\"banner\":null,\"accent_color\":null,\"global_name\":\"IndividualContributor\",\"avatar_decoration_data\":null,\"collectibles\":null,\"display_name_styles\":null,\"banner_color\":null,\"clan\":null,\"primary_guild\":null},\"pinned\":false,\"mention_everyone\":false,\"tts\":false,\"position\":152},{\"type\":0,\"content\":\"Is FD Manip in CoTA different for emulator? I'm verifying list advances as expected in CoTA but I'm seeing a weird issue. Just before Cloud get's on the phone list is 55 which is correct, but when the FMV plays and the scene where Scarlet says \\\"Sister Rays!\\\" plays list stops but it's stopping on an incorrect list value while the FMV is playing, stone is 49.\",\"mentions\":[],\"mention_roles\":[],\"attachments\":[],\"embeds\":[],\"timestamp\":\"2024-10-28T20:35:03.258000+00:00\",\"edited_timestamp\":\"2024-10-28T20:46:22.475000+00:00\",\"flags\":0,\"components\":[],\"id\":\"1300558473364377703\",\"channel_id\":\"1288235003901120586\",\"author\":{\"id\":\"183261151746850816\",\"username\":\"individualcontributor\",\"avatar\":\"b7271f16ff804f9fa069bba774b3d0e7\",\"discriminator\":\"0\",\"public_flags\":0,\"flags\":0,\"banner\":null,\"accent_color\":null,\"global_name\":\"IndividualContributor\",\"avatar_decoration_data\":null,\"collectibles\":null,\"display_name_styles\":null,\"banner_color\":null,\"clan\":null,\"primary_guild\":null},\"pinned\":false,\"mention_everyone\":false,\"tts\":false,\"position\":151},{\"type\":0,\"content\":\"I've found some Audio issues in D2 and I'm up to Cloud's dream. I've fixed the audio bugs and I'll fix whatever serious issues I find in the rest of the run tonight with the intention of pushing a new fix patch later tonight. I'll be gathering the feedback I have for D2 tomorrow and working through it.\\n\\nFYI Latest v0.3.1 fixes the Chocobo Cloud bug that is a run killer.\",\"mentions\":[],\"mention_roles\":[],\"attachments\":[],\"embeds\":[],\"timestamp\":\"2024-10-28T18:01:51.247000+00:00\",\"edited_timestamp\":\"2024-10-28T18:03:03.050000+00:00\",\"flags\":0,\"components\":[],\"id\":\"1300519919275999232\",\"channel_id\":\"1288235003901120586\",\"author\":{\"id\":\"183261151746850816\",\"username\":\"individualcontributor\",\"avatar\":\"b7271f16ff804f9fa069bba774b3d0e7\",\"discriminator\":\"0\",\"public_flags\":0,\"flags\":0,\"banner\":null,\"accent_color\":null,\"global_name\":\"IndividualContributor\",\"avatar_decoration_data\":null,\"collectibles\":null,\"display_name_styles\":null,\"banner_color\":null,\"clan\":null,\"primary_guild\":null},\"pinned\":false,\"mention_everyone\":false,\"tts\":false,\"position\":150},{\"type\":19,\"content\":\"nice!\",\"mentions\":[],\"mention_roles\":[],\"attachments\":[],\"embeds\":[],\"timestamp\":\"2024-10-28T14:22:38.538000+00:00\",\"edited_timestamp\":null,\"flags\":0,\"components\":[],\"id\":\"1300464752815902731\",\"channel_id\":\"1288235003901120586\",\"author\":{\"id\":\"246736771067543552\",\"username\":\"doumeis\",\"avatar\":\"5570be7814759b69ac5a440e5cd0831e\",\"