",\"edited_timestamp\":null,\"flags\":0,\"components\":[],\"id\":\"1300248770218557510\",\"channel_id\":\"1288235003901120586\",\"author\":{\"id\":\"248225699909861376\",\"username\":\"awesomewaves\",\"avatar\":\"7de794a8a3e242252076a10784af0a9f\",\"discriminator\":\"0\",\"public_flags\":0,\"flags\":0,\"banner\":null,\"accent_color\":null,\"global_name\":\"awesomeWaves\",\"avatar_decoration_data\":null,\"collectibles\":null,\"display_name_styles\":null,\"banner_color\":null,\"clan\":null,\"primary_guild\":null},\"pinned\":false,\"mention_everyone\":false,\"tts\":false,\"position\":126},{\"type\":0,\"content\":\"OK, I think there may be another 'hanging FMV' but this time it occurs during the Final Descent\",\"mentions\":[],\"mention_roles\":[],\"attachments\":[{\"id\":\"1300248683933204500\",\"filename\":\"image.png\",\"size\":291642,\"url\":\"https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/1288235003901120586/1300248683933204500/image.png?ex=6a6e8973&is=6a6d37f3&hm=95e9408f9e258ea74cf8cf61596356841682b366f20f2c21adc878cf9c7d5423&\",\"proxy_url\":\"https://media.discordapp.net/attachments/1288235003901120586/1300248683933204500/image.png?ex=6a6e8973&is=6a6d37f3&hm=95e9408f9e258ea74cf8cf61596356841682b366f20f2c21adc878cf9c7d5423&\",\"width\":748,\"height\":538,\"content_type\":\"image/png\",\"placeholder\":\"DikOPYYEmZaCmXZ2eYl4eAZ2VTA4\",\"placeholder_version\":1}],\"embeds\":[],\"timestamp\":\"2024-10-28T00:04:03.709000+00:00\",\"edited_timestamp\":null,\"flags\":0,\"components\":[],\"id\":\"1300248683962437663\",\"channel_id\":\"1288235003901120586\",\"author\":{\"id\":\"248225699909861376\",\"username\":\"awesomewaves\",\"avatar\":\"7de794a8a3e242252076a10784af0a9f\",\"discriminator\":\"0\",\"public_flags\":0,\"flags\":0,\"banner\":null,\"accent_color\":null,\"global_name\":\"awesomeWaves\",\"avatar_decoration_data\":null,\"collectibles\":null,\"display_name_styles\":null,\"banner_color\":null,\"clan\":null,\"primary_guild\":null},\"pinned\":false,\"mention_everyone\":false,\"tts\":false,\"position\":125},{\"type\":0,\"content\":\"Disc 2 needs alot of trimming I think if you have a chance to run that? I'll be working on D1 and D2 tomorrow for a few hours but I'll likely get online tonight maybe 11.30 / 12 to fix that chocobo bug. I'll post in here when I push it.\",\"mentions\":[],\"mention_roles\":[],\"attachments\":[],\"embeds\":[],\"timestamp\":\"2024-10-27T20:00:20.253000+00:00\",\"edited_timestamp\":null,\"flags\":0,\"components\":[],\"id\":\"1300187348742570114\",\"channel_id\":\"1288235003901120586\",\"author\":{\"id\":\"183261151746850816\",\"username\":\"individualcontributor\",\"avatar\":\"b7271f16ff804f9fa069bba774b3d0e7\",\"discriminator\":\"0\",\"public_flags\":0,\"flags\":0,\"banner\":null,\"accent_color\":null,\"global_name\":\"IndividualContributor\",\"avatar_decoration_data\":null,\"collectibles\":null,\"display_name_styles\":null,\"banner_color\":null,\"clan\":null,\"primary_guild\":null},\"pinned\":false,\"mention_everyone\":false,\"tts\":false,\"position\":124},{\"type\":0,\"content\":\"Lmk if/when you push a fix as I'm actually free tonight so i could potentially do more testing\",\"mentions\":[],\"mention_roles\":[],\"attachments\":[],\"embeds\":[],\"timestamp\":\"2024-10-27T19:55:26.045000+00:00\",\"edited_timestamp\":null,\"flags\":0,\"components\":[],\"id\":\"1300186114744647772\",\"channel_id\":\"1288235003901120586\",\"author\":{\"id\":\"248225699909861376\",\"username\":\"awesomewaves\",\"avatar\":\"7de794a8a3e242252076a10784af0a9f\",\"discriminator\":\"0\",\"public_flags\":0,\"flags\":0,\"banner\":null,\"accent_color\":null,\"global_name\":\"awesomeWaves\",\"avatar_decoration_data\":null,\"collectibles\":null,\"display_name_styles\":null,\"banner_color\":null,\"clan\":null,\"primary_guild\":null},\"pinned\":false,\"mention_everyone\":false,\"tts\":false,\"position\":123},{\"type\":0,\"content\":\"Always and ever, no need to apologise as I'm just learning NoSlots anyway I'm happy to send runs into the abyss as practice and testing\",\"mentions\":[],\"mention_roles\":[],\"attachments\":[],\"embeds\":[],\"timestamp\":\"2024-10-27T19:54:02.902000+00:00\",\"edited_timestamp\":null,\"flags\":0,\"components\":[],\"id\":\"1300185766017765487\",\"channel_id\":\"1288235003901120586\",\"author\":{\"id\":\"248225699909861376\",\"username\":\"awesomewaves\",\"avatar\":\"7de794a8a3e242252076a10784af0a9f\",\"discriminator\":\"0\",\"public_flags\":0,\"flags\":0,\"banner\":null,\"accent_color\":null,\"global_name\":\"awesomeWaves\",\"avatar_decoration_data\":null,\"collectibles\":null,\"display_name_styles\":null,\"banner_color\":null,\"clan\":null,\"primary_guild\":null},\"pinned\":false,\"mention_everyone\":false,\"tts\":false,\"position\":122},{\"type\":0,\"content\":\"Yeah we figured that was the connection, with those Boat WM scenes being changed.\",\"mentions\":[],\"mention_roles\":[],\"attachments\":[],\"embeds\":[],\"timestamp\":\"2024-10-27T19:53:39.641000+00:00\",\"edited_timestamp\":null,\"flags\":0,\"components\":[],\"id\":\"1300185668453924935\",\"channel_id\":\"1288235003901120586\",\"author\":{\"id\":\"248225699909861376\",\"username\":\"awesomewaves\",\"avatar\":\"7de794a8a3e242252076a10784af0a9f\",\"discriminator\":\"0\",\"public_flags\":0,\"flags\":0,\"banner\":null,\"accent_color\":null,\"global_name\":\"awesomeWaves\",\"avatar_decoration_data\":null,\"collectibles\":null,\"display_name_styles\":null,\"banner_color\":null,\"clan\":null,\"primary_guild\":null},\"pinned\":false,\"mention_everyone\":false,\"tts\":false,\"position\":121},{\"type\":0,\"content\":\"I saw that chocobo bug on your stream earlier for a couple minutes but had to go, sorry about that. It's very likely the world map cutscenes before and after Jenny on the boat. I'll fix it tonight push an update. Thanks for running it! Hopefully you're not getting discouraged with these run ending bugs. I almost got that far on my run earlier but didn't have time.\",\"mentions\":[],\"mention_roles\":[],\"attachments\":[],\"embeds\":[],\"timestamp\":\"2024-10-27T19:45:06.887000+00:00\",\"edited_timestamp\":null,\"flags\":0,\"components\":[],\"id\":\"1300183517808033852\",\"channel_id\":\"1288235003901120586\",\"author\":{\"id\":\"183261151746850816\",\"username\":\"individualcontributor\",\"avatar\":\"b7271f16ff804f9fa069bba774b3d0e7\",\"discriminator\":\"0\",\"public_flags\":0,\"flags\":0,\"banner\":null,\"accent_color\":null,\"global_name\":\"IndividualContributor\",\"avatar_decoration_data\":null,\"collectibles\":null,\"display_name_styles\":null,\"banner_color\":null,\"clan\":null,\"primary_guild\":null},\"pinned\":false,\"mention_everyone\":false,\"tts\":false,\"position\":120},{\"type\":0,\"content\":\"I just noticed it went up on SRC so I'll send a ping <@183261151746850816> because it's a critical error I would say\",\"mentions\":[{\"id\":\"183261151746850816\",\"username\":\"individualcontributor\",\"avatar\":\"b7271f16ff804f9fa069bba774b3d0e7\",\"discriminator\":\"0\",\"public_flags\":0,\"flags\":0,\"banner\":null,\"accent_color\":null,\"global_name\":\"IndividualContributor\",\"avatar_decoration_data\":null,\"collectibles\":null,\"display_name_styles\":null,\"banner_color\":null,\"clan\":null,\"primary_guild\":null}],\"mention_roles\":[],\"attachments\":[],\"embeds\":[],\"timestamp\":\"2024-10-27T17:23:40.120000+00:00\",\"edited_timestamp\":null,\"flags\":0,\"components\":[],\"id\":\"1300147921726996511\",\"channel_id\":\"1288235003901120586\",\"author\":{\"id\":\"248225699909861376\",\"username\":\"awesomewaves\",\"avatar\":\"7de794a8a3e242252076a10784af0a9f\",\"discriminator\":\"0\",\"public_flags\":0,\"flags\":0,\"banner\":null,\"accent_color\":null,\"global_name\":\"awesomeWaves\",\"avatar_decoration_data\":null,\"collectibles\":null,\"display_name_styles\":null,\"banner_color\":null,\"clan\":null,\"primary_guild\":null},\"pinned\":false,\"mention_everyone\":false,\"tts\":false,\"position\":119,\"reactions\":[{\"emoji\":{\"id\":null,\"name\":\"\\ud83d\\udc4d\"},\"count\":1,\"count_details\":{\"burst\":0,\"normal\":1},\"burst_colors\":[],\"me_burst\":false,\"burst_me\":false,\"me\":true,\"burst_count\":0}]},{\"type\":0,\"content\":\"my only 3 noted things from today were:\\n-wig/squats\\nCould trim before Big Bro starts to walk towards cloud and after he wig has been recieved.\\n-pre-Reno screen\\nAfter talking to Barret you could effectively skip the next screen where reno pushes the button. It serves no real purpose.\\n-boarding ship\\nAfter the send off Minigame could be trimmed. Lots of nothing happening there.\",\"mentions\":[],\"mention_roles\":[],\"attachments\":[],\"embeds\":[],\"timestamp\":\"2024-10-27T17:01:00.123000+00:00\",\"edited_timestamp\":null,\"flags\":0,\"components\":[],\"id\":\"1300142217486405665\",\"channel_id\":\"1288235003901120586\",\"author\":{\"id\":\"248225699909861376\",\"username\":\"awesomewaves\",\"avatar\":\"7de794a8a3e242252076a10784af0a9f\",\"discriminator\":\"0\",\"public_flags\":0,\"flags\":0,\"banner\":null,\"accent_color\":null,\"global_name\":\"awesomeWaves\",\"avatar_decoration_data\":null,\"collectibles\":null,\"display_name_styles\":null,\"banner_color\":null,\"clan\":null,\"primary_guild\":null},\"pinned\":false,\"mention_everyone\":false,\"tts\":false,\"position\":118,\"reactions\":[{\"emoji\":{\"id\":null,\"name\":\"\\u2764\\ufe0f\"},\"count\":1,\"count_details\":{\"burst\":0,\"normal\":1},\"burst_colors\":[],\"me_burst\":false,\"burst_me\":false,\"me\":true,\"burst_count\":0}]},{\"type\":0,\"content\":\"https://www.twitch.tv/awesomewaves/clip/StrongDeterminedCormorant4Head-nzrI6sBy32OH4s0D\",\"mentions\":[],\"mention_roles\":[],\"attachments\":[],\"embeds\":[{\"type\":\"link\",\"url\":\"https://www.twitch.tv/awesomewaves/clip/StrongDeterminedCormorant4Head-nzrI6sBy32OH4s0D\",\"title\":\"awesomeWaves - CSR v0.3.0 Chocobo Costa Glitch\",\"description\":\"Watch awesomeWaves's clip titled \\\"CSR v0.3.0 Chocobo Costa Glitch\\\"\",\"provider\":{\"name\":\"Twitch\"},\"thumbn