            "size": 19257,
            "mimeType": "application/json",
            "text": "[{\"type\":0,\"content\":\"I'll try do it tomorrow but my next week is quite busy and tied up so fingers crossed\",\"mentions\":[],\"mention_roles\":[],\"attachments\":[],\"embeds\":[],\"timestamp\":\"2024-10-27T00:37:38.685000+00:00\",\"edited_timestamp\":null,\"flags\":0,\"components\":[],\"id\":\"1299894747518996531\",\"channel_id\":\"1288235003901120586\",\"author\":{\"id\":\"248225699909861376\",\"username\":\"awesomewaves\",\"avatar\":\"7de794a8a3e242252076a10784af0a9f\",\"discriminator\":\"0\",\"public_flags\":0,\"flags\":0,\"banner\":null,\"accent_color\":null,\"global_name\":\"awesomeWaves\",\"avatar_decoration_data\":null,\"collectibles\":null,\"display_name_styles\":null,\"banner_color\":null,\"clan\":null,\"primary_guild\":null},\"pinned\":false,\"mention_everyone\":false,\"tts\":false,\"position\":110},{\"type\":0,\"content\":\"Yo IC, thanks for the update. I look forward to testing it. I'll just burn it anyway tbh and give it a proper run on console to see how it goes.\",\"mentions\":[],\"mention_roles\":[],\"attachments\":[],\"embeds\":[],\"timestamp\":\"2024-10-27T00:37:13.049000+00:00\",\"edited_timestamp\":null,\"flags\":0,\"components\":[],\"id\":\"1299894639993815101\",\"channel_id\":\"1288235003901120586\",\"author\":{\"id\":\"248225699909861376\",\"username\":\"awesomewaves\",\"avatar\":\"7de794a8a3e242252076a10784af0a9f\",\"discriminator\":\"0\",\"public_flags\":0,\"flags\":0,\"banner\":null,\"accent_color\":null,\"global_name\":\"awesomeWaves\",\"avatar_decoration_data\":null,\"collectibles\":null,\"display_name_styles\":null,\"banner_color\":null,\"clan\":null,\"primary_guild\":null},\"pinned\":false,\"mention_everyone\":false,\"tts\":false,\"position\":109},{\"type\":0,\"content\":\"Saves states are fine as you run, just don't use save states from different runs because of changes in RAM as the run progresses. E.g. a bug was found in disc 2 because some variables were incorrectly set mid disc 1\",\"mentions\":[],\"mention_roles\":[],\"attachments\":[],\"embeds\":[],\"timestamp\":\"2024-10-26T23:43:27.551000+00:00\",\"edited_timestamp\":null,\"flags\":0,\"components\":[],\"id\":\"1299881111274524743\",\"channel_id\":\"1288235003901120586\",\"author\":{\"id\":\"183261151746850816\",\"username\":\"individualcontributor\",\"avatar\":\"b7271f16ff804f9fa069bba774b3d0e7\",\"discriminator\":\"0\",\"public_flags\":0,\"flags\":0,\"banner\":null,\"accent_color\":null,\"global_name\":\"IndividualContributor\",\"avatar_decoration_data\":null,\"collectibles\":null,\"display_name_styles\":null,\"banner_color\":null,\"clan\":null,\"primary_guild\":null},\"pinned\":false,\"mention_everyone\":false,\"tts\":false,\"position\":108},{\"type\":0,\"content\":\"I'm going to start a run and test it over a few days to be sure it's working before I burn discs.\",\"mentions\":[],\"mention_roles\":[],\"attachments\":[],\"embeds\":[],\"timestamp\":\"2024-10-26T23:38:25.271000+00:00\",\"edited_timestamp\":null,\"flags\":0,\"components\":[],\"id\":\"1299879843420176494\",\"channel_id\":\"1288235003901120586\",\"author\":{\"id\":\"183261151746850816\",\"username\":\"individualcontributor\",\"avatar\":\"b7271f16ff804f9fa069bba774b3d0e7\",\"discriminator\":\"0\",\"public_flags\":0,\"flags\":0,\"banner\":null,\"accent_color\":null,\"global_name\":\"IndividualContributor\",\"avatar_decoration_data\":null,\"collectibles\":null,\"display_name_styles\":null,\"banner_color\":null,\"clan\":null,\"primary_guild\":null},\"pinned\":false,\"mention_everyone\":false,\"tts\":false,\"position\":107},{\"type\":0,\"content\":\"No use emulator until we verify a run can finish Disc 1 start to end. I'd avoid using save states to jump around or even mem card saves because ideally we need a full end to end run of Disc 1.\",\"mentions\":[],\"mention_roles\":[],\"attachments\":[],\"embeds\":[],\"timestamp\":\"2024-10-26T23:37:26.891000+00:00\",\"edited_timestamp\":null,\"flags\":0,\"components\":[],\"id\":\"1299879598556708864\",\"channel_id\":\"1288235003901120586\",\"author\":{\"id\":\"183261151746850816\",\"username\":\"individualcontributor\",\"avatar\":\"b7271f16ff804f9fa069bba774b3d0e7\",\"discriminator\":\"0\",\"public_flags\":0,\"flags\":0,\"banner\":null,\"accent_color\":null,\"global_name\":\"IndividualContributor\",\"avatar_decoration_data\":null,\"collectibles\":null,\"display_name_styles\":null,\"banner_color\":null,\"clan\":null,\"primary_guild\":null},\"pinned\":false,\"mention_everyone\":false,\"tts\":false,\"position\":106,\"reactions\":[{\"emoji\":{\"id\":null,\"name\":\"\\ud83d\\udc4c\"},\"count\":1,\"count_details\":{\"burst\":0,\"normal\":1},\"burst_colors\":[],\"me_burst\":false,\"burst_me\":false,\"me\":false,\"burst_count\":0}]},{\"type\":0,\"content\":\"Do you reckon I should burn discs this time around to test it?\",\"mentions\":[],\"mention_roles\":[],\"attachments\":[],\"embeds\":[],\"timestamp\":\"2024-10-26T23:22:53.816000+00:00\",\"edited_timestamp\":\"2024-10-26T23:23:08.673000+00:00\",\"flags\":0,\"components\":[],\"id\":\"1299875936614875229\",\"channel_id\":\"1288235003901120586\",\"author\":{\"id\":\"170713534726930432\",\"username\":\".okamikaze\",\"avatar\":\"95b696448d658de94544ca767feb61f0\",\"discriminator\":\"0\",\"public_flags\":0,\"flags\":0,\"banner\":null,\"accent_color\":null,\"global_name\":\"Okamikaze\",\"avatar_decoration_data\":null,\"collectibles\":null,\"display_name_styles\":null,\"banner_color\":null,\"clan\":null,\"primary_guild\":null},\"pinned\":false,\"mention_everyone\":false,\"tts\":false,\"position\":105},{\"type\":0,\"content\":\"New release v0.3.0 https://github.com/individualcontributordev/Final-Fantasy-7-CSR\\n\\nI'm pretty sure I've addressed all feedback related to Disc 1, so given there are no more suggestions for Disc 1 it could be done? \\n\\n<@248225699909861376> <@170713534726930432> <@289891674660929538> <@785294612444479568> <@191046608064872449>\\n\\nIf you have a chance to run Disc 1 and let me know if you have anymore suggestions that would be great!\\n\\nThe most significant changes were to Temple I'd say but I was able to trim a ton from other places too.\",\"mentions\":[{\"id\":\"170713534726930432\",\"username\":\".okamikaze\",\"avatar\":\"95b696448d658de94544ca767feb61f0\",\"discriminator\":\"0\",\"public_flags\":0,\"flags\":0,\"banner\":null,\"accent_color\":null,\"global_name\":\"Okamikaze\",\"avatar_decoration_data\":null,\"collectibles\":null,\"display_name_styles\":null,\"banner_color\":null,\"clan\":null,\"primary_guild\":null},{\"id\":\"191046608064872449\",\"username\":\"hopeproductions\",\"avatar\":\"ea6a8fcda648eb65fdae9becbd0c4fe4\",\"discriminator\":\"0\",\"public_flags\":512,\"flags\":512,\"banner\":null,\"accent_color\":null,\"global_name\":\"Hope\",\"avatar_decoration_data\":null,\"collectibles\":null,\"display_name_styles\":null,\"banner_color\":null,\"clan\":null,\"primary_guild\":null},{\"id\":\"289891674660929538\",\"username\":\"teeejj0102\",\"avatar\":\"aabd4c1026f28787683c2de660f2aa57\",\"discriminator\":\"0\",\"public_flags\":0,\"flags\":0,\"banner\":null,\"accent_color\":null,\"global_name\":\"Teeejj\",\"avatar_decoration_data\":null,\"collectibles\":null,\"display_name_styles\":{\"font_id\":8,\"effect_id\":1,\"colors\":[]},\"banner_color\":null,\"clan\":null,\"primary_guild\":null},{\"id\":\"248225699909861376\",\"username\":\"awesomewaves\",\"avatar\":\"7de794a8a3e242252076a10784af0a9f\",\"discriminator\":\"0\",\"public_flags\":0,\"flags\":0,\"banner\":null,\"accent_color\":null,\"global_name\":\"awesomeWaves\",\"avatar_decoration_data\":null,\"collectibles\":null,\"display_name_styles\":null,\"banner_color\":null,\"clan\":null,\"primary_guild\":null},{\"id\":\"785294612444479568\",\"username\":\"shoutblaster\",\"avatar\":null,\"discriminator\":\"0\",\"public_flags\":0,\"flags\":0,\"banner\":null,\"accent_color\":null,\"global_name\":\"shoutblaster\",\"avatar_decoration_data\":null,\"collectibles\":null,\"display_name_styles\":null,\"banner_color\":nul