            "text": "[{\"type\":0,\"content\":\"Yes please, send them over.\",\"mentions\":[],\"mention_roles\":[],\"attachments\":[],\"embeds\":[],\"timestamp\":\"2024-10-18T07:30:34.252000+00:00\",\"edited_timestamp\":null,\"flags\":0,\"components\":[],\"id\":\"1296737172988104704\",\"channel_id\":\"1288235003901120586\",\"author\":{\"id\":\"183261151746850816\",\"username\":\"individualcontributor\",\"avatar\":\"b7271f16ff804f9fa069bba774b3d0e7\",\"discriminator\":\"0\",\"public_flags\":0,\"flags\":0,\"banner\":null,\"accent_color\":null,\"global_name\":\"IndividualContributor\",\"avatar_decoration_data\":null,\"collectibles\":null,\"display_name_styles\":null,\"banner_color\":null,\"clan\":null,\"primary_guild\":null},\"pinned\":false,\"mention_everyone\":false,\"tts\":false,\"position\":49},{\"type\":0,\"content\":\"I didn't get time to completely finish my practice today as planned. I have notes for all of Disc 1 I can tidy up and send over if they help\",\"mentions\":[],\"mention_roles\":[],\"attachments\":[],\"embeds\":[],\"timestamp\":\"2024-10-18T00:21:10.280000+00:00\",\"edited_timestamp\":null,\"flags\":0,\"components\":[],\"id\":\"1296629111057289239\",\"channel_id\":\"1288235003901120586\",\"author\":{\"id\":\"248225699909861376\",\"username\":\"awesomewaves\",\"avatar\":\"7de794a8a3e242252076a10784af0a9f\",\"discriminator\":\"0\",\"public_flags\":0,\"flags\":0,\"banner\":null,\"accent_color\":null,\"global_name\":\"awesomeWaves\",\"avatar_decoration_data\":null,\"collectibles\":null,\"display_name_styles\":null,\"banner_color\":null,\"clan\":null,\"primary_guild\":null},\"pinned\":false,\"mention_everyone\":false,\"tts\":false,\"position\":48},{\"type\":0,\"content\":\"Pushed a new update, more stuff refined up to Gongaga after temple. Warning, I haven't tested this update extensively yet but will over the next few days, but from what I have tested it's stable.\",\"mentions\":[],\"mention_roles\":[],\"attachments\":[],\"embeds\":[],\"timestamp\":\"2024-10-17T23:34:10.028000+00:00\",\"edited_timestamp\":null,\"flags\":0,\"components\":[],\"id\":\"1296617282063306753\",\"channel_id\":\"1288235003901120586\",\"author\":{\"id\":\"183261151746850816\",\"username\":\"individualcontributor\",\"avatar\":\"b7271f16ff804f9fa069bba774b3d0e7\",\"discriminator\":\"0\",\"public_flags\":0,\"flags\":0,\"banner\":null,\"accent_color\":null,\"global_name\":\"IndividualContributor\",\"avatar_decoration_data\":null,\"collectibles\":null,\"display_name_styles\":null,\"banner_color\":null,\"clan\":null,\"primary_guild\":null},\"pinned\":false,\"mention_everyone\":false,\"tts\":false,\"position\":47},{\"type\":0,\"content\":\"I wish I had more time to try it out myself, but waves has been embracing csr's longer than anyone I know so his feedback is incredibly valuable\",\"mentions\":[],\"mention_roles\":[],\"attachments\":[],\"embeds\":[],\"timestamp\":\"2024-10-17T12:23:48.983000+00:00\",\"edited_timestamp\":null,\"flags\":0,\"components\":[],\"id\":\"1296448582773112832\",\"channel_id\":\"1288235003901120586\",\"author\":{\"id\":\"170713534726930432\",\"username\":\".okamikaze\",\"avatar\":\"95b696448d658de94544ca767feb61f0\",\"discriminator\":\"0\",\"public_flags\":0,\"flags\":0,\"banner\":null,\"accent_color\":null,\"global_name\":\"Okamikaze\",\"avatar_decoration_data\":null,\"collectibles\":null,\"display_name_styles\":null,\"banner_color\":null,\"clan\":null,\"primary_guild\":null},\"pinned\":false,\"mention_everyone\":false,\"tts\":false,\"position\":46},{\"type\":0,\"content\":\"My goat\",\"mentions\":[],\"mention_roles\":[],\"attachments\":[],\"embeds\":[],\"timestamp\":\"2024-10-17T08:55:02.294000+00:00\",\"edited_timestamp\":null,\"flags\":0,\"components\":[],\"id\":\"1296396042031464500\",\"channel_id\":\"1288235003901120586\",\"author\":{\"id\":\"289891674660929538\",\"username\":\"teeejj0102\",\"avatar\":\"aabd4c1026f28787683c2de660f2aa57\",\"discriminator\":\"0\",\"public_flags\":0,\"flags\":0,\"banner\":null,\"accent_color\":null,\"global_name\":\"Teeejj\",\"avatar_decoration_data\":null,\"collectibles\":null,\"display_name_styles\":{\"font_id\":8,\"effect_id\":1,\"colors\":[]},\"banner_color\":null,\"clan\":null,\"primary_guild\":null},\"pinned\":false,\"mention_everyone\":false,\"tts\":false,\"position\":45},{\"type\":0,\"content\":\"<@289891674660929538> yes sub 4 hours should be doable in the next week or so, I want to incorporate as much feedback as I can and fix all the bugs before setting it in stone hopefully end of next week.\",\"mentions\":[{\"id\":\"289891674660929538\",\"username\":\"teeejj0102\",\"avatar\":\"aabd4c1026f28787683c2de660f2aa57\",\"discriminator\":\"0\",\"public_flags\":0,\"flags\":0,\"banner\":null,\"accent_color\":null,\"global_name\":\"Teeejj\",\"avatar_decoration_data\":null,\"collectibles\":null,\"display_name_styles\":{\"font_id\":8,\"effect_id\":1,\"colors\":[]},\"banner_color\":null,\"clan\":null,\"primary_guild\":null}],\"mention_roles\":[],\"attachments\":[],\"embeds\":[],\"timestamp\":\"2024-10-17T08:14:14.224000+00:00\",\"edited_timestamp\":null,\"flags\":0,\"components\":[],\"id\":\"1296385774081806389\",\"channel_id\":\"1288235003901120586\",\"author\":{\"id\":\"183261151746850816\",\"username\":\"individualcontributor\",\"avatar\":\"b7271f16ff804f9fa069bba774b3d0e7\",\"discriminator\":\"0\",\"public_flags\":0,\"flags\":0,\"banner\":null,\"accent_color\":null,\"global_name\":\"IndividualContributor\",\"avatar_decoration_data\":null,\"collectibles\":null,\"display_name_styles\":null,\"banner_color\":null,\"clan\":null,\"primary_guild\":null},\"pinned\":false,\"mention_everyone\":false,\"tts\":false,\"position\":44},{\"type\":0,\"content\":\"Nice thanks <@248225699909861376> !\",\"mentions\":[{\"id\":\"248225699909861376\",\"username\":\"awesomewaves\",\"avatar\":\"7de794a8a3e242252076a10784af0a9f\",\"discriminator\":\"0\",\"public_flags\":0,\"flags\":0,\"banner\":null,\"accent_color\":null,\"global_name\":\"awesomeWaves\",\"avatar_decoration_data\":null,\"collectibles\":null,\"display_name_styles\":null,\"banner_color\":null,\"clan\":null,\"primary_guild\":null}],\"mention_roles\":[],\"attachments\":[],\"embeds\":[],\"timestamp\":\"2024-10-17T08:12:11.118000+00:00\",\"edited_timestamp\":null,\"flags\":0,\"components\":[],\"id\":\"1296385257737818152\",\"channel_id\":\"1288235003901120586\",\"author\":{\"id\":\"183261151746850816\",\"username\":\"individualcontributor\",\"avatar\":\"b7271f16ff804f9fa069bba774b3d0e7\",\"discriminator\":\"0\",\"public_flags\":0,\"flags\":0,\"banner\":null,\"accent_color\":null,\"global_name\":\"IndividualContributor\",\"avatar_decoration_data\":null,\"collectibles\":null,\"display_name_styles\":null,\"banner_color\":null,\"clan\":null,\"primary_guild\":null},\"pinned\":false,\"mention_everyone\":false,\"tts\":false,\"position\":43},{\"type\":0,\"content\":\"I got up to Temple this evening and I've a lot of notes taken and some suggestions. I'll finish my practice run tomorrow and I'll have a complete set of suggestions I can DM you then\",\"mentions\":[],\"mention_roles\":[],\"attachments\":[],\"embeds\":[],\"timestamp\":\"2024-10-17T00:22:31.687000+00:00\",\"edited_timestamp\":null,\"flags\":0,\"components\":[],\"id\":\"1296267064637390971\",\"channel_id\":\"1288235003901120586\",\"author\":{\"id\":\"248225699909861376\",\"username\":\"awesomewaves\",\"avatar\":\"7de794a8a3e242252076a10784af0a9f\",\"discriminator\":\"0\",\"public_flags\":0,\"flags\":0,\"banner\":null,\"accent_color\":null,\"global_name\":\"awesomeWaves\",\"avatar_decoration_data\":null,\"collectibles\":null,\"display_name_styles\":null,\"banner_color\":null,\"clan\":null,\"primary_guild\":null},\"pinned\":false,\"mention_everyone\":false,\"tts\":false,\"position\":42},{\"type\":0,\"content\":\"I think it can definitely go atleast sub 4:40 currently. From what I gather IC's current goal is to make sub 4 possible with a sub 6:40 tier run, as arbitrary as that is\",\"mentions\":[],\"mention_roles\":[],\"attachments\":[],\"embeds\":[],\"timestamp\":\"2024-10-16T23:21:46.078000+00:00\",\"edited_timestamp\":null,\"flags\":0,\"components\":[],\"id\":\"1296251773844979712\",\"channel_id\":\"1288235003901120586\",\"author\":{\"id\":\"170713534726930432\",\"username\":\".okamikaze\",\"avatar\":\"95b696448d658de94544ca767feb61f0\",\"discriminator\":\"0\",\"public_flags\":0,\"flags\":0,\"banner\":null,\"accent_color\":null,\"global_name\":\"Okamikaze\",\"avatar_decoration_data\":null,\"collectibles\":null,\"display_name_styles\":null,\"banner_color\":null,\"clan\":null,\"primary_guild\":null},\"pinned\":false,\"mention_everyone\":false,\"tts\":false,\"position\":41},{\"type\":0,\"content\":\"how long are we estimating a no slots run on the newest version? any ballparks?\",\"mentions\":[],\"mention_roles\":[],\"attachments\":[],\"embeds\":[],\"timestamp\":\"2024-10-16T17:29:09.783000+00:00\",\"edited_timestamp\":null,\"flags\":0,\"components\":[],\"id\":\"1296163037912371312\",\"channel_id\":\"1288235003901120586\",\"author\":{\"id\":\"289891674660929538\",\"username\":\"teeejj0102\",\"avatar\":\"aabd4c1026f28787683c2de660f2aa57\",\"discriminator\":\"0\",\"public_flags\":0,\"flags\":0,\"banner\":null,\"accent_color\":null,\"global_name\":\"Teeejj\",\"avatar_decoration_data\":null,\"collectibles\":null,\"display_name_styles\":{\"font_id\":8,\"effect_id\":1,\"colors\":[]},\"banner_color\":null,\"clan\":null,\"primary_guild\":null},\"pinned\":false,\"mention_everyone\":false,\"tts\":false,\"position\":40},{\"type\":0,\"content\":\"Granted when that happens, if you're running up to the highwind I've pondered that it maybe saves or loses steps. Because it messes up that fmv after doing so too. If you didn't encounter that then maybe not\",\"mentions\":[],\"mention_roles\":[],\"attachments\":[],\"embeds\":[],\"timestamp\":\"2024-10-16T13:20:13.606000+00:00\",\"edited_timestamp\":null,\"flags\":0,\"components\":[],\"id\":\"1296100391045431437\",\"channel_id\":\"1288235003901120586\",\"author\":{\"id\":\"170713534726930432\",\"username\":\".okamikaze\",\"avatar\":\"95b696448d658de94544ca767feb61f0\",\"discriminator\":\"0\",\"public_flags\":0,\"flags\":0,\"banner\":null,\"accent_color\":null,\"global_name\":\"Okamikaze\",\"avatar_decoration_data\":null,\"collectibles\":null,\"display_name_styles\":null,\"banner_color\":null,\"clan\":null,\"primary_guild\":null},\"pinned\":false,\"mention_everyone\":false,\"tts\":false,\"position\":39},{\"type\":19,\"content\":\"Did you insert disc 2 early by chance?\",\"mentions\":[],\"mention_roles\":[],\"attachments\":[],\"embeds\":[],\"timestamp\":\"2024-10-16T13:17:39.155000+00:00\",\"edited_timestamp\":null,\"flags\":0,\"components\":[],\"id\":\"1296099743230988348\",\"channel_id\":\"1288235003901120586\",\"author\":{\"id\":\"170713534726930432\",\"username\":\".okamikaze\",\"avatar\":\"95b696448d658de94544ca767feb61f0\",\"discriminator\":\"0\",\"public_flags\":0,\"flags\":0,\"banner\":null,\"accent_color\":null,\"global_name\":\"Okamikaze\",\"avatar_decoration_data\":null,\"collectibles\":null,\"display_name_styles\":null,\"banner_color\":null,\"clan\":null,\"primary_guild\":null},\"pinned\":false,\"mention_everyone\":false,\"tts\":false,\"message_reference\":{\"type\":0,\"channel_id\":\"1288235003901120586\",\"message_id\":\"1296079583971377212\",\"guild_id\":\"936291902133796955\"},\"position\":38,\"referenced_message\":{\"type\":0,\"content\":\"The only other jarring thing I noticed was the Cargo Elevator in Junon. I guess the FMV for it moving up and down has been removed but I didn't know that so when I interacted with the button again it played a section of cloud giving Sephiroth the black materia in the Norther Crater. Jump scared the hell out me \\ud83d\\ude05\",\"mentions\":[],\"mention_roles\":[],\"attachments\":[],\"embeds\":[],\"timestamp\":\"2024-10-16T11:57:32.813000+00:00\",\"edited_timestamp\":null,\"flags\":0,\"components\":[],\"id\":\"1296079583971377212\",\"channel_id\":\"1288235003901120586\",\"author\":{\"id\":\"248225699909861376\",\"username\":\"awesomewaves\",\"avatar\":\"7de794a8a3e242252076a10784af0a9f\",\"discriminator\":\"0\",\"public_flags\":0,\"flags\":0,\"banner\":null,\"accent_color\":null,\"global_name\":\"awesomeWaves\",\"avatar_decoration_data\":null,\"collectibles\":null,\"display_name_styles\":null,\"banner_color\":null,\"clan\":null,\"primary_guild\":null},\"pinned\":false,\"mention_everyone\":false,\"tts\":false,\"position\":31}},{\"type\":0,\"content\":\"Thanks for making it, made skimming through the game a breeze\",\"mentions\":[],\"mention_roles\":[],\"attachments\":[],\"embeds\":[],\"timestamp\":\"2024-10-16T12:05:55.551000+00:00\",\"edited_timestamp\":null,\"flags\":0,\"components\":[],\"id\":\"1296081692607647866\",\"channel_id\":\"1288235003901120586\",\"author\":{\"id\":\"248225699909861376\",\"username\":\"awesomewaves\",\"avatar\":\"7de794a8a3e242252076a10784af0a9f\",\"discriminator\":\"0\",\"public_flags\":0,\"flags\":0,\"banner\":null,\"accent_color\":null,\"global_name\":\"awesomeWaves\",\"avatar_decoration_data\":null,\"collectibles\":null,\"display_name_styles\":null,\"banner_color\":null,\"clan\":null,\"primary_guild\":null},\"pinned\":false,\"mention_everyone\":false,\"tts\":false,\"position\":37,\"reactions\":[{\"emoji\":{\"id\":null,\"name\":\"\\u2764\\ufe0f\"},\"count\":1,\"count_details\":{\"burst\":0,\"normal\":1},\"burst_colors\":[],\"me_burst\":false,\"burst_me\":false,\"me\":true,\"burst_count\":0}]},{\"type\":0,\"content\":\"Absolutely, I just grabbed the newest version last night when I was softlocked in Rocket Town so I'll run through the whole thing again in the next few days and take some notes as I go\",\"mentions\":[],\"mention_roles\":[],\"attachments\":[],\"embeds\":[],\"timestamp\":\"2024-10-16T12:05:42.636000+00:00\",\"edited_timestamp\":null,\"flags\":0,\"components\":[],\"id\":\"1296081638438080573\",\"channel_id\":\"1288235003901120586\",\"author\":{\"id\":\"248225699909861376\",\"username\":\"awesomewaves\",\"avatar\":\"7de794a8a3e242252076a10784af0a9f\",\"discriminator\":\"0\",\"public_flags\":0,\"flags\":0,\"banner\":null,\"accent_color\":null,\"global_name\":\"awesomeWaves\",\"avatar_decoration_data\":null,\"collectibles\":null,\"display_name_styles\":null,\"banner_color\":null,\"clan\":null,\"primary_guild\":null},\"pinned\":false,\"mention_everyone\":false,\"tts\":false,\"position\":36,\"reactions\":[{\"emoji\":{\"id\":null,\"name\":\"\\u2764\\ufe0f\"},\"count\":1,\"count_details\":{\"burst\":0,\"normal\":1},\"burst_colors\":[],\"me_burst\":false,\"burst_me\":false,\"me\":true,\"burst_count\":0}]},{\"type\":0,\"content\":\"Any suggestions are appreciated <@248225699909861376>\",\"mentions\":[{\"id\":\"248225699909861376\",\"username\":\"awesomewaves\",\"avatar\":\"7de794a8a3e242252076a10784af0a9f\",\"discriminator\":\"0\",\"public_flags\":0,\"flags\":0,\"banner\":null,\"accent_color\":null,\"global_name\":\"awesomeWaves\",\"avatar_decoration_data\":null,\"collectibles\":null,\"display_name_styles\":null,\"banner_color\":null,\"clan\":null,\"primary_guild\":null}],\"mention_roles\":[],\"attachments\":[],\"embeds\":[],\"timestamp\":\"2024-10-16T12:04:42.963000+00:00\",\"edited_timestamp\":null,\"flags\":0,\"components\":[],\"id\":\"1296081388151242792\",\"channel_id\":\"1288235003901120586\",\"author\":{\"id\":\"183261151746850816\",\"username\":\"individualcontributor\",\"avatar\":\"b7271f16ff804f9fa069bba774b3d0e7\",\"discriminator\":\"0\",\"public_flags\":0,\"flags\":0,\"banner\":null,\"accent_color\":null,\"global_name\":\"IndividualContributor\",\"avatar_decoration_data\":null,\"collectibles\":null,\"display_name_styles\":null,\"banner_color\":null,\"clan\":null,\"primary_guild\":null},\"pinned\":false,\"mention_everyone\":false,\"tts\":false,\"position\":35},{\"type\":0,\"content\":\"I'll test it anyway but maybe it was something on an older patch version that I'm unlikely to be able to reproduce, let's see. The latest patch has a ton of new stuff to shorten the CSR even further so definitely worth a go. \\n\\nAnd I'm getting close to finalizing the whole thing because I don't want to be updating it while others are running it and getting times.\",\"mentions\":[],\"mention_roles\":[],\"attachments\":[],\"embeds\":[],\"timestamp\":\"2024-10-16T12:04:24.317000+00:00\",\"edited_timestamp\":null,\"flags\":0,\"components\":[],\"id\":\"1296081309944254494\",\"channel_id\":\"1288235003901120586\",\"author\":{\"id\":\"183261151746850816\",\"username\":\"individualcontributor\",\"avatar\":\"b7271f16ff804f9fa069bba774b3d0e7\",\"discriminator\":\"0\",\"public_flags\":0,\"flags\":0,\"banner\":null,\"accent_color\":null,\"global_name\":\"IndividualContributor\",\"avatar_decoration_data\":null,\"collectibles\":null,\"display_name_styles\":null,\"banner_color\":null,\"clan\":null,\"primary_guild\":null},\"pinned\":false,\"mention_everyone\":false,\"tts\":false,\"position\":34},{\"type\":0,\"content\":\"No i don't think so, I only pointed Duckstation to the CSR files folder for the entire time I was making these saves\",\"mentions\":[],\"mention_roles\":[],\"attachments\":[],\"embeds\":[],\"timestamp\":\"2024-10-16T12:00:13.287000+00:00\",\"edited_timestamp\":null,\"flags\":0,\"components\":[],\"id\":\"1296080257048252498\",\"channel_id\":\"1288235003901120586\",\"author\":{\"id\":\"248225699909861376\",\"username\":\"awesomewaves\",\"avatar\":\"7de794a8a3e242252076a10784af0a9f\",\"discriminator\":\"0\",\"public_flags\":0,\"flags\":0,\"banner\":null,\"accent_color\":null,\"global_name\":\"awesomeWaves\",\"avatar_decoration_data\":null,\"collectibles\":null,\"display_name_styles\":null,\"banner_color\":null,\"clan\":null,\"primary_guild\":null},\"pinned\":false,\"mention_everyone\":false,\"tts\":false,\"position\":33},{\"type\":0,\"content\":\"I haven't touched that section lol, I'll have to test the latest version. Is there any chance you just had the wrong disc loaded at that point?\",\"mentions\":[],\"mention_roles\":[],\"attachments\":[],\"embeds\":[],\"timestamp\":\"2024-10-16T11:58:48.810000+00:00\",\"edited_timestamp\":null,\"flags\":0,\"components\":[],\"id\":\"1296079902726164534\",\"channel_id\":\"1288235003901120586\",\"author\":{\"id\":\"183261151746850816\",\"username\":\"individualcontributor\",\"avatar\":\"b7271f16ff804f9fa069bba774b3d0e7\",\"discriminator\":\"0\",\"public_flags\":0,\"flags\":0,\"banner\":null,\"accent_color\":null,\"global_name\":\"IndividualContributor\",\"avatar_decoration_data\":null,\"collectibles\":null,\"display_name_styles\":null,\"banner_color\":null,\"clan\":null,\"primary_guild\":null},\"pinned\":false,\"mention_everyone\":false,\"tts\":false,\"position\":32},{\"type\":0,\"content\":\"The only other jarring thing I noticed was the Cargo Elevator in Junon. I guess the FMV for it moving up and down has been removed but I didn't know that so when I interacted with the button again it played a section of cloud giving Sephiroth the black materia in the Norther Crater. Jump scared the hell out me \\ud83d\\ude05\",\"mentions\":[],\"mention_roles\":[],\"attachments\":[],\"embeds\":[],\"timestamp\":\"2024-10-16T11:57:32.813000+00:00\",\"edited_timestamp\":null,\"flags\":0,\"components\":[],\"id\":\"1296079583971377212\",\"channel_id\":\"1288235003901120586\",\"author\":{\"id\":\"248225699909861376\",\"username\":\"awesomewaves\",\"avatar\":\"7de794a8a3e242252076a10784af0a9f\",\"discriminator\":\"0\",\"public_flags\":0,\"flags\":0,\"banner\":null,\"accent_color\":null,\"global_name\":\"awesomeWaves\",\"avatar_decoration_data\":null,\"collectibles\":null,\"display_name_styles\":null,\"banner_color\":null,\"clan\":null,\"primary_guild\":null},\"pinned\":false,\"mention_everyone\":false,\"tts\":false,\"position\":31},{\"type\":0,\"content\":\"I'm only making practice saves anyway so i just edited the story value and skipped Rocket Town. It was the only way I could figure a work around\",\"mentions\":[],\"mention_roles\":[],\"attachments\":[],\"embeds\":[],\"timestamp\":\"2024-10-16T11:55:55.264000+00:00\",\"edited_timestamp\":null,\"flags\":0,\"components\":[],\"id\":\"1296079174821220395\",\"channel_id\":\"1288235003901120586\",\"author\":{\"id\":\"248225699909861376\",\"username\":\"awesomewaves\",\"avatar\":\"7de794a8a3e242252076a10784af0a9f\",\"discriminator\":\"0\",\"public_flags\":0,\"flags\":0,\"banner\":null,\"accent_color\":null,\"global_name\":\"awesomeWaves\",\"avatar_decoration_data\":null,\"collectibles\":null,\"display_name_styles\":null,\"banner_color\":null,\"clan\":null,\"primary_guild\":null},\"pinned\":false,\"mention_everyone\":false,\"tts\":false,\"position\":30}]\n"
