            "text": "[{\"type\":0,\"content\":\"Ah ok yeah the bug starts on disc 1 and shows up disc 2 which was a tricky one to debug. You might need to mod your .bin to get past it because it's a RAM value missing, or just use a save state after that point. Let know if you're stuck.\\n\\nOr I could send you a patch to fix it temporarily.\",\"mentions\":[],\"mention_roles\":[],\"attachments\":[],\"embeds\":[],\"timestamp\":\"2024-10-16T11:51:23.217000+00:00\",\"edited_timestamp\":\"2024-10-16T11:55:23.251000+00:00\",\"flags\":0,\"components\":[],\"id\":\"1296078033773662220\",\"channel_id\":\"1288235003901120586\",\"author\":{\"id\":\"183261151746850816\",\"username\":\"individualcontributor\",\"avatar\":\"b7271f16ff804f9fa069bba774b3d0e7\",\"discriminator\":\"0\",\"public_flags\":0,\"flags\":0,\"banner\":null,\"accent_color\":null,\"global_name\":\"IndividualContributor\",\"avatar_decoration_data\":null,\"collectibles\":null,\"display_name_styles\":null,\"banner_color\":null,\"clan\":null,\"primary_guild\":null},\"pinned\":false,\"mention_everyone\":false,\"tts\":false,\"position\":29},{\"type\":0,\"content\":\"Ah okay, thanks. I've had the new version a few days but I didn't have it when I did Rocket Town on Disc 1\",\"mentions\":[],\"mention_roles\":[],\"attachments\":[],\"embeds\":[],\"timestamp\":\"2024-10-16T10:50:15.757000+00:00\",\"edited_timestamp\":null,\"flags\":0,\"components\":[],\"id\":\"1296062651331248138\",\"channel_id\":\"1288235003901120586\",\"author\":{\"id\":\"248225699909861376\",\"username\":\"awesomewaves\",\"avatar\":\"7de794a8a3e242252076a10784af0a9f\",\"discriminator\":\"0\",\"public_flags\":0,\"flags\":0,\"banner\":null,\"accent_color\":null,\"global_name\":\"awesomeWaves\",\"avatar_decoration_data\":null,\"collectibles\":null,\"display_name_styles\":null,\"banner_color\":null,\"clan\":null,\"primary_guild\":null},\"pinned\":false,\"mention_everyone\":false,\"tts\":false,\"position\":28},{\"type\":0,\"content\":\"Yes, <@248225699909861376> it's fixed in the latest version\",\"mentions\":[{\"id\":\"248225699909861376\",\"username\":\"awesomewaves\",\"avatar\":\"7de794a8a3e242252076a10784af0a9f\",\"discriminator\":\"0\",\"public_flags\":0,\"flags\":0,\"banner\":null,\"accent_color\":null,\"global_name\":\"awesomeWaves\",\"avatar_decoration_data\":null,\"collectibles\":null,\"display_name_styles\":null,\"banner_color\":null,\"clan\":null,\"primary_guild\":null}],\"mention_roles\":[],\"attachments\":[],\"embeds\":[],\"timestamp\":\"2024-10-16T08:42:01.909000+00:00\",\"edited_timestamp\":null,\"flags\":0,\"components\":[],\"id\":\"1296030380993941585\",\"channel_id\":\"1288235003901120586\",\"author\":{\"id\":\"183261151746850816\",\"username\":\"individualcontributor\",\"avatar\":\"b7271f16ff804f9fa069bba774b3d0e7\",\"discriminator\":\"0\",\"public_flags\":0,\"flags\":0,\"banner\":null,\"accent_color\":null,\"global_name\":\"IndividualContributor\",\"avatar_decoration_data\":null,\"collectibles\":null,\"display_name_styles\":null,\"banner_color\":null,\"clan\":null,\"primary_guild\":null},\"pinned\":false,\"mention_everyone\":false,\"tts\":false,\"position\":27},{\"type\":0,\"content\":\"I never encountered it myself so wasn't able to recall earlier unfortunately\",\"mentions\":[],\"mention_roles\":[],\"attachments\":[],\"embeds\":[],\"timestamp\":\"2024-10-16T02:42:58.136000+00:00\",\"edited_timestamp\":null,\"flags\":0,\"components\":[],\"id\":\"1295940019860541480\",\"channel_id\":\"1288235003901120586\",\"author\":{\"id\":\"170713534726930432\",\"username\":\".okamikaze\",\"avatar\":\"95b696448d658de94544ca767feb61f0\",\"discriminator\":\"0\",\"public_flags\":0,\"flags\":0,\"banner\":null,\"accent_color\":null,\"global_name\":\"Okamikaze\",\"avatar_decoration_data\":null,\"collectibles\":null,\"display_name_styles\":null,\"banner_color\":null,\"clan\":null,\"primary_guild\":null},\"pinned\":false,\"mention_everyone\":false,\"tts\":false,\"position\":26},{\"type\":19,\"content\":\"Is that in relation to this maybe? Unless you're on the latest build\",\"mentions\":[],\"mention_roles\":[],\"attachments\":[],\"embeds\":[],\"timestamp\":\"2024-10-16T02:42:35.645000+00:00\",\"edited_timestamp\":\"2024-10-16T02:43:11.949000+00:00\",\"flags\":0,\"components\":[],\"id\":\"1295939925526708336\",\"channel_id\":\"1288235003901120586\",\"author\":{\"id\":\"170713534726930432\",\"username\":\".okamikaze\",\"avatar\":\"95b696448d658de94544ca767feb61f0\",\"discriminator\":\"0\",\"public_flags\":0,\"flags\":0,\"banner\":null,\"accent_color\":null,\"global_name\":\"Okamikaze\",\"avatar_decoration_data\":null,\"collectibles\":null,\"display_name_styles\":null,\"banner_color\":null,\"clan\":null,\"primary_guild\":null},\"pinned\":false,\"mention_everyone\":false,\"tts\":false,\"message_reference\":{\"type\":0,\"channel_id\":\"1288235003901120586\",\"message_id\":\"1291295100823146517\",\"guild_id\":\"936291902133796955\"},\"position\":25,\"reactions\":[{\"emoji\":{\"id\":null,\"name\":\"\\ud83d\\udc4d\"},\"count\":1,\"count_details\":{\"burst\":0,\"normal\":1},\"burst_colors\":[],\"me_burst\":false,\"burst_me\":false,\"me\":true,\"burst_count\":0}],\"referenced_message\":{\"type\":0,\"content\":\"I found another bug that starts in rocket town disc 1 and doesn't cause an issue until rocket town disc 2 \\ud83d\\ude43 updated patch for disc 1 incuming\",\"mentions\":[],\"mention_roles\":[],\"attachments\":[],\"embeds\":[],\"timestamp\":\"2024-10-03T07:05:43.139000+00:00\",\"edited_timestamp\":null,\"flags\":0,\"components\":[],\"id\":\"1291295100823146517\",\"channel_id\":\"1288235003901120586\",\"author\":{\"id\":\"183261151746850816\",\"username\":\"individualcontributor\",\"avatar\":\"b7271f16ff804f9fa069bba774b3d0e7\",\"discriminator\":\"0\",\"public_flags\":0,\"flags\":0,\"banner\":null,\"accent_color\":null,\"global_name\":\"IndividualContributor\",\"avatar_decoration_data\":null,\"collectibles\":null,\"display_name_styles\":null,\"banner_color\":null,\"clan\":null,\"primary_guild\":null},\"pinned\":false,\"mention_everyone\":false,\"tts\":false,\"position\":9}},{\"type\":0,\"content\":\"Having an issue in Rocket Town after Rude. I'm not even sure what scene is playing but 2 separate events are happening and it softlocks after the fight with the one guy.\",\"mentions\":[],\"mention_roles\":[],\"attachments\":[{\"id\":\"1295844793527697590\",\"filename\":\"image.png\",\"size\":474876,\"url\":\"https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/1288235003901120586/1295844793527697590/image.png?ex=6a6e5602&is=6a6d0482&hm=b213a02bfd18cac1a8c60ba2e79567ff2a4cd7b5d8b0ba30071f8bd285b4bdee&\",\"proxy_url\":\"https://media.discordapp.net/attachments/1288235003901120586/1295844793527697590/image.png?ex=6a6e5602&is=6a6d0482&hm=b213a02bfd18cac1a8c60ba2e79567ff2a4cd7b5d8b0ba30071f8bd285b4bdee&\",\"width\":768,\"height\":590,\"content_type\":\"image/png\",\"placeholder\":\"SvgFJYBsjWq/i5iKhyiGU4iAc4BY\",\"placeholder_version\":1}],\"embeds\":[],\"timestamp\":\"2024-10-15T20:24:34.457000+00:00\",\"edited_timestamp\":\"2024-10-15T20:25:01.428000+00:00\",\"flags\":0,\"components\":[],\"id\":\"1295844793729028106\",\"channel_id\":\"1288235003901120586\",\"author\":{\"id\":\"248225699909861376\",\"username\":\"awesomewaves\",\"avatar\":\"7de794a8a3e242252076a10784af0a9f\",\"discriminator\":\"0\",\"public_flags\":0,\"flags\":0,\"banner\":null,\"accent_color\":null,\"global_name\":\"awesomeWaves\",\"avatar_decoration_data\":null,\"collectibles\":null,\"display_name_styles\":null,\"banner_color\":null,\"clan\":null,\"primary_guild\":null},\"pinned\":false,\"mention_everyone\":false,\"tts\":false,\"position\":24},{\"type\":0,\"content\":\"Reduced Rufus and after Motorball scenes, new update pushed to GitHub.\",\"mentions\":[],\"mention_roles\":[],\"attachments\":[],\"embeds\":[],\"timestamp\":\"2024-10-14T00:52:05.473000+00:00\",\"edited_timestamp\":null,\"flags\":0,\"components\":[],\"id\":\"1295187340838568022\",\"channel_id\":\"1288235003901120586\",\"author\":{\"id\":\"183261151746850816\",\"username\":\"individualcontributor\",\"avatar\":\"b7271f16ff804f9fa069bba774b3d0e7\",\"discriminator\":\"0\",\"public_flags\":0,\"flags\":0,\"banner\":null,\"accent_color\":null,\"global_name\":\"IndividualContributor\",\"avatar_decoration_data\":null,\"collectibles\":null,\"display_name_styles\":null,\"banner_color\":null,\"clan\":null,\"primary_guild\":null},\"pinned\":false,\"mention_everyone\":false,\"tts\":false,\"position\":23},{\"type\":0,\"content\":\"Fixed a bug after fighting Jenny from the block where the screen wouldn't load. Pushed new update to GitHub.\",\"mentions\":[],\"mention_roles\":[],\"attachments\":[],\"embeds\":[],\"timestamp\":\"2024-10-14T00:01:19.595000+00:00\",\"edited_timestamp\":\"2024-10-14T08:48:02.831000+00:00\",\"flags\":0,\"components\":[],\"id\":\"1295174565500031047\",\"channel_id\":\"1288235003901120586\",\"author\":{\"id\":\"183261151746850816\",\"username\":\"individualcontributor\",\"avatar\":\"b7271f16ff804f9fa069bba774b3d0e7\",\"discriminator\":\"0\",\"public_flags\":0,\"flags\":0,\"banner\":null,\"accent_color\":null,\"global_name\":\"IndividualContributor\",\"avatar_decoration_data\":null,\"collectibles\":null,\"display_name_styles\":null,\"banner_color\":null,\"clan\":null,\"primary_guild\":null},\"pinned\":false,\"mention_everyone\":false,\"tts\":false,\"position\":22},{\"type\":0,\"content\":\"Added the sleep music back in for 7th heaven and prisons.\",\"mentions\":[],\"mention_roles\":[],\"attachments\":[],\"embeds\":[],\"timestamp\":\"2024-10-13T20:26:24.919000+00:00\",\"edited_timestamp\":null,\"flags\":0,\"components\":[],\"id\":\"1295120481308901488\",\"channel_id\":\"1288235003901120586\",\"author\":{\"id\":\"183261151746850816\",\"username\":\"individualcontributor\",\"avatar\":\"b7271f16ff804f9fa069bba774b3d0e7\",\"discriminator\":\"0\",\"public_flags\":0,\"flags\":0,\"banner\":null,\"accent_color\":null,\"global_name\":\"IndividualContributor\",\"avatar_decoration_data\":null,\"colle